(1629795, 218235, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  I like how the brown of the floor and her hair match. Interesting lighting, though maybe softening the light from the right would improve it a little and remove the blowouts on her hand and shoulder.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  I like how the brown of the floor and her hair match. Interesting lighting, though maybe softening the light from the right would improve it a little and remove the blowouts on her hand and shoulder.', '2005-08-22 01:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1629797, 220286, 39349, '<td valign="top">Would like this more if the shoulder (right) was more in focus.</td>', 'Would like this more if the shoulder (right) was more in focus.', '2005-08-22 01:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
