(1629916, 221088, 22379, '<td valign="top">i love this image. The little wisp of hair makes it for me. Beautiful silhouette. <br/>Technically speaking, the storm cloud to her left is a little heavy - it might have been nice to burn in some of the other clouds around her so that the image didnt tilt so much to the left. Bit of bradP-ing in photoshop haha. I really do love this photo.</td>', 'i love this image. The little wisp of hair makes it for me. Beautiful silhouette. Technically speaking, the storm cloud to her left is a little heavy - it might have been nice to burn in some of the other clouds around her so that the image didnt tilt so much to the left. Bit of bradP-ing in photoshop haha. I really do love this photo.', '2005-08-22 02:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1629918, 221150, 39349, '<td valign="top">Lighting isn''t the best here, would have liked to see more impact with lighting on the model. I feel it would give this picture more impact.</td>', 'Lighting isn''t the best here, would have liked to see more impact with lighting on the model. I feel it would give this picture more impact.', '2005-08-22 02:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
