(1630543, 220927, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image.  Nice pose, great lighting. Beautiful model. Well photographed, with only one minor flaw, which many photogrpahers make.  Clothing Lines.  It is always best to ask your model to wear very loose fitting clothes just prior to the shoot and maybe just a house coat for a half hour or so before the shoot to allow those lines made by elastic to relax and disappear.  That, is the only flaw I find in this stunning image.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is a very nice image.  Nice pose, great lighting. Beautiful model. Well photographed, with only one minor flaw, which many photogrpahers make.  Clothing Lines.  It is always best to ask your model to wear very loose fitting clothes just prior to the shoot and maybe just a house coat for a half hour or so before the shoot to allow those lines made by elastic to relax and disappear.  That, is the only flaw I find in this stunning image.  <9>', '2005-08-22 06:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1630545, 221088, 30018, '<td valign="top">Stunning image.  Especially outside with the dramatic sky in the background.  Lovely model silhouetted with wind blowing throuh her hair.  Very nicely done.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Stunning image.  Especially outside with the dramatic sky in the background.  Lovely model silhouetted with wind blowing throuh her hair.  Very nicely done.  <8>', '2005-08-22 06:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
