(1630759, 220699, 34192, '<td valign="top">you know, what makes this shot is her smile.  You were lucky to have a willing older model that enjoyed posing nude.  There are some cloning issues at her left elbow that could be cleaned up to improve the shot.  I think the composition and crop work well.  The lighting is a little flat but does provide depth. 7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'you know, what makes this shot is her smile.  You were lucky to have a willing older model that enjoyed posing nude.  There are some cloning issues at her left elbow that could be cleaned up to improve the shot.  I think the composition and crop work well.  The lighting is a little flat but does provide depth. 7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-08-22 09:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1630762, 221047, 34192, '<td valign="top">This scores well on the cuteness factor alone.  Yuck!  Strained carrots - I''d wear it before I ate it too.  :)  Technically, it looks like the left eye is over sharpened and the right eye is blurry.  I would think this is due to aperature and post processing.  The composition and the crop work well.  The POV is perfect for this shot.  I like the use of blue rather than black to contrast with the orange - good choice.  Frame doesn''t detract.  7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This scores well on the cuteness factor alone.  Yuck!  Strained carrots - I''d wear it before I ate it too.  :)  Technically, it looks like the left eye is over sharpened and the right eye is blurry.  I would think this is due to aperature and post processing.  The composition and the crop work well.  The POV is perfect for this shot.  I like the use of blue rather than black to contrast with the orange - good choice.  Frame doesn''t detract.  7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-08-22 09:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
