(1630770, 221249, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think the light streaks detract from this image.  The pose, the skin tones, the background, the crop, all work and are well done, but the lighting forces the viewer''s eyes to follow that rather than look at the subject. Maybe I''m missing the point here but it seems to me the light is the subject rather than the model.</td>', 'I think the light streaks detract from this image.  The pose, the skin tones, the background, the crop, all work and are well done, but the lighting forces the viewer''s eyes to follow that rather than look at the subject. Maybe I''m missing the point here but it seems to me the light is the subject rather than the model.', '2005-08-22 09:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1630775, 220988, 14386, '<td valign="top">V ery pretty.  Cropping and compo is clever...left a lot to the imagination.</td>', 'V ery pretty.  Cropping and compo is clever...left a lot to the imagination.', '2005-08-22 09:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1630777, 221088, 37719, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but not spelling your title correctly makes me think you don''t care enough about your entry.  I think the composition is good and the perspective is perfect for the shot.  I like the touch of sunlight on the hair.</td>', 'Nice photo but not spelling your title correctly makes me think you don''t care enough about your entry.  I think the composition is good and the perspective is perfect for the shot.  I like the touch of sunlight on the hair.', '2005-08-22 09:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
