(1630782, 220948, 14386, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  Love the emotion and the lighting effect.  I would prefer her more to the right to leave a bigger empty space in front of her. 10</td>', 'Wonderful.  Love the emotion and the lighting effect.  I would prefer her more to the right to leave a bigger empty space in front of her. 10', '2005-08-22 09:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
