(1630784, 220702, 34192, '<td valign="top">A reference to the art school?  I go back and forth on this image - what I love is, at the same time, what I hate.  Guess that''s the point. Evoking emotion that is.  The pose of the man/boy is submissive.  I can almost see a whip in the woman''s hand.  Must be her stern expression.  Wish I had a glimpse of the face of the artist at the lower left.  Not that it would add, but I am intregued (sp?)  I think your post processing works for the most part.  I haven''t figured out the significance of the ''professor'' being lighted.  But again it goes back the submissive pose of the model.  Its looks as if a play is being put on, a play for my benefit but I can''t quite figure out what I am supposed to take away from it.  See - love and hate - I want to take something away but I''m not quite smart enough to figure it out.  Ahhh...such is life.  A 9 for making me think so much and for being interested enough to want more (the part I hate is not getting the more from the image).  I''m afraid, as with anything that requires more than 1/8 of a second, you will suffer at the hands of the voters.   Again, such is life.</td>', 'A reference to the art school?  I go back and forth on this image - what I love is, at the same time, what I hate.  Guess that''s the point. Evoking emotion that is.  The pose of the man/boy is submissive.  I can almost see a whip in the woman''s hand.  Must be her stern expression.  Wish I had a glimpse of the face of the artist at the lower left.  Not that it would add, but I am intregued (sp?)  I think your post processing works for the most part.  I haven''t figured out the significance of the ''professor'' being lighted.  But again it goes back the submissive pose of the model.  Its looks as if a play is being put on, a play for my benefit but I can''t quite figure out what I am supposed to take away from it.  See - love and hate - I want to take something away but I''m not quite smart enough to figure it out.  Ahhh...such is life.  A 9 for making me think so much and for being interested enough to want more (the part I hate is not getting the more from the image).  I''m afraid, as with anything that requires more than 1/8 of a second, you will suffer at the hands of the voters.   Again, such is life.', '2005-08-22 09:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
