(1631598, 220948, 30018, '<td valign="top">I really think that each of these nude challenges get better and better, and photographers and models get more and more daring.  The outdoor shots in this challenge are esspecially good, it seems.  She is an extremely beautiful model.   I love the B&amp;W.  I love the detail that allows me to see the water droplets on her body. I love the reflections in the water.  I love the tonal range in this image.  I love the tonal range in the water itself.  To me, this is a winner and one of my favorites.  I wish I could give it a score higher than ''10''.   Good Luck! &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'I really think that each of these nude challenges get better and better, and photographers and models get more and more daring.  The outdoor shots in this challenge are esspecially good, it seems.  She is an extremely beautiful model.   I love the B&W.  I love the detail that allows me to see the water droplets on her body. I love the reflections in the water.  I love the tonal range in this image.  I love the tonal range in the water itself.  To me, this is a winner and one of my favorites.  I wish I could give it a score higher than ''10''.   Good Luck! <10>', '2005-08-22 14:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
