(1632556, 220948, 40718, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  OK, I''m totally nitpicking here, but in the 9 or 10 range I get picky.  I wish the fold of skin just exposed on her leg wasn''t there.  I''m distracted by it.  The gradient on the water is beautiful.  9.</td>', 'Excellent.  OK, I''m totally nitpicking here, but in the 9 or 10 range I get picky.  I wish the fold of skin just exposed on her leg wasn''t there.  I''m distracted by it.  The gradient on the water is beautiful.  9.', '2005-08-22 17:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1632557, 218235, 40819, '<td valign="top">I kept coming back to this shot. I don''t know if it is the red hair, the soft curves or the movement in the right hand which conveys a sudden reaction to something that draws me back. Since it is so moving I decided to boost my vote to a 10. Thanks for sharing this with us.</td>', 'I kept coming back to this shot. I don''t know if it is the red hair, the soft curves or the movement in the right hand which conveys a sudden reaction to something that draws me back. Since it is so moving I decided to boost my vote to a 10. Thanks for sharing this with us.', '2005-08-22 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1632561, 220336, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m not such a fan of the "rib" look, but I''m not going to count that against you. 9.</td>', 'I''m not such a fan of the "rib" look, but I''m not going to count that against you. 9.', '2005-08-22 17:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1632562, 220702, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is really dark and has a real grit to it. I''m still trying to figure it out and I really like it.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is really dark and has a real grit to it. I''m still trying to figure it out and I really like it.  Good luck!', '2005-08-22 17:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1632565, 218963, 40718, '<td valign="top">Few entries are in color, this one works among the best.  The red does well with the skin tones.  9.</td>', 'Few entries are in color, this one works among the best.  The red does well with the skin tones.  9.', '2005-08-22 17:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1632566, 221143, 40718, '<td valign="top">I wish I could have seen more definition on the "outside" of the model.  It''s just a little dark (at least on my screen).  The pose and idea is great though. 8.</td>', 'I wish I could have seen more definition on the "outside" of the model.  It''s just a little dark (at least on my screen).  The pose and idea is great though. 8.', '2005-08-22 17:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1632567, 220718, 26255, '<td valign="top">The model looks very uncomfortable and the lighting could be better.  I''m not crazy about the orientation... maybe rotate 90 degrees.  I do like the cropping though.</td>', 'The model looks very uncomfortable and the lighting could be better.  I''m not crazy about the orientation... maybe rotate 90 degrees.  I do like the cropping though.', '2005-08-22 17:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1632569, 220108, 40718, '<td valign="top">The overprocessing of the model''s skin kept this from a 10.  Still, I gave it a 9.</td>', 'The overprocessing of the model''s skin kept this from a 10.  Still, I gave it a 9.', '2005-08-22 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1632571, 221237, 14620, '<td valign="top">Freakin'' Hilarious!!  And that''s all I''ve got to say about that! :-D 7</td>', 'Freakin'' Hilarious!!  And that''s all I''ve got to say about that! :-D 7', '2005-08-22 17:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
