(1632575, 220939, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love the idea here, very post-modern.  Could you have cloned out what I believe is a c-section scar?  Although as I leave these comments I see the word "mother" in the title.  Perhaps one has to do with the other. 9.</td>', 'I love the idea here, very post-modern.  Could you have cloned out what I believe is a c-section scar?  Although as I leave these comments I see the word "mother" in the title.  Perhaps one has to do with the other. 9.', '2005-08-22 17:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
