(1632584, 218235, 40718, '<td valign="top">Just a tad harsh on her hand / upper arm.  Still like the pose.  Leaving it in color did well with the red hair and the reddish floor.  9.</td>', 'Just a tad harsh on her hand / upper arm.  Still like the pose.  Leaving it in color did well with the red hair and the reddish floor.  9.', '2005-08-22 18:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
