(1632587, 220974, 40718, '<td valign="top">Great pose.  I know the rule-of-thirds, blah blah blah, but I would have centered this one.  I also think a bit more lighting or processing on the head would be better.  Still excellent. 9.</td>', 'Great pose.  I know the rule-of-thirds, blah blah blah, but I would have centered this one.  I also think a bit more lighting or processing on the head would be better.  Still excellent. 9.', '2005-08-22 18:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
