(1632590, 221148, 40718, '<td valign="top">Great juxtaposition of definition on the model and sillouette.  I like it.  Some of the edges seem a bit pixelated though.  Is this post-processing artifact?  8.</td>', 'Great juxtaposition of definition on the model and sillouette.  I like it.  Some of the edges seem a bit pixelated though.  Is this post-processing artifact?  8.', '2005-08-22 18:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
