(1632626, 221070, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a very special image.  it works on so many levels.  My only wish is that there were just a tad more light on the model to see a little more of the features of her face.  Unfortunately, in this small format those lovely details tend to become lost.  I bet it looks fabulous in a larger scale.  The trail of light on the ground is also a very nice addition to the photo. 8</td>', 'This is a very special image.  it works on so many levels.  My only wish is that there were just a tad more light on the model to see a little more of the features of her face.  Unfortunately, in this small format those lovely details tend to become lost.  I bet it looks fabulous in a larger scale.  The trail of light on the ground is also a very nice addition to the photo. 8', '2005-08-22 18:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1632630, 220784, 26255, '<td valign="top">I love the select desat and soft lighting.  The only drawbacks are the carpet in the background and you can see a little of the models shirt in the upper left corner.</td>', 'I love the select desat and soft lighting.  The only drawbacks are the carpet in the background and you can see a little of the models shirt in the upper left corner.', '2005-08-22 18:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
