(1632648, 219696, 26255, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a tad strong on the white tub and the blinds in the background are a little busy.  I really like the placement of the towel and the glass containers.</td>', 'The lighting is a tad strong on the white tub and the blinds in the background are a little busy.  I really like the placement of the towel and the glass containers.', '2005-08-22 18:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
