(1633293, 220108, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Nice lighting, lovely pose and very tastefully done. You should have spent a few more kb''s, the photo really suffers from high jpg compression, especially on her hands. Good job, just try to use more of the 150 kb we are given on DPC. Tyrkinn</td>', 'Good shot. Nice lighting, lovely pose and very tastefully done. You should have spent a few more kb''s, the photo really suffers from high jpg compression, especially on her hands. Good job, just try to use more of the 150 kb we are given on DPC. Tyrkinn', '2005-08-22 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1633302, 221088, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great composition, tasteful nude. Super siluette. Burning a bit extreme, but adds a little mood to the shot. Only thing bothering me is the jagged outlines of the girl, maybe too much sharpening? Don''t know if using more then 50kb would have helped? Great effort, this one  is going to my favorites.</td>', 'Great composition, tasteful nude. Super siluette. Burning a bit extreme, but adds a little mood to the shot. Only thing bothering me is the jagged outlines of the girl, maybe too much sharpening? Don''t know if using more then 50kb would have helped? Great effort, this one  is going to my favorites.', '2005-08-22 20:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1633309, 221223, 7543, '<td valign="top">Very unusual pose, love it. B/W high key tones super, very sharp. Love the symmetry. Really good job here, congrats.</td>', 'Very unusual pose, love it. B/W high key tones super, very sharp. Love the symmetry. Really good job here, congrats.', '2005-08-22 20:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1633310, 220382, 22379, '<td valign="top">i like this artsy take on the theme. The lighting is a ligttle harsh, but with this semi-abstract theme, i am not sure that it matters. I do wish the rod was held just a little high so we couldnt see it. This is outthere... and i like that.</td>', 'i like this artsy take on the theme. The lighting is a ligttle harsh, but with this semi-abstract theme, i am not sure that it matters. I do wish the rod was held just a little high so we couldnt see it. This is outthere... and i like that.', '2005-08-22 21:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1633311, 221040, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good tasteful nude, couple look icelandic? Lighting maybe a bit to harsh and the frame is not really working for me, a bit distracting. Other than that a very good shot, pose and feel are really good.</td>', 'Good tasteful nude, couple look icelandic? Lighting maybe a bit to harsh and the frame is not really working for me, a bit distracting. Other than that a very good shot, pose and feel are really good.', '2005-08-22 21:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
