(1633642, 220977, 23318, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but a few things distract me from "the key" which is your primary subject. <br/> <br/>Alot of distractions, I''m listing them, so that you can try to retake without them in the future. <br/> <br/>Her nails are too bright, and picking up the key is tricky. I''d probably either bring down the red in post, or possibly even have her pick a more subdued color. They look like professionally done, so would take prior planning. <br/> <br/>Below her hands is the remnants of the chain the key is on, pull that up into her hand, it makes the handcuffs almost dissappear, as it catches the light. <br/> <br/>II love the tattoo in this situation, it''s great, and only seeing half of it, makes me wish I could see more.<br/> <br/>Last, the black hair, it''s out of place with all of the reds, and whites. If it was pulled behind the shoulder, it would have been less distracting. <br/></td>', 'Great shot, but a few things distract me from "the key" which is your primary subject.  Alot of distractions, I''m listing them, so that you can try to retake without them in the future.  Her nails are too bright, and picking up the key is tricky. I''d probably either bring down the red in post, or possibly even have her pick a more subdued color. They look like professionally done, so would take prior planning.  Below her hands is the remnants of the chain the key is on, pull that up into her hand, it makes the handcuffs almost dissappear, as it catches the light.  II love the tattoo in this situation, it''s great, and only seeing half of it, makes me wish I could see more. Last, the black hair, it''s out of place with all of the reds, and whites. If it was pulled behind the shoulder, it would have been less distracting. ', '2005-08-22 22:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1633643, 218759, 29490, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Perfect lighting and crop.  Minor-minor-minor:  looks like the outstretched hand is slightly oof. How''s that for being a nit-picker.  Overall extremely well done.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Perfect lighting and crop.  Minor-minor-minor:  looks like the outstretched hand is slightly oof. How''s that for being a nit-picker.  Overall extremely well done.', '2005-08-22 22:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
