(1633848, 220472, 35645, '<td valign="top">Only thing that I don''t like about this is that her face looks out of focus. I like the pose, and I like the little hint of a smile on her face.</td>', 'Only thing that I don''t like about this is that her face looks out of focus. I like the pose, and I like the little hint of a smile on her face.', '2005-08-22 23:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1633850, 220582, 9906, '<td valign="top">Definately fits the challenge, but not a shot that I personally find all that appealing.  I guess I''m a little old school to see artistic merit in such a routine part of life.  I''m assuming that you used the flash here to catch the drops.  IMHO this gives the shower an odd appearance.  I''m surprised that you don''t have more harsh shadows behind the rest of the figure...<br/>TC</td>', 'Definately fits the challenge, but not a shot that I personally find all that appealing.  I guess I''m a little old school to see artistic merit in such a routine part of life.  I''m assuming that you used the flash here to catch the drops.  IMHO this gives the shower an odd appearance.  I''m surprised that you don''t have more harsh shadows behind the rest of the figure...TC', '2005-08-22 23:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1633851, 220989, 26255, '<td valign="top">I''ve been commenting on every shot... It''s a goal for me in this challenge.</td>', 'I''ve been commenting on every shot... It''s a goal for me in this challenge.', '2005-08-22 23:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
