(1633996, 220701, 12583, '<td valign="top">HAHA! Fantastic. I just adored this shot. I only wish the contrast was a little better. However, the  hues/shade(whatever it''s called) of this photograph work well. Plain B&amp;W would be too harsh, and this is a light-hearted, light capture. Wonderful! (Thanks for the laugh, I needed one around now)</td>', 'HAHA! Fantastic. I just adored this shot. I only wish the contrast was a little better. However, the  hues/shade(whatever it''s called) of this photograph work well. Plain B&W would be too harsh, and this is a light-hearted, light capture. Wonderful! (Thanks for the laugh, I needed one around now)', '2005-08-22 23:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1633997, 218865, 29490, '<td valign="top">Leaving the eye in was a stroke of genius.  I find the foreground arm mildy distracting, but not overwhelmingly so.  Nice tonal range, excellent lighting.  Very well done!</td>', 'Leaving the eye in was a stroke of genius.  I find the foreground arm mildy distracting, but not overwhelmingly so.  Nice tonal range, excellent lighting.  Very well done!', '2005-08-22 23:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634000, 221242, 23318, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and the braveness of both the model, and the photographer, and i know I''ll not see too many images like this in my life. But it''s very grey, not alot of contrast.</td>', 'I like the composition, and the braveness of both the model, and the photographer, and i know I''ll not see too many images like this in my life. But it''s very grey, not alot of contrast.', '2005-08-22 23:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634001, 220993, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can not help but look at this shot and feel mildly insulted for myself and others that actually had the courage to enter a nude shot into this challenge.  Most of us are not glamour or nude photographers and it took a lot of effort to put in a serious shot.  In any other challenge I would consider this thinking outside the box.  In this challenge I see it as a slap in the face.  Just MHO.<br/>TC</td>', 'I can not help but look at this shot and feel mildly insulted for myself and others that actually had the courage to enter a nude shot into this challenge.  Most of us are not glamour or nude photographers and it took a lot of effort to put in a serious shot.  In any other challenge I would consider this thinking outside the box.  In this challenge I see it as a slap in the face.  Just MHO.TC', '2005-08-22 23:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634003, 220679, 36102, '<td valign="top">lighting seems a little harsh in the center and too dark on her face.  hand position seems unnatural, very basic framing</td>', 'lighting seems a little harsh in the center and too dark on her face.  hand position seems unnatural, very basic framing', '2005-08-22 23:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634004, 220496, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the skin tones and how they contrast with the white bg.  Nice focus and dof, well done.</td>', 'I like the skin tones and how they contrast with the white bg.  Nice focus and dof, well done.', '2005-08-22 23:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634006, 218963, 36102, '<td valign="top">nice curves shot, the lighting seems a little bright on the far cheek though</td>', 'nice curves shot, the lighting seems a little bright on the far cheek though', '2005-08-22 23:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634007, 219673, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Good tonal range and and use of shadow.  I think a crisper focus would take this photo over the top.  As is, this is an excellent b/w!</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Good tonal range and and use of shadow.  I think a crisper focus would take this photo over the top.  As is, this is an excellent b/w!', '2005-08-22 23:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634008, 219322, 23318, '<td valign="top">This is quite a fun shot, the glare on the right doll is distracting, as are the clippings. I think it''s a loose grasp of the challenge however. I wish you luck.</td>', 'This is quite a fun shot, the glare on the right doll is distracting, as are the clippings. I think it''s a loose grasp of the challenge however. I wish you luck.', '2005-08-22 23:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634010, 221143, 36102, '<td valign="top">love the setting sun light effect.  very unique shot.</td>', 'love the setting sun light effect.  very unique shot.', '2005-08-22 23:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634011, 221145, 9906, '<td valign="top">THis shot is impeccibly well lit.  Great pose that leaves much to the imagination but still evokes much feeling.  Great use of the square crop.  The graininess gives the shot an even more gritty emotional feel.  The only nit I have to pick is that you lost the fingertips of the right hand in the black material.  Great job!<br/>TC</td>', 'THis shot is impeccibly well lit.  Great pose that leaves much to the imagination but still evokes much feeling.  Great use of the square crop.  The graininess gives the shot an even more gritty emotional feel.  The only nit I have to pick is that you lost the fingertips of the right hand in the black material.  Great job!TC', '2005-08-22 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634014, 220948, 36102, '<td valign="top">perfect hight of the water.  Nice light</td>', 'perfect hight of the water.  Nice light', '2005-08-22 23:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634015, 220684, 23318, '<td valign="top">Very powerful pose, the light may be a bit harsh on her shoulder, but that may have been intentional for you. Because of the title, I''m confused about the flower, it''s a bit outside of the challenge, and is distracting . It does fill a void nicely however.</td>', 'Very powerful pose, the light may be a bit harsh on her shoulder, but that may have been intentional for you. Because of the title, I''m confused about the flower, it''s a bit outside of the challenge, and is distracting . It does fill a void nicely however.', '2005-08-22 23:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634016, 221040, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and poses.  I like the angle of the light sources, although the the right side of the female model''s face seems a tad harsh.  That could be from my soon-to-be-replaced-crappy-monitor.  Nice crop, and good use of border.</td>', 'Nice composition and poses.  I like the angle of the light sources, although the the right side of the female model''s face seems a tad harsh.  That could be from my soon-to-be-replaced-crappy-monitor.  Nice crop, and good use of border.', '2005-08-22 23:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634017, 220146, 36102, '<td valign="top">very interesting, great color</td>', 'very interesting, great color', '2005-08-22 23:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634018, 219505, 9906, '<td valign="top">In this instance less is more.  I love the tight crop.  I also am glad that you didn''t neat image all the character out of her skin.  Great job.<br/>TC</td>', 'In this instance less is more.  I love the tight crop.  I also am glad that you didn''t neat image all the character out of her skin.  Great job.TC', '2005-08-22 23:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634021, 220699, 36102, '<td valign="top">I think it''s great that''s she''s smiling, so many models looked mad in this challenge.</td>', 'I think it''s great that''s she''s smiling, so many models looked mad in this challenge.', '2005-08-22 23:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634024, 221047, 36102, '<td valign="top">the food looks radioactive it''s so bright</td>', 'the food looks radioactive it''s so bright', '2005-08-22 23:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634026, 220298, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, good tonal range, good composition.  I think a slight rotate cw and tighter crop on top/bottom might make the image pop.  Overall I like this image, well done!</td>', 'Nice lighting, good tonal range, good composition.  I think a slight rotate cw and tighter crop on top/bottom might make the image pop.  Overall I like this image, well done!', '2005-08-22 23:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634030, 221013, 36102, '<td valign="top">this is weird, great imagination</td>', 'this is weird, great imagination', '2005-08-22 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634031, 219663, 23318, '<td valign="top">I think what sets me off about this image is the cloth on the floor, it makes it seem more posed than this despair might bring to the model. I also do not like the placemetn of the hands on the face.</td>', 'I think what sets me off about this image is the cloth on the floor, it makes it seem more posed than this despair might bring to the model. I also do not like the placemetn of the hands on the face.', '2005-08-22 23:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634033, 219696, 36102, '<td valign="top">beautiful, very pretty light, nice uncluttered set up, excellent tone on skin</td>', 'beautiful, very pretty light, nice uncluttered set up, excellent tone on skin', '2005-08-22 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634035, 218831, 36102, '<td valign="top">a less ripe banana would have looked better in the picture</td>', 'a less ripe banana would have looked better in the picture', '2005-08-22 23:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634041, 221138, 29490, '<td valign="top">The skin looks a little over-processed. I like the dof and focus.  The pose and expression seem a little forced.  A tight crop next to right up to the apple-bearing hand might really set this photo off.  Overall, a nice image - good luck!</td>', 'The skin looks a little over-processed. I like the dof and focus.  The pose and expression seem a little forced.  A tight crop next to right up to the apple-bearing hand might really set this photo off.  Overall, a nice image - good luck!', '2005-08-22 23:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634042, 221114, 36102, '<td valign="top">interesting light placement, though it did remind me of the gynocologist when they turn the heat lamp on down there :)</td>', 'interesting light placement, though it did remind me of the gynocologist when they turn the heat lamp on down there :)', '2005-08-22 23:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634043, 218617, 23318, '<td valign="top">I''ve actually grown to like this shot a bit more, I think the sepia does not do well for the image, and I think that using a harsher white might have done better.</td>', 'I''ve actually grown to like this shot a bit more, I think the sepia does not do well for the image, and I think that using a harsher white might have done better.', '2005-08-22 23:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634045, 221087, 36102, '<td valign="top">hahaha.  Very funny, I''m sure you had fun playing with those penguins for the shot :)</td>', 'hahaha.  Very funny, I''m sure you had fun playing with those penguins for the shot :)', '2005-08-22 23:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634047, 220982, 36102, '<td valign="top">nice water drops, good color</td>', 'nice water drops, good color', '2005-08-22 23:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634049, 221219, 23318, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, but I think that the crop could have been tighter to make it a bit better,</td>', 'I like the lighting, but I think that the crop could have been tighter to make it a bit better,', '2005-08-22 23:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634050, 219771, 29490, '<td valign="top">Very shiney skin!  I like the bg color and how it complements the skin tones.  Of course anyone wearing those shoes gets an extra few points.  Nice lighting.  I think seeing both eyes might be interesting.  Very nice photo.</td>', 'Very shiney skin!  I like the bg color and how it complements the skin tones.  Of course anyone wearing those shoes gets an extra few points.  Nice lighting.  I think seeing both eyes might be interesting.  Very nice photo.', '2005-08-22 23:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
