(1634060, 220993, 36102, '<td valign="top">a little too nude, put some skin on :)</td>', 'a little too nude, put some skin on :)', '2005-08-22 23:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634061, 221017, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the soft look and  tonal range used.  The slightly overdone highlights make this image work.  Nice crop and composition.  I''m wondering what she''s doing and what she''s looking at, I like the mystery.  Very well done.</td>', 'I like the soft look and  tonal range used.  The slightly overdone highlights make this image work.  Nice crop and composition.  I''m wondering what she''s doing and what she''s looking at, I like the mystery.  Very well done.', '2005-08-22 23:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634063, 220383, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like pizza.</td>', 'I like pizza.', '2005-08-22 23:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634064, 219322, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like your scissors</td>', 'I like your scissors', '2005-08-22 23:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634066, 220689, 29490, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Good tonal range, good use of the entire black to white.  Good focus and dof.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Good tonal range, good use of the entire black to white.  Good focus and dof.', '2005-08-22 23:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634069, 220839, 36102, '<td valign="top">the only thing that bothers me is that I can see up her nose, maybe have her turn her head a little more to the side or turn her body a little more</td>', 'the only thing that bothers me is that I can see up her nose, maybe have her turn her head a little more to the side or turn her body a little more', '2005-08-23 00:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634070, 221209, 23318, '<td valign="top">This is the only 10 I''ve given in the challenge. <br/> <br/>I likely will steal this pose in the future. I love the lighting, and the pose. <br/> <br/>I don''t like the hair much, but the exposure captures it quite well. In the future, watch the tanlines a bit, and be careful not to loose the freckles. Makes the model look less real. <br/> <br/>Very lovely shot.</td>', 'This is the only 10 I''ve given in the challenge.  I likely will steal this pose in the future. I love the lighting, and the pose.  I don''t like the hair much, but the exposure captures it quite well. In the future, watch the tanlines a bit, and be careful not to loose the freckles. Makes the model look less real.  Very lovely shot.', '2005-08-23 00:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634073, 220689, 35357, '<td valign="top">You may have actually been scoring during this shot, but you won''t be scoring well in the DPC challenge, I''m pretty sure.</td>', 'You may have actually been scoring during this shot, but you won''t be scoring well in the DPC challenge, I''m pretty sure.', '2005-08-23 00:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634074, 221241, 36102, '<td valign="top">the lighting seems a little harsh for skin tones to come out right and the model doens''t have a nice expression to look at</td>', 'the lighting seems a little harsh for skin tones to come out right and the model doens''t have a nice expression to look at', '2005-08-23 00:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634078, 219505, 36102, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped this from finger tip to finger tip.  I think it would have fit your title better and the distracting hands would be out of there.</td>', 'I would have cropped this from finger tip to finger tip.  I think it would have fit your title better and the distracting hands would be out of there.', '2005-08-23 00:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634079, 221145, 35786, '<td valign="top">the hair looks very unnatural and I''m not sure what you did to do this but you could have dodged highlights at 5-9% and possibly averted what is happening here. sorry if this is what you did, just a possible suggestion. otherwise a compelling pic.</td>', 'the hair looks very unnatural and I''m not sure what you did to do this but you could have dodged highlights at 5-9% and possibly averted what is happening here. sorry if this is what you did, just a possible suggestion. otherwise a compelling pic.', '2005-08-23 00:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634080, 220336, 35357, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice photo, it''s not a nude, unless she has a skin condition causing white frilliness around her waist &amp; breasts.</td>', 'While this is a nice photo, it''s not a nude, unless she has a skin condition causing white frilliness around her waist & breasts.', '2005-08-23 00:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634082, 221251, 36102, '<td valign="top">Light too harsh</td>', 'Light too harsh', '2005-08-23 00:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634083, 220701, 36102, '<td valign="top">hahaha, great capture...is he jumping</td>', 'hahaha, great capture...is he jumping', '2005-08-23 00:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634088, 221015, 30822, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, IMHO the light is a bit harsh on such fine skin. 7</td>', 'Lovely photo, IMHO the light is a bit harsh on such fine skin. 7', '2005-08-23 00:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634089, 221209, 30822, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. 10.</td>', 'Outstanding. 10.', '2005-08-23 00:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634091, 219505, 23318, '<td valign="top">I contemplated this pose, and you (or your model) probably out did me. I love the tonel. I might have given this more than I did, had the border been a bit less. (However it''s well inside accceptable, just think it''s unneccesary)</td>', 'I contemplated this pose, and you (or your model) probably out did me. I love the tonel. I might have given this more than I did, had the border been a bit less. (However it''s well inside accceptable, just think it''s unneccesary)', '2005-08-23 00:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634092, 221150, 30822, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The contrast is way off IMHO&gt; 5</td>', 'Nice shot. The contrast is way off IMHO> 5', '2005-08-23 00:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634093, 221237, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the white bg.  There doesn''t seem to be a complete use of the tonal range, but I could be picking a nit there.  It does seems a little more contrast would boost things up a notch.  Overall  a very nicely composed, cropped,  and posed image, I''m sure if I were a woman this photo would really do it for me :)   Good job and good luck!</td>', 'I like the white bg.  There doesn''t seem to be a complete use of the tonal range, but I could be picking a nit there.  It does seems a little more contrast would boost things up a notch.  Overall  a very nicely composed, cropped,  and posed image, I''m sure if I were a woman this photo would really do it for me :)   Good job and good luck!', '2005-08-23 00:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634095, 220985, 30822, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo and composition. IMHO the focus is abit soft and the highlights are blown out. 6</td>', 'Interesting photo and composition. IMHO the focus is abit soft and the highlights are blown out. 6', '2005-08-23 00:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634097, 220974, 29490, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose, I like it.  It seems the crop could have been a little tighter around the model.  Nice lighting and tonal range.  Very good job.</td>', 'Interesting pose, I like it.  It seems the crop could have been a little tighter around the model.  Nice lighting and tonal range.  Very good job.', '2005-08-23 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634100, 218865, 30822, '<td valign="top">Inters\esting composition. I''m not really moved by this though. Excellent tech work. 7</td>', 'Inters\esting composition. I''m not really moved by this though. Excellent tech work. 7', '2005-08-23 00:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634106, 219673, 30822, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Focus should have been more on the head rather than the back IMHO. Composii\tion dosen''t feel quite right either. 5</td>', 'Interesting shot. Focus should have been more on the head rather than the back IMHO. Composii\tion dosen''t feel quite right either. 5', '2005-08-23 00:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634107, 221040, 23318, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous pose. Very tastefully done, and it''s ALMOST good enough to keep framed in a descreet section of the house. I''m sure that she wouldn''t be thrilled about it though. I expect this to ribbon, if not, it''s at least worthy (in my book)</td>', 'This is a fabulous pose. Very tastefully done, and it''s ALMOST good enough to keep framed in a descreet section of the house. I''m sure that she wouldn''t be thrilled about it though. I expect this to ribbon, if not, it''s at least worthy (in my book)', '2005-08-23 00:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634109, 221045, 35357, '<td valign="top">I was going to vote &amp; then comment later, just wanted to put a pre-comment comment to say AWESOME!<br/> <br/>-edit:  Finished voting.  this is my favourite male nude, and I think maybe even my favourite of the challenge.  It has a schizophrenic, tense feel to it.  I definitely think this should ribbon.  Good luck!</td>', 'I was going to vote & then comment later, just wanted to put a pre-comment comment to say AWESOME! -edit:  Finished voting.  this is my favourite male nude, and I think maybe even my favourite of the challenge.  It has a schizophrenic, tense feel to it.  I definitely think this should ribbon.  Good luck!', '2005-08-23 00:08:44.000000', NULL, 1);
