(1634704, 220985, 35786, '<td valign="top">i get it.. really I do, it''s just that a lot of people don''t read the titles! <br/>Anyways, let me tell you why I marked this at a 6. The photo is not entirely in focus- in fact it seems like the background is. your highlights are very washed out pertaining no detail. I am in no way an expert but it''s your lighting I''m pretty sure- way too bright. the background and composition are both great. but your whole photo is the scar and it is very contrasty where you''d want to see it clearly.  It looks like you put time into this photo and it does convey emotion... if you get it ;0)</td>', 'i get it.. really I do, it''s just that a lot of people don''t read the titles! Anyways, let me tell you why I marked this at a 6. The photo is not entirely in focus- in fact it seems like the background is. your highlights are very washed out pertaining no detail. I am in no way an expert but it''s your lighting I''m pretty sure- way too bright. the background and composition are both great. but your whole photo is the scar and it is very contrasty where you''d want to see it clearly.  It looks like you put time into this photo and it does convey emotion... if you get it ;0)', '2005-08-23 03:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
