(1634794, 220979, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very emotive photo. Great concept and title to go with it. I really like how the mother is gazing down upon the infant. Good dof. Good choice of background, I can see where many people trying this shot would not put enough thought into the background, and it could easily take away from the image, you have avoided that nicely. Good choice of framing. Nicely done. :-)</td>', 'Very emotive photo. Great concept and title to go with it. I really like how the mother is gazing down upon the infant. Good dof. Good choice of background, I can see where many people trying this shot would not put enough thought into the background, and it could easily take away from the image, you have avoided that nicely. Good choice of framing. Nicely done. :-)', '2005-08-23 04:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634798, 219022, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Nice pose. I like the look on the subjects face. I am not a real stickler for having to use the rule of thirds, but in this case, I do find the centered composition to be a little weak. Perhaps a tighter crop could strengthen the presentation.</td>', 'Good idea. Nice pose. I like the look on the subjects face. I am not a real stickler for having to use the rule of thirds, but in this case, I do find the centered composition to be a little weak. Perhaps a tighter crop could strengthen the presentation.', '2005-08-23 04:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634801, 218759, 19831, '<td valign="top">I usually try to leave comments with some substance, but all I can say is Wowsers! <br/>...no wait, this is nice, real nice. Great lines, great lighting, great focus. Splendid composition. Just an awesome tone/feeling in the image. The cloth draped about is an excellant finishing touch. Only small nitpick upon further study, perhaps having the  cloth uncovering the end of the foot, perhaps not, I do find this a superb nude study. Overall- Wowsers!</td>', 'I usually try to leave comments with some substance, but all I can say is Wowsers! ...no wait, this is nice, real nice. Great lines, great lighting, great focus. Splendid composition. Just an awesome tone/feeling in the image. The cloth draped about is an excellant finishing touch. Only small nitpick upon further study, perhaps having the  cloth uncovering the end of the foot, perhaps not, I do find this a superb nude study. Overall- Wowsers!', '2005-08-23 04:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634804, 221151, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Very good use of lighting and editing, the feel of the image conveys your idea nicely. Only minor nitpick, I wish the left hand wasn''t cut off in the framing. Very good job.</td>', 'Great concept. Very good use of lighting and editing, the feel of the image conveys your idea nicely. Only minor nitpick, I wish the left hand wasn''t cut off in the framing. Very good job.', '2005-08-23 05:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634814, 218865, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very smart composition. Nice use of lighting, very effective. I really like your choice of framing, the comp. and lighting form nice lines and draw my attention to the eye in the corner. I find that very interesting. I''m undecided if the necklace adds or detracts from the image, so either way that''s probably a minor thing. Very good job. :-)</td>', 'Very smart composition. Nice use of lighting, very effective. I really like your choice of framing, the comp. and lighting form nice lines and draw my attention to the eye in the corner. I find that very interesting. I''m undecided if the necklace adds or detracts from the image, so either way that''s probably a minor thing. Very good job. :-)', '2005-08-23 05:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634823, 220974, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice. A great pose. It makes for very good curves, lines and forms. I like the lighting also. I''m thinking this could be very strong as a centered composition. The space at right doesn''t seem to be enough to add much to the image, there is such a nice flow to the subject, it could possibly ''pop'' more if it were to fill the frame, and have a more symmetrical space between body and edge of frame on both sides. Just a thought. I do like the photo, nice job. :-)</td>', 'Very nice. A great pose. It makes for very good curves, lines and forms. I like the lighting also. I''m thinking this could be very strong as a centered composition. The space at right doesn''t seem to be enough to add much to the image, there is such a nice flow to the subject, it could possibly ''pop'' more if it were to fill the frame, and have a more symmetrical space between body and edge of frame on both sides. Just a thought. I do like the photo, nice job. :-)', '2005-08-23 05:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634827, 220679, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very good concept. The shirt does add a lot of interest to the shot. A good pose and good expression on the models face. I''m thinking maybe it could be a slightly stronger presentation if the lighting were a bit more subdued in the brighter area, and a touch more around the face. Good job. :-)</td>', 'Very good concept. The shirt does add a lot of interest to the shot. A good pose and good expression on the models face. I''m thinking maybe it could be a slightly stronger presentation if the lighting were a bit more subdued in the brighter area, and a touch more around the face. Good job. :-)', '2005-08-23 05:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1634831, 220977, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Nice choice of framing. To me, the lighting seems to be a little too strong. Some areas along the right seem to be blown out, to the point where the left hand, and even parts of the right fingers, definition is lost.</td>', 'Good idea. Nice choice of framing. To me, the lighting seems to be a little too strong. Some areas along the right seem to be blown out, to the point where the left hand, and even parts of the right fingers, definition is lost.', '2005-08-23 05:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
