(1635520, 221223, 17837, '<td valign="top">The pose is nice, the tattoos help break up everything. I don''t like that the pedastal blends in with the backdrop somewhat. I think I would have picked a darker backdrop for this. Lighting is almost dead on. Good luck.</td>', 'The pose is nice, the tattoos help break up everything. I don''t like that the pedastal blends in with the backdrop somewhat. I think I would have picked a darker backdrop for this. Lighting is almost dead on. Good luck.', '2005-08-23 12:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635521, 219771, 29557, '<td valign="top">well, clearly the sexiest shot of the bunch. i think the shot is pretty much perfect, aside from that trailing (light?) from the bottom right hand side across the middle of the shot.</td>', 'well, clearly the sexiest shot of the bunch. i think the shot is pretty much perfect, aside from that trailing (light?) from the bottom right hand side across the middle of the shot.', '2005-08-23 12:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
