(1635526, 221114, 17837, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that you can fully portray the term "nude" when using Silhouettes. It''s a neat image, one that I think would have worked better in color. Good luck.</td>', 'I don''t think that you can fully portray the term "nude" when using Silhouettes. It''s a neat image, one that I think would have worked better in color. Good luck.', '2005-08-23 12:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
