(1635548, 221249, 29557, '<td valign="top">i love the white highlight lines running along side her body and legs.</td>', 'i love the white highlight lines running along side her body and legs.', '2005-08-23 12:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635550, 218759, 29557, '<td valign="top">most of the male model shots in this challenge are done in humor, this shot was done in art. i think its a great photo.</td>', 'most of the male model shots in this challenge are done in humor, this shot was done in art. i think its a great photo.', '2005-08-23 12:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635551, 221138, 5391, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful shot.  I love the softness, toning and composition.  Excellent model - beautiful connection with the camera and viewer that is sometimes hard to achieve with nudity.  9</td>', 'Really beautiful shot.  I love the softness, toning and composition.  Excellent model - beautiful connection with the camera and viewer that is sometimes hard to achieve with nudity.  9', '2005-08-23 12:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635552, 221237, 25571, '<td valign="top">Excellent joke about DrJones''s recent entry. On a serious note, while the whites are very good, the blacks could''ve used more contrast and toning. (Burning tool would help here). Composition is a bit off as all sides are of different lenght in relation to the model. I also find the lighting to be a little too bright. Would''ve wished for more details on the face/helmet as well.  7</td>', 'Excellent joke about DrJones''s recent entry. On a serious note, while the whites are very good, the blacks could''ve used more contrast and toning. (Burning tool would help here). Composition is a bit off as all sides are of different lenght in relation to the model. I also find the lighting to be a little too bright. Would''ve wished for more details on the face/helmet as well.  7', '2005-08-23 12:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635553, 220146, 29557, '<td valign="top">what a fantastically eerie and mysterious pose w/ the layered lace.</td>', 'what a fantastically eerie and mysterious pose w/ the layered lace.', '2005-08-23 12:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635555, 221143, 29557, '<td valign="top">not really sure what to say about this shot. dont know how the yellow light was created or what it symbolizes. just not sure i like the red colorcast.</td>', 'not really sure what to say about this shot. dont know how the yellow light was created or what it symbolizes. just not sure i like the red colorcast.', '2005-08-23 12:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635557, 218865, 29557, '<td valign="top">compelling photo. i probably wouldn''t have put the left arm over the right hand. then again i didn''t enter so who knows.</td>', 'compelling photo. i probably wouldn''t have put the left arm over the right hand. then again i didn''t enter so who knows.', '2005-08-23 12:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635558, 220988, 25571, '<td valign="top">interesting composition. too bad the buttcheeks are cute half-way. I would''ve prefered seeing everything or no ''Crap''. Throws off the composition a little. Focus is off or soft on the face and since this could be considered a portrait, the eyes could''ve used some more sparkle.  Skin is very faded (use of a gold umbrella to bounce light would greatly help).  Model''s expression is quite good. 7</td>', 'interesting composition. too bad the buttcheeks are cute half-way. I would''ve prefered seeing everything or no ''Crap''. Throws off the composition a little. Focus is off or soft on the face and since this could be considered a portrait, the eyes could''ve used some more sparkle.  Skin is very faded (use of a gold umbrella to bounce light would greatly help).  Model''s expression is quite good. 7', '2005-08-23 12:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635559, 220075, 29557, '<td valign="top">you know i only wish i had the ..uh... yea .. to do this on laundry day. i just hate doing laundry w/o washing everytthing.</td>', 'you know i only wish i had the ..uh... yea .. to do this on laundry day. i just hate doing laundry w/o washing everytthing.', '2005-08-23 12:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
