(1635571, 220267, 25571, '<td valign="top">Good Blacks, whites could''ve use a little more punch. I find the composition lacking movement, as it concentrates on the main body of the model rather then on the flow of her movements. Small details like seeing the model''s pants and having the head cut brings down the score for me. 5</td>', 'Good Blacks, whites could''ve use a little more punch. I find the composition lacking movement, as it concentrates on the main body of the model rather then on the flow of her movements. Small details like seeing the model''s pants and having the head cut brings down the score for me. 5', '2005-08-23 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635572, 220496, 29557, '<td valign="top">why was it necessary to have this photo validated? in any case, seems like the iso setting was a bit high because noise is noticeable. still a very nice shot.</td>', 'why was it necessary to have this photo validated? in any case, seems like the iso setting was a bit high because noise is noticeable. still a very nice shot.', '2005-08-23 12:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
