(1635585, 220699, 29557, '<td valign="top">i give it a 10!</td>', 'i give it a 10!', '2005-08-23 12:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635586, 221145, 25571, '<td valign="top">Intriguing position of the model. gives the picture an interesting look. Lighting unfortunatly doesn''t seem enought and doesn''t allow for good whites. Spots on the lens and imperfections on the drap (black) on the right hand, as well as a little framing problem (more space on the right, more on the top). One thing that also bugs me is the lack of sens of depth in the picture. 6</td>', 'Intriguing position of the model. gives the picture an interesting look. Lighting unfortunatly doesn''t seem enought and doesn''t allow for good whites. Spots on the lens and imperfections on the drap (black) on the right hand, as well as a little framing problem (more space on the right, more on the top). One thing that also bugs me is the lack of sens of depth in the picture. 6', '2005-08-23 12:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635589, 219344, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very crips lighting. Makes the skin soft and uniform, nice work. I find the composition to be lacking a little bit tho, as the framing and model position is a bit off (too much to the left). Eyes of the child are great. 8</td>', 'Very crips lighting. Makes the skin soft and uniform, nice work. I find the composition to be lacking a little bit tho, as the framing and model position is a bit off (too much to the left). Eyes of the child are great. 8', '2005-08-23 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635592, 220496, 25571, '<td valign="top">Composition is interesting, unfortunatly i do not enjoy the way the face was cut (cutting parts of the upper lips take away from the ''erotica'' feel for the picture). Lighting is somewhat weak as it brings good blacks but too much whites. A bit void on the left makes this picture a little too open for my taste. 6</td>', 'Composition is interesting, unfortunatly i do not enjoy the way the face was cut (cutting parts of the upper lips take away from the ''erotica'' feel for the picture). Lighting is somewhat weak as it brings good blacks but too much whites. A bit void on the left makes this picture a little too open for my taste. 6', '2005-08-23 12:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635602, 221186, 25571, '<td valign="top">very good composition of the body, reminescent of a painting. Lighting is quite appealing and reflects the skin and imperfections, giving this picture lots of ''romance''.  The black void gives good tastes as well and makes this picture a classic. The frame also works very well, except on the left side, over the model''s body, where there is a feel of overlaping. 8</td>', 'very good composition of the body, reminescent of a painting. Lighting is quite appealing and reflects the skin and imperfections, giving this picture lots of ''romance''.  The black void gives good tastes as well and makes this picture a classic. The frame also works very well, except on the left side, over the model''s body, where there is a feel of overlaping. 8', '2005-08-23 12:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1635630, 221187, 30625, '<td valign="top">I just dont understand the pose here. Maybe just too centered. As for the concept of highlight or hi-key I think rethinking the lighting scheme would have enhanced it better. The shadows in the background are distracting. Kudos for getting a model to do the shoot.</td>', 'I just dont understand the pose here. Maybe just too centered. As for the concept of highlight or hi-key I think rethinking the lighting scheme would have enhanced it better. The shadows in the background are distracting. Kudos for getting a model to do the shoot.', '2005-08-23 13:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
