(1636040, 218406, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the softness, and the way her hair is hanging down like Lady Godiva, love the lighting, love the color treatment, especially love the sensitive treatment of the challenge subject.</td>', 'I love the softness, and the way her hair is hanging down like Lady Godiva, love the lighting, love the color treatment, especially love the sensitive treatment of the challenge subject.', '2005-08-23 15:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636051, 218235, 2553, '<td valign="top">Quite a beautiful young woman.  I love the fact that the color of the floor in front of her  is very nearly the color of her hair, it complements her wonderfully.  Great lighting. <br/> <br/> The only nitpick I have is that the floor behind her looks kind of washed out.  I would have preferred to see the black draped all the way up to her rear end, or to see the same "richness" in the floor that I see in the foreground.  Don''t fret about my "nitpicking" though, I  gave you a 10.</td>', 'Quite a beautiful young woman.  I love the fact that the color of the floor in front of her  is very nearly the color of her hair, it complements her wonderfully.  Great lighting.   The only nitpick I have is that the floor behind her looks kind of washed out.  I would have preferred to see the black draped all the way up to her rear end, or to see the same "richness" in the floor that I see in the foreground.  Don''t fret about my "nitpicking" though, I  gave you a 10.', '2005-08-23 15:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636057, 221011, 25571, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. the background gives a very warm feeling to the shot. Its unfortunate the focus is so soft. Could''ve used some more sharpness on the skin, or less, depending on the idea behind the shot. Feels a little bit uncoordinated due to the side of the window seen on the background. Very nice non the less. 7</td>', 'Cool idea. the background gives a very warm feeling to the shot. Its unfortunate the focus is so soft. Could''ve used some more sharpness on the skin, or less, depending on the idea behind the shot. Feels a little bit uncoordinated due to the side of the window seen on the background. Very nice non the less. 7', '2005-08-23 15:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636059, 221148, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I completely love the concept, I would have liked to have seen a little tighter crop on the right.  It just looks like there is too much light space there - it keeps drawing my eyes away from the figure.<br/> <br/>I do like the shot, love the silhouette look, and the expressiveness of the woman, and especially love the color treatment.    9</td>', 'Though I completely love the concept, I would have liked to have seen a little tighter crop on the right.  It just looks like there is too much light space there - it keeps drawing my eyes away from the figure. I do like the shot, love the silhouette look, and the expressiveness of the woman, and especially love the color treatment.    9', '2005-08-23 15:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636062, 220844, 25571, '<td valign="top">The picture seems of very poor quality, due to grain and confinment. The frame doesn''t work very well because of the black top portion of the shot, where we don''t actually see the frame. The desaturation of the whole shot except the eyeband is a nice touch, but i feel the colour is too rich and doesn''t quite work properly. A wider composition could''ve helped here. Nice job non the less. 5</td>', 'The picture seems of very poor quality, due to grain and confinment. The frame doesn''t work very well because of the black top portion of the shot, where we don''t actually see the frame. The desaturation of the whole shot except the eyeband is a nice touch, but i feel the colour is too rich and doesn''t quite work properly. A wider composition could''ve helped here. Nice job non the less. 5', '2005-08-23 15:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636067, 220985, 25571, '<td valign="top">Lighting is interesting, if perharps a little ''uni-sided''. I feel the loss of the right side of the body to the darkness is a nice idea, but it is unfortunate that we can still see it. background is cool (ciment?) and makes for a good difference with the body. Frame is a bit too present and doesn''t offer enought ''room'' for the picture. 6</td>', 'Lighting is interesting, if perharps a little ''uni-sided''. I feel the loss of the right side of the body to the darkness is a nice idea, but it is unfortunate that we can still see it. background is cool (ciment?) and makes for a good difference with the body. Frame is a bit too present and doesn''t offer enought ''room'' for the picture. 6', '2005-08-23 15:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636069, 221253, 25571, '<td valign="top">Very good europeen feel to this picture. COlours are sharp both on the cloth and on the skin. Perharps a tiny bit overexposed and some light wash on the arm and leg. For the purpose of the shot, a lighter background could''ve helped, so would a framing. Nice work! 7</td>', 'Very good europeen feel to this picture. COlours are sharp both on the cloth and on the skin. Perharps a tiny bit overexposed and some light wash on the arm and leg. For the purpose of the shot, a lighter background could''ve helped, so would a framing. Nice work! 7', '2005-08-23 15:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636070, 219771, 2553, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about her "pose", or the apparent "seam" in the backdrop behind her, but your lighting, exposure and black and white treatment of your model are just stunning. 9</td>', 'Not crazy about her "pose", or the apparent "seam" in the backdrop behind her, but your lighting, exposure and black and white treatment of your model are just stunning. 9', '2005-08-23 15:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636072, 219720, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Although i do not feel this actually represents a ''Nude'' theme, it does let the audiance ''think'' of it that way. Colours are dull and composition is off. I feel the idea is pretty cool, but would require some rethinking to make it a better work. 4</td>', 'Interesting idea. Although i do not feel this actually represents a ''Nude'' theme, it does let the audiance ''think'' of it that way. Colours are dull and composition is off. I feel the idea is pretty cool, but would require some rethinking to make it a better work. 4', '2005-08-23 15:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636074, 220770, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, innocent and "fairy-like".  Love the somewhat subdued colors that almost look hand-tinted.  9</td>', 'Very sweet, innocent and "fairy-like".  Love the somewhat subdued colors that almost look hand-tinted.  9', '2005-08-23 15:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636078, 221045, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting work on the grain and finish of this picture. I get a feeling of helplesness and pain. Colours are good to portray that illusion as it can represent the fires of hell, or the light ened path to redemption. Composition is good as it lets lots of room for thinking and properly feel the the model''s emotions. I am not sure why, but i think i would,ve liked a frame on this shot. I really like this. 8</td>', 'Interesting work on the grain and finish of this picture. I get a feeling of helplesness and pain. Colours are good to portray that illusion as it can represent the fires of hell, or the light ened path to redemption. Composition is good as it lets lots of room for thinking and properly feel the the model''s emotions. I am not sure why, but i think i would,ve liked a frame on this shot. I really like this. 8', '2005-08-23 15:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636080, 220927, 2553, '<td valign="top">Back for a second look, and to comment - love the strong light from what seems to be a window, and the way it lights her body.  Her pose looks a bit forced, but not entirely un-natural.  Love the simplicity of the white walls and door.   9</td>', 'Back for a second look, and to comment - love the strong light from what seems to be a window, and the way it lights her body.  Her pose looks a bit forced, but not entirely un-natural.  Love the simplicity of the white walls and door.   9', '2005-08-23 15:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636082, 221151, 25571, '<td valign="top">Quite cool. Scary. The idea is interesting and the lighting is nice. Unfortunatly, the imagine is rather soft and i would''ve wished for more light on the back of the model, to show more muscles. Composition is good, but framing is not. The figures being cut is unfortunate and takes a lot away from the figure. A slightly larger frame could''ve helped on this matter as well. Nice work! 7</td>', 'Quite cool. Scary. The idea is interesting and the lighting is nice. Unfortunatly, the imagine is rather soft and i would''ve wished for more light on the back of the model, to show more muscles. Composition is good, but framing is not. The figures being cut is unfortunate and takes a lot away from the figure. A slightly larger frame could''ve helped on this matter as well. Nice work! 7', '2005-08-23 15:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636089, 220389, 2553, '<td valign="top">Incredible, just incredible. Perfect lighting, perfect form.  Lovely shot.  10</td>', 'Incredible, just incredible. Perfect lighting, perfect form.  Lovely shot.  10', '2005-08-23 15:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636104, 220839, 2553, '<td valign="top">May I be honest? <br/> <br/>Absolutely lovely lighting and exposure, and though I like the "pose", i wish she was just a bit more angled to her right, and had her head kind of arched back more.  The way it is - the deep shadow on her neck is exactly in the shape of an arrow, and appears to be pointing towards her nostrils, and try as I might, my eyes keep ending up looking there.    8.</td>', 'May I be honest?  Absolutely lovely lighting and exposure, and though I like the "pose", i wish she was just a bit more angled to her right, and had her head kind of arched back more.  The way it is - the deep shadow on her neck is exactly in the shape of an arrow, and appears to be pointing towards her nostrils, and try as I might, my eyes keep ending up looking there.    8.', '2005-08-23 15:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636106, 220701, 2553, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  I love it.  Pretty darn good composition for someone jumping in the air like that!  Priceless expression on your face too - well done.    9</td>', 'Hilarious!  I love it.  Pretty darn good composition for someone jumping in the air like that!  Priceless expression on your face too - well done.    9', '2005-08-23 15:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636109, 221145, 37719, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Nice imagery!  My only criticism is the loss of the fingertips - they look cut off and not hidden - did not influence my scrore though. 10</td>', 'Well done!  Nice imagery!  My only criticism is the loss of the fingertips - they look cut off and not hidden - did not influence my scrore though. 10', '2005-08-23 15:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636111, 221223, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The pose is creative and unique!  The choice of black and white is perfect.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The pose is creative and unique!  The choice of black and white is perfect.  Well done!', '2005-08-23 15:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636113, 220770, 34659, '<td valign="top">This really is a beautifully natural image.  I love the muted tones and the alibaster skin - makes for a nice contrast against the ground.</td>', 'This really is a beautifully natural image.  I love the muted tones and the alibaster skin - makes for a nice contrast against the ground.', '2005-08-23 15:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636115, 220146, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Well composed.  Great job! 10</td>', 'Very nice image.  Well composed.  Great job! 10', '2005-08-23 15:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636118, 221088, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.  The sharp focus on the grass,  her hair blowing in the wind, and the light hitting her hair,  really make this.  Quite a pleasing composition.   9</td>', 'Very lovely.  The sharp focus on the grass,  her hair blowing in the wind, and the light hitting her hair,  really make this.  Quite a pleasing composition.   9', '2005-08-23 15:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
