(1636120, 221223, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is just Killer. Wonderful idea to sit on the column. Im sure it was rather uncomfortable sitting like this, but your model (or self) is in great shape so maybe it was easy.  Art pure and simple. 10</td>', 'This is just Killer. Wonderful idea to sit on the column. Im sure it was rather uncomfortable sitting like this, but your model (or self) is in great shape so maybe it was easy.  Art pure and simple. 10', '2005-08-23 15:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
