(1636138, 221013, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is TOTALLY AWESOME!  WOW...  This definitely will ribbon - and it''s only the 3rd image I''ve seen.  Bumping up to 10.  Not to be indelicate, but the breasts look so real - even have stretch marks/veins.  Very impressive illusion.</td>', 'This is TOTALLY AWESOME!  WOW...  This definitely will ribbon - and it''s only the 3rd image I''ve seen.  Bumping up to 10.  Not to be indelicate, but the breasts look so real - even have stretch marks/veins.  Very impressive illusion.', '2005-08-23 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
