(1636145, 220844, 34659, '<td valign="top">There is something very mysterious and naughty about the red silk blindfold.  Great use of selective desat.   The model appears so soft and innocent against the bold and brazen red blindfold.  Very nice job.  Bumping up.</td>', 'There is something very mysterious and naughty about the red silk blindfold.  Great use of selective desat.   The model appears so soft and innocent against the bold and brazen red blindfold.  Very nice job.  Bumping up.', '2005-08-23 15:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
