(1636154, 219771, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think I know whose shot this is...  Unmistakeable style and shoes.  If I''m wrong, then please take it as a compliment, because it''s meant as one.  Very seductive pose and pleasing tones.  Perfect lighting.  Beautiful job.  Bumping up.</td>', 'I think I know whose shot this is...  Unmistakeable style and shoes.  If I''m wrong, then please take it as a compliment, because it''s meant as one.  Very seductive pose and pleasing tones.  Perfect lighting.  Beautiful job.  Bumping up.', '2005-08-23 15:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636158, 220146, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow...  So erotic and mysterious...  Excellent...</td>', 'Wow...  So erotic and mysterious...  Excellent...', '2005-08-23 15:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636165, 221087, 2612, '<td valign="top">I usually vote down the ''clever'' images, probably because I''m not that clever, but in this case I''m not going to. The positioning of the beguins and the way they are lit is good. The little guy trailing behind adds some drama. And most important, it made me smile. Thanks!</td>', 'I usually vote down the ''clever'' images, probably because I''m not that clever, but in this case I''m not going to. The positioning of the beguins and the way they are lit is good. The little guy trailing behind adds some drama. And most important, it made me smile. Thanks!', '2005-08-23 16:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636167, 220306, 37961, '<td valign="top">Oh gosh thats funny. I recognize this style from the illusions challenge. This one is equally good.</td>', 'Oh gosh thats funny. I recognize this style from the illusions challenge. This one is equally good.', '2005-08-23 16:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636170, 221015, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait.  The darker suntanned forearms are a bit of a distraction against the otherwise soft alibaster skin.  The woman must be very tall, as she has very long upper arms - although it could be an optical illusion due to the pose.  Lighting is perfect and I love the tones.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait.  The darker suntanned forearms are a bit of a distraction against the otherwise soft alibaster skin.  The woman must be very tall, as she has very long upper arms - although it could be an optical illusion due to the pose.  Lighting is perfect and I love the tones.', '2005-08-23 16:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636171, 221040, 37961, '<td valign="top">Love the title, and the posing here. The light is excellent as are the expression. A keepsake forever for the new family.</td>', 'Love the title, and the posing here. The light is excellent as are the expression. A keepsake forever for the new family.', '2005-08-23 16:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636173, 218235, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting &amp; lines.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting & lines.', '2005-08-23 16:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636176, 219663, 34659, '<td valign="top">Powerfully emotional shot.  Something I can definitely identify with.  Great capture.</td>', 'Powerfully emotional shot.  Something I can definitely identify with.  Great capture.', '2005-08-23 16:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636181, 220982, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very nice minimalist shot.  I''d almost like to see the model shifter further to the right though, to allow more negative space and compliment the beautiful line.</td>', 'Very nice minimalist shot.  I''d almost like to see the model shifter further to the right though, to allow more negative space and compliment the beautiful line.', '2005-08-23 16:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
