(1636183, 221114, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a very unusual shot.  I can''t say that I don''t like it - because I do.  I think the B/W works well.  It reminds me of Carmen Miranda though, with the illusion of the headdress.  Still, a nice piece with graceful lines.</td>', 'This is a very unusual shot.  I can''t say that I don''t like it - because I do.  I think the B/W works well.  It reminds me of Carmen Miranda though, with the illusion of the headdress.  Still, a nice piece with graceful lines.', '2005-08-23 16:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
