(1636201, 221151, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the idea and the pose, but the facial expression and makeup just doesn''t quite make the illusion for me.  I envision a more gruesome and evil expression and a more tempting and beautiful pose.  Perhaps a little more light would help.  Still, a very strong entry.  (I think I know whose work this is, but am not sure - I''m anxious to see if I''m right.  Don''t worry - it''s a compliment either way!)</td>', 'Love the idea and the pose, but the facial expression and makeup just doesn''t quite make the illusion for me.  I envision a more gruesome and evil expression and a more tempting and beautiful pose.  Perhaps a little more light would help.  Still, a very strong entry.  (I think I know whose work this is, but am not sure - I''m anxious to see if I''m right.  Don''t worry - it''s a compliment either way!)', '2005-08-23 16:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
