(1636222, 221104, 34659, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot bothers me - not really sure what it is though.  I really like the mythological reference and the shot appears to be quite good technically.  I think perhaps it is the color tones - they seem to be not quite sepia and not quite rosy.  The movement of the feet are also a bit of a distraction.  HOWEVER, the overall mood and feel of the piece is very strong and emotive.  Nice job.</td>', 'Something about this shot bothers me - not really sure what it is though.  I really like the mythological reference and the shot appears to be quite good technically.  I think perhaps it is the color tones - they seem to be not quite sepia and not quite rosy.  The movement of the feet are also a bit of a distraction.  HOWEVER, the overall mood and feel of the piece is very strong and emotive.  Nice job.', '2005-08-23 16:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
