(1636578, 221047, 25571, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what to say about this picture. I actually find it a little gross. technically speaking, the composition is nice, although its a little wierd that the left side is cut the way it is (barely skin cut). the purple is perharps a little too purple rather then giving a ''Sepia in purple tone look''. DOF is quite nice, although i''d wish for a completly body in focus. Since its a portrait, some better lighting in the eyes would''ve helped some. 6</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what to say about this picture. I actually find it a little gross. technically speaking, the composition is nice, although its a little wierd that the left side is cut the way it is (barely skin cut). the purple is perharps a little too purple rather then giving a ''Sepia in purple tone look''. DOF is quite nice, although i''d wish for a completly body in focus. Since its a portrait, some better lighting in the eyes would''ve helped some. 6', '2005-08-23 18:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
