(1636584, 220656, 9690, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I like it alot~! 9</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I like it alot~! 9', '2005-08-23 18:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636585, 221013, 25571, '<td valign="top">This is quite the interesting shot. I''d be very interested in knowing how this was accomplished. Composition-wise, i find the shot''s lighting a little dull but well mastered. The picture feels more like a Tutorial (on how to do the zipper thing) rather then some sort of art. Overall, quite nice. 7</td>', 'This is quite the interesting shot. I''d be very interested in knowing how this was accomplished. Composition-wise, i find the shot''s lighting a little dull but well mastered. The picture feels more like a Tutorial (on how to do the zipper thing) rather then some sort of art. Overall, quite nice. 7', '2005-08-23 18:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
