(1636603, 220374, 25571, '<td valign="top">Idea is nice, but i find the lighting too soft and not strong enought. The frame is interesting (overlay) but doesn''t give much to the picture, yet a suspect no frame would not be as good looking. Small details like the left hand, or the tie''s tip''s shadow on the cheek makes this light study less then perfect. 6</td>', 'Idea is nice, but i find the lighting too soft and not strong enought. The frame is interesting (overlay) but doesn''t give much to the picture, yet a suspect no frame would not be as good looking. Small details like the left hand, or the tie''s tip''s shadow on the cheek makes this light study less then perfect. 6', '2005-08-23 19:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636604, 221013, 9690, '<td valign="top">Weird.  I love the creativity here~!  10</td>', 'Weird.  I love the creativity here~!  10', '2005-08-23 19:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636606, 221055, 25571, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to say about this picture... colours are sad, composition is non-existant. A frame could do some good on this shot. No emotion or interest at all in this shot, sorry. 4</td>', 'Not sure what to say about this picture... colours are sad, composition is non-existant. A frame could do some good on this shot. No emotion or interest at all in this shot, sorry. 4', '2005-08-23 19:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636611, 220770, 25571, '<td valign="top">By the look and style, i already know who''s work this is ;) <br/>Composition is very nice if a bit off on the lower part (little bit more space would be nice). Model''s posture is unique and shows some interesting struggle of emotions, although i don''t feel the model to be quite confortable doing so. Althought this is the author''s style, i feel there is a certain lack of colours in the background that could give more power to the shot. Same goes for the frame which is nice, but somehow, doesn''t quite help the model. Finally, DOF is nice, but i''d loved a little bit more depth.  None the less, very good mastery of the composition and style. Nice work! 8</td>', 'By the look and style, i already know who''s work this is ;) Composition is very nice if a bit off on the lower part (little bit more space would be nice). Model''s posture is unique and shows some interesting struggle of emotions, although i don''t feel the model to be quite confortable doing so. Althought this is the author''s style, i feel there is a certain lack of colours in the background that could give more power to the shot. Same goes for the frame which is nice, but somehow, doesn''t quite help the model. Finally, DOF is nice, but i''d loved a little bit more depth.  None the less, very good mastery of the composition and style. Nice work! 8', '2005-08-23 19:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636613, 221087, 40370, '<td valign="top">Funny twist on current cinema, I''d say too washed out on the right side, however it could represent the harsh arctic landscape.</td>', 'Funny twist on current cinema, I''d say too washed out on the right side, however it could represent the harsh arctic landscape.', '2005-08-23 19:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636615, 221040, 25571, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Very private and shows some strange struggle. Lighting is perharps a little too strong, i does help in the portraiture. I''m really not sure about the frame tho. Is it legal?  I don''t realy like it, as it takes away from the models emotions. Perharps a skin coloured frame would''ve helped? 7</td>', 'Interesting composition. Very private and shows some strange struggle. Lighting is perharps a little too strong, i does help in the portraiture. I''m really not sure about the frame tho. Is it legal?  I don''t realy like it, as it takes away from the models emotions. Perharps a skin coloured frame would''ve helped? 7', '2005-08-23 19:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1636623, 220382, 25571, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what to say about this picture. colours are interesting, but sort of tanned out. Lighting is bright and seems uncontrolled. There is a sense of erotism coming from the shot, but again, seems a bit uncontrolled as well. Composition is interesting and gives a sense of Hunter/hunted, which helps the models. I find the DOF a bit weak as it doesn''t show enought sharpness to the models, sort of blurring eveyrthing in like a dream (perhaps the author''s intension?). Unique style and work. 7</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what to say about this picture. colours are interesting, but sort of tanned out. Lighting is bright and seems uncontrolled. There is a sense of erotism coming from the shot, but again, seems a bit uncontrolled as well. Composition is interesting and gives a sense of Hunter/hunted, which helps the models. I find the DOF a bit weak as it doesn''t show enought sharpness to the models, sort of blurring eveyrthing in like a dream (perhaps the author''s intension?). Unique style and work. 7', '2005-08-23 19:10:44.000000', NULL, 1);
