(1637331, 221114, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting very much, the silhouette of the torso and head is very nice.  I like the use of all shades.  I''m not sure about the tree from the head though, I''m going to have to think about that.  Overall nicely done.</td>', 'I like the lighting very much, the silhouette of the torso and head is very nice.  I like the use of all shades.  I''m not sure about the tree from the head though, I''m going to have to think about that.  Overall nicely done.', '2005-08-23 23:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637336, 221066, 39833, '<td valign="top">The model doesn''t feel relaxed to me... perhaps a better title would have been "feeling exposed"... 7</td>', 'The model doesn''t feel relaxed to me... perhaps a better title would have been "feeling exposed"... 7', '2005-08-23 23:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637338, 220286, 29490, '<td valign="top">I like the crop and the curves.  The lone curl stranding down the the neck is perfect, I really like that.  It seems like the image is a little on the dark side.  Good focus and dof.  Good job!</td>', 'I like the crop and the curves.  The lone curl stranding down the the neck is perfect, I really like that.  It seems like the image is a little on the dark side.  Good focus and dof.  Good job!', '2005-08-23 23:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637340, 221186, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice tone and composition.</td>', 'Very nice tone and composition.', '2005-08-23 23:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637341, 220989, 33552, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. You have as many remotes as I do!</td>', 'Cute idea. You have as many remotes as I do!', '2005-08-23 23:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637344, 221150, 29490, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting is excellent, as well as the overall darkness of the shot.  I like pose, the expression, and the crop.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I think the lighting is excellent, as well as the overall darkness of the shot.  I like pose, the expression, and the crop.  Nicely done.', '2005-08-23 23:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637345, 220306, 39833, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great idea and great choice of colors.</td>', 'Great shot, great idea and great choice of colors.', '2005-08-23 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637351, 221148, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.  I like the pose and lighting.   The textures and shadows of the bg are nice, they add to the overall look.  I''m wondering if a portrait crop might make this image zip.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice silhouette.  I like the pose and lighting.   The textures and shadows of the bg are nice, they add to the overall look.  I''m wondering if a portrait crop might make this image zip.  Good job.', '2005-08-23 23:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637352, 221223, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good use of your models features in your composition. Coloumn / pedistal seems washed out though. It pulls my attention downward and away from the subject.</td>', 'Very nice. Good use of your models features in your composition. Coloumn / pedistal seems washed out though. It pulls my attention downward and away from the subject.', '2005-08-23 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637353, 221045, 7703, '<td valign="top">I will give you 8 for this photo but what I think is that you should hvae the man in the lower right corner to better show how he is facing from the world / life ... but like the idea</td>', 'I will give you 8 for this photo but what I think is that you should hvae the man in the lower right corner to better show how he is facing from the world / life ... but like the idea', '2005-08-23 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637355, 218831, 7703, '<td valign="top">Good idea ... diffrent form all the others</td>', 'Good idea ... diffrent form all the others', '2005-08-23 23:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637358, 220472, 29490, '<td valign="top">It looks like the focus is a little deep for me, I''d like to se it on the face.  Nice perspective on an interesting angle.  The lighting is good, as is the crop.  I''m not too sure about the blanket, I don''t think it''s needed.  Good job and good luck.</td>', 'It looks like the focus is a little deep for me, I''d like to se it on the face.  Nice perspective on an interesting angle.  The lighting is good, as is the crop.  I''m not too sure about the blanket, I don''t think it''s needed.  Good job and good luck.', '2005-08-23 23:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637359, 220108, 39833, '<td valign="top">That''s the perfect title for the feeling your photo communicates. Great low-key portrait.</td>', 'That''s the perfect title for the feeling your photo communicates. Great low-key portrait.', '2005-08-23 23:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637361, 220699, 32338, '<td valign="top">Well, she''s not afraid to have fun.</td>', 'Well, she''s not afraid to have fun.', '2005-08-23 23:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637362, 221151, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting to create a mood. Knuckle shadows and fingernail reflections are a bit distracting though, might try dodging and burning.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting to create a mood. Knuckle shadows and fingernail reflections are a bit distracting though, might try dodging and burning.', '2005-08-23 23:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637363, 220689, 7703, '<td valign="top">Naked hand is not nude so sorry but you get 1</td>', 'Naked hand is not nude so sorry but you get 1', '2005-08-23 23:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637364, 220267, 17837, '<td valign="top">Good tonal range here. The pose would be better if her hair wasnt in her face. Not sure about cutting her arms off either, id like to see them included.</td>', 'Good tonal range here. The pose would be better if her hair wasnt in her face. Not sure about cutting her arms off either, id like to see them included.', '2005-08-23 23:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637367, 221223, 7703, '<td valign="top">Good lighting .... like the pose ... fake tattoo?</td>', 'Good lighting .... like the pose ... fake tattoo?', '2005-08-23 23:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637369, 221150, 17837, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this photo is very flat. It needs a lot more contrast, not sure if this was caused by post processing or what. The pose is a little awkward also. Perhaps a crop to the right side might make the blanket a less of a distraction.</td>', 'The lighting in this photo is very flat. It needs a lot more contrast, not sure if this was caused by post processing or what. The pose is a little awkward also. Perhaps a crop to the right side might make the blanket a less of a distraction.', '2005-08-23 23:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637371, 220028, 17837, '<td valign="top">im not sure what to write, will return later.</td>', 'im not sure what to write, will return later.', '2005-08-23 23:44:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1637372, 220306, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Kinda gives me the impression of a hospital gown though. The head / hair falls into the shadows a bit too much for me. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very creative. Kinda gives me the impression of a hospital gown though. The head / hair falls into the shadows a bit too much for me. Very nice shot.', '2005-08-23 23:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637373, 221055, 17837, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, this photo leaves me baffled. Not sure what kind of effect this is. It isnt very appealing.</td>', 'Hmmmm, this photo leaves me baffled. Not sure what kind of effect this is. It isnt very appealing.', '2005-08-23 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637375, 220701, 32338, '<td valign="top">Above the knees is GREAT.  But below that, I find the image disturbing - I would like him attached to or planted on something solid.</td>', 'Above the knees is GREAT.  But below that, I find the image disturbing - I would like him attached to or planted on something solid.', '2005-08-23 23:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637379, 220702, 17837, '<td valign="top">an extremely nice photograph. Great lighting, great tones.</td>', 'an extremely nice photograph. Great lighting, great tones.', '2005-08-23 23:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637380, 221138, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great tone throughout. Might push the red a little further in the apple . . . if anything.</td>', 'Great tone throughout. Might push the red a little further in the apple . . . if anything.', '2005-08-23 23:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637382, 220582, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice stop-action on the water.    Good lighting, good focus, and good dof.  I think this might have a little more pop with a little more model in the image coupled with a portrait crop.  The portrait would compliment the vertical arm, vertical razor, and vertical column of water.   Nice technicals on this shot.</td>', 'Nice stop-action on the water.    Good lighting, good focus, and good dof.  I think this might have a little more pop with a little more model in the image coupled with a portrait crop.  The portrait would compliment the vertical arm, vertical razor, and vertical column of water.   Nice technicals on this shot.', '2005-08-23 23:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637385, 220784, 32338, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, the image would be even stronger cropped to the bottom ~4/5ths of the photo and with less green tone in the skin.</td>', 'In my opinion, the image would be even stronger cropped to the bottom ~4/5ths of the photo and with less green tone in the skin.', '2005-08-23 23:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637386, 221090, 33552, '<td valign="top">Might benefit from a tighter crop or a more straight-forward camera angle</td>', 'Might benefit from a tighter crop or a more straight-forward camera angle', '2005-08-23 23:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637391, 218406, 29490, '<td valign="top">Interesting color, it adds to this image.  Good lighting, however tthe model''s left seems a little blown out.  I like the hair covering the model.  Very tastefully done photo.</td>', 'Interesting color, it adds to this image.  Good lighting, however tthe model''s left seems a little blown out.  I like the hair covering the model.  Very tastefully done photo.', '2005-08-23 23:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637393, 220943, 17837, '<td valign="top">Pregnant nude shots are among some of my favorite fine art nude works. Though, I do believe they are better presented in a low key fashion. The harsh lighting takes away from her.</td>', 'Pregnant nude shots are among some of my favorite fine art nude works. Though, I do believe they are better presented in a low key fashion. The harsh lighting takes away from her.', '2005-08-23 23:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637394, 221148, 17837, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, good pose, the drapes give a dramatic effect. well done.</td>', 'Great lighting, good pose, the drapes give a dramatic effect. well done.', '2005-08-23 23:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637397, 221246, 17837, '<td valign="top">I dont believe this angle best represents the model. The lighting is good.</td>', 'I dont believe this angle best represents the model. The lighting is good.', '2005-08-23 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637399, 221150, 39833, '<td valign="top">great shot. The low contrast increases the sensation of emptyness suggested by the title. 9</td>', 'great shot. The low contrast increases the sensation of emptyness suggested by the title. 9', '2005-08-23 23:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637400, 218235, 7703, '<td valign="top">I would keep emtpy space on the left side rather then right side but good picture and good lightning ... give you 8</td>', 'I would keep emtpy space on the left side rather then right side but good picture and good lightning ... give you 8', '2005-08-23 23:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637401, 220166, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice curve.  I like the color splash the bikini adds to the photo.  Nice lighting.  I think a healthy dose of water droplets on the model would help to define the skin and give texture.  Overall nice photo.</td>', 'Nice curve.  I like the color splash the bikini adds to the photo.  Nice lighting.  I think a healthy dose of water droplets on the model would help to define the skin and give texture.  Overall nice photo.', '2005-08-23 23:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637403, 221087, 7703, '<td valign="top">funny .... good idea ...thinking outside the box</td>', 'funny .... good idea ...thinking outside the box', '2005-08-23 23:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637404, 219022, 33552, '<td valign="top">Needs contrast. Might also be improved if the subject was interacting with something else in the image.</td>', 'Needs contrast. Might also be improved if the subject was interacting with something else in the image.', '2005-08-23 23:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637405, 218865, 37252, '<td valign="top">hmmm- might his be boy Joey?  Great lighting and nice crop. Perhaps a bit more DOF as the shoulder looks a tad too blurry</td>', 'hmmm- might his be boy Joey?  Great lighting and nice crop. Perhaps a bit more DOF as the shoulder looks a tad too blurry', '2005-08-23 23:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637406, 220472, 39833, '<td valign="top">good portrait. If the focus were on her eyes it would have been even better. 8</td>', 'good portrait. If the focus were on her eyes it would have been even better. 8', '2005-08-23 23:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637407, 218235, 23318, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. I wish I had a room that I could do a similar shot with. I really like that the background is visible in places. I think that her arm, and hand are a bit blown out, and her hand seems a bit forced. However, the hair is just about the same color as the floor, and that is kinda cool.</td>', 'I love this shot. I wish I had a room that I could do a similar shot with. I really like that the background is visible in places. I think that her arm, and hand are a bit blown out, and her hand seems a bit forced. However, the hair is just about the same color as the floor, and that is kinda cool.', '2005-08-23 23:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637410, 221243, 32338, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  Would this be a stronger photo cropped to the top ~2/3 of the image?</td>', 'Too funny!  Would this be a stronger photo cropped to the top ~2/3 of the image?', '2005-08-23 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637411, 220985, 17837, '<td valign="top">a good photo, though the lighting in some spots are over exposed.</td>', 'a good photo, though the lighting in some spots are over exposed.', '2005-08-23 23:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637415, 221087, 37252, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2005-08-24 00:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637419, 220701, 28697, '<td valign="top">This is really well executed!  Kudos to the model, too!</td>', 'This is really well executed!  Kudos to the model, too!', '2005-08-24 00:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637420, 220663, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the folds in the sheet are distracting. A more neutral colored sheet, fewer folds, or a tighter crop could help.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the folds in the sheet are distracting. A more neutral colored sheet, fewer folds, or a tighter crop could help.', '2005-08-24 00:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637423, 220839, 27812, '<td valign="top">fine line between okay and too dark, for me this is a tad too dark, just a little..<br/>Revisiting. interestingto re-evaluate the total pic .<br/>Surely one of the best studies in this challenge, real photography. Hope it does well, really do.</td>', 'fine line between okay and too dark, for me this is a tad too dark, just a little..Revisiting. interestingto re-evaluate the total pic .Surely one of the best studies in this challenge, real photography. Hope it does well, really do.', '2005-08-24 00:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637425, 218759, 42960, '<td valign="top">gracefully executed! great work!</td>', 'gracefully executed! great work!', '2005-08-24 00:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637428, 221103, 33552, '<td valign="top">DOF seems a bit too shallow in this one. Interesting concept, almost abstract.</td>', 'DOF seems a bit too shallow in this one. Interesting concept, almost abstract.', '2005-08-24 00:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637430, 220993, 33889, '<td valign="top">Can''t get much more nude than that! :)</td>', 'Can''t get much more nude than that! :)', '2005-08-24 00:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637437, 220684, 33552, '<td valign="top">High contrast seems to detract from the intended mood in this shot. Creative pose.</td>', 'High contrast seems to detract from the intended mood in this shot. Creative pose.', '2005-08-24 00:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637450, 220701, 37252, '<td valign="top">This is my absolute favorite! Hilarious!!</td>', 'This is my absolute favorite! Hilarious!!', '2005-08-24 00:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637459, 221249, 33552, '<td valign="top">Try cropping a bit off of the bottom and right to create a strong diagonal. Almost looks painted.</td>', 'Try cropping a bit off of the bottom and right to create a strong diagonal. Almost looks painted.', '2005-08-24 00:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637463, 221087, 39273, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2005-08-24 00:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637465, 221022, 28697, '<td valign="top">Mix of warm and cool lighting has an odd effect... the areas lit with cool light are too low in contrast, it looks like to me, and slightly too blue to look natural.  The fists give a sense of tension that is not reflected in the face, adding to the subtle confusion I get from this image.</td>', 'Mix of warm and cool lighting has an odd effect... the areas lit with cool light are too low in contrast, it looks like to me, and slightly too blue to look natural.  The fists give a sense of tension that is not reflected in the face, adding to the subtle confusion I get from this image.', '2005-08-24 00:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637466, 220108, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice tone, composition, pose, lighting. Wonderful image.</td>', 'Very nice tone, composition, pose, lighting. Wonderful image.', '2005-08-24 00:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637471, 219505, 28697, '<td valign="top">I like everything but the title.  lol</td>', 'I like everything but the title.  lol', '2005-08-24 00:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637478, 220699, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Joyful. Could have used a non-black background to lighten the mood.</td>', 'Nice composition. Joyful. Could have used a non-black background to lighten the mood.', '2005-08-24 00:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637481, 220988, 28697, '<td valign="top">Tattoo on back is distracting, and depth of field seems a tad bit shallow... I think it would have looked better if the mouth had been sharper.  Other than that, great pose, and great expression!  It must have been fun getting this shot!</td>', 'Tattoo on back is distracting, and depth of field seems a tad bit shallow... I think it would have looked better if the mouth had been sharper.  Other than that, great pose, and great expression!  It must have been fun getting this shot!', '2005-08-24 00:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637499, 220472, 28697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful skin rendering in this shot!!!  It positively glows!</td>', 'Beautiful skin rendering in this shot!!!  It positively glows!', '2005-08-24 00:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637500, 220702, 33552, '<td valign="top">Amazing. I often try to offer suggestions, but I don''t know how this could be improved. 10</td>', 'Amazing. I often try to offer suggestions, but I don''t know how this could be improved. 10', '2005-08-24 00:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637501, 220656, 37252, '<td valign="top">very cute and creative</td>', 'very cute and creative', '2005-08-24 00:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637505, 220725, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Poor guy. I like the details. The photographer worked hard on this one. Love the diploma.</td>', 'Very funny. Poor guy. I like the details. The photographer worked hard on this one. Love the diploma.', '2005-08-24 00:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637507, 220472, 33552, '<td valign="top">In this shot I really need the eyes (or at least the closest eye) in focus. Also the background and border are distracting. Nice pose and angle though.</td>', 'In this shot I really need the eyes (or at least the closest eye) in focus. Also the background and border are distracting. Nice pose and angle though.', '2005-08-24 00:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637513, 220286, 28697, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I think it needs to be cropped to show a little less breast, though.  It looks as if she was hollding them up and the curves seem somewhat unnatural the way it''s cropped.  Love the single strand of hair!</td>', 'Nicely done.  I think it needs to be cropped to show a little less breast, though.  It looks as if she was hollding them up and the curves seem somewhat unnatural the way it''s cropped.  Love the single strand of hair!', '2005-08-24 00:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637515, 221253, 33552, '<td valign="top">Could use some light on the head to provide some shape. Otherwise a tighter crop, for example from shoulder to ankle, might work.</td>', 'Could use some light on the head to provide some shape. Otherwise a tighter crop, for example from shoulder to ankle, might work.', '2005-08-24 00:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637527, 221222, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice tone and lighting. A bit soft twords the top (although this might have worked well with the title if it weren''t so dramatic).</td>', 'Nice tone and lighting. A bit soft twords the top (although this might have worked well with the title if it weren''t so dramatic).', '2005-08-24 00:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637531, 221195, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Imo, it would look better in b/w. Don''t take this the wrong way, but this is like the ones of the men''s feet.  It doesn''t feel as if the photographer was willing to risk much with the picture and was sidestepping the intent of the challenge. But that is only my opinion.</td>', 'Nice abstract. Imo, it would look better in b/w. Don''t take this the wrong way, but this is like the ones of the men''s feet.  It doesn''t feel as if the photographer was willing to risk much with the picture and was sidestepping the intent of the challenge. But that is only my opinion.', '2005-08-24 00:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637533, 221222, 35775, '<td valign="top">Great tones &amp; light, wonderful shot.</td>', 'Great tones & light, wonderful shot.', '2005-08-24 00:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637538, 219663, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Highly emotive.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Highly emotive.', '2005-08-24 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637543, 220473, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Almost abstract. Would''ve made a great contrast if her hand ws above the water.</td>', 'Very nice. Almost abstract. Would''ve made a great contrast if her hand ws above the water.', '2005-08-24 00:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637544, 218235, 37252, '<td valign="top">the lighting on the left shoulder and the hand is a bit harsh, but otherwise a well executed shot</td>', 'the lighting on the left shoulder and the hand is a bit harsh, but otherwise a well executed shot', '2005-08-24 00:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637553, 221047, 37252, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot - I really love the selective desat.</td>', 'wonderful shot - I really love the selective desat.', '2005-08-24 00:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637558, 220699, 11800, '<td valign="top">This was as close to the word I got in my dictionary:heliophila: Any of various South African herbs and subshrubs cultivated for long showy racemes of bright blue flowers with white eyes. But then I googled and it said :vegetable species which likes the exposure to the sun. So this lady is a spicy hot pepper(would have said tomato but that is a fruit) that likes to sun?</td>', 'This was as close to the word I got in my dictionary:heliophila: Any of various South African herbs and subshrubs cultivated for long showy racemes of bright blue flowers with white eyes. But then I googled and it said :vegetable species which likes the exposure to the sun. So this lady is a spicy hot pepper(would have said tomato but that is a fruit) that likes to sun?', '2005-08-24 00:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637563, 219022, 11800, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and good tones.</td>', 'nice lighting and good tones.', '2005-08-24 00:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637573, 221143, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic look of this. The sheet reminds me of desert sand almost and the light really adds to that thought. Good imagination. I think I will bump this one up a bit.</td>', 'I like the graphic look of this. The sheet reminds me of desert sand almost and the light really adds to that thought. Good imagination. I think I will bump this one up a bit.', '2005-08-24 00:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637580, 221087, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like the high key tones on the body. The lighting is perfect for this concept.</td>', 'Cute. I like the high key tones on the body. The lighting is perfect for this concept.', '2005-08-24 00:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637585, 218831, 37252, '<td valign="top">I love this one - giving it a 10</td>', 'I love this one - giving it a 10', '2005-08-24 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637590, 220389, 40820, '<td valign="top">fantastic!!...10<br/></td>', 'fantastic!!...10', '2005-08-24 00:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637593, 221145, 40820, '<td valign="top">superb lighting!...9</td>', 'superb lighting!...9', '2005-08-24 00:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637596, 218963, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice study of shape and shadow.</td>', 'Nice study of shape and shadow.', '2005-08-24 00:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637601, 220927, 23294, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Very good pose!  The lighting is crazy good, backlighting can be very sensual.  The only thing I don''t really like is the line in the wall behind her.  Otherwise it''s great! 8.</td>', 'I really like this.  Very good pose!  The lighting is crazy good, backlighting can be very sensual.  The only thing I don''t really like is the line in the wall behind her.  Otherwise it''s great! 8.', '2005-08-24 00:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
