(1637658, 218617, 23294, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on a bold duotone image.  I''m not sure what the story behind the photo is supposed to be though.  Is it a night with a new lover, or is it just a hangover?  He''s holding his head and it gives a sense of negative energy.  Possibly regret?  I think the shot is well composed and it has a lot of appeal.  I would have liked to see more detail in his leg, but that''s about the only bad thing I have to say. One of my top 5. 8</td>', 'An interesting take on a bold duotone image.  I''m not sure what the story behind the photo is supposed to be though.  Is it a night with a new lover, or is it just a hangover?  He''s holding his head and it gives a sense of negative energy.  Possibly regret?  I think the shot is well composed and it has a lot of appeal.  I would have liked to see more detail in his leg, but that''s about the only bad thing I have to say. One of my top 5. 8', '2005-08-24 01:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
