(1637684, 218235, 23294, '<td valign="top">Some minor things.  I think the backround could have been burned out to remove the slight folds in the fabric.  You really can only see them on the left side and I''d like it to be consistant.  I like the choice of floor, but watch out for splinters!  Her hand doesn''t look natural, she looks like she''s forcing it open.  I also might suggest putting her head in the upper right corner and leaving out more of the black backround and adding to the left side of the photo. 7.</td>', 'Some minor things.  I think the backround could have been burned out to remove the slight folds in the fabric.  You really can only see them on the left side and I''d like it to be consistant.  I like the choice of floor, but watch out for splinters!  Her hand doesn''t look natural, she looks like she''s forcing it open.  I also might suggest putting her head in the upper right corner and leaving out more of the black backround and adding to the left side of the photo. 7.', '2005-08-24 01:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
