(1637714, 221070, 4564, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this challenge. I love the environment in which the nude is shot. Very classic and classy.  I love that the model is in the shadow, and of course her position is very alluring.  Wonderful details in the hair: I wish we could see the image larger to truely appreciate it.  I salute your choice of not cropping closer, even though it would have been tempting because of the poor 640 pixels limit size that we get on DPC.  9</td>', 'One of my favorites this challenge. I love the environment in which the nude is shot. Very classic and classy.  I love that the model is in the shadow, and of course her position is very alluring.  Wonderful details in the hair: I wish we could see the image larger to truely appreciate it.  I salute your choice of not cropping closer, even though it would have been tempting because of the poor 640 pixels limit size that we get on DPC.  9', '2005-08-24 01:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
