(1637742, 220108, 4564, '<td valign="top">The expression of the model is what makes it for me.  Very nice.  Skin seems extremely soft (too much neat image?  Or maybe diffuse glow?).  Regardless, very nice! I wish we saw more details in the hair instead of this very dark area, and maybe more texture on the wall to the right.  Nice crop and composition.  7</td>', 'The expression of the model is what makes it for me.  Very nice.  Skin seems extremely soft (too much neat image?  Or maybe diffuse glow?).  Regardless, very nice! I wish we saw more details in the hair instead of this very dark area, and maybe more texture on the wall to the right.  Nice crop and composition.  7', '2005-08-24 01:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637744, 220075, 28697, '<td valign="top">Great concept, well executed!  I''m surprised you didn''t pose him so he looked as if he were in mid-stride.</td>', 'Great concept, well executed!  I''m surprised you didn''t pose him so he looked as if he were in mid-stride.', '2005-08-24 01:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
