(1637765, 218235, 4564, '<td valign="top">Well executed, nicely photographed nude.  Skin color is very nice.  Color of the wooden floor is distracting to me (too orangy), but that''s my personal preference.  Nice pose; could have been better with pointy foot to stretch those leg muscles.  Same for her left hand (could point her fingers nistead of putting flat hand on floor).  Very nice lighting.  This shot would work very well in b&amp;w or sepia.  Nice choice of model.  If I am to be picky, I''d say it''s too bad the hand and left arm are blown out like that, detracts from the softness of this shot.  Good job! 7</td>', 'Well executed, nicely photographed nude.  Skin color is very nice.  Color of the wooden floor is distracting to me (too orangy), but that''s my personal preference.  Nice pose; could have been better with pointy foot to stretch those leg muscles.  Same for her left hand (could point her fingers nistead of putting flat hand on floor).  Very nice lighting.  This shot would work very well in b&w or sepia.  Nice choice of model.  If I am to be picky, I''d say it''s too bad the hand and left arm are blown out like that, detracts from the softness of this shot.  Good job! 7', '2005-08-24 01:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
