(1637802, 221088, 4564, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this challenge.  Simple and visually very dynamic nude.  I love the fact that we see some detail in the hair from the light source on the right.  Beautiful sky!  Colros are great.  Excellent silhouette.  And what can I say about the composition!!!  Stunning.  Can I be picky? If I may... I wish there had been a bounce used to slightly reflect light on her left, maybe from below.  I think it would have been delicious to see just a hint of those curves on the body, yet keeping the overall silhouette effect.  Just my two cents.   Good job!  8</td>', 'One of my favorites this challenge.  Simple and visually very dynamic nude.  I love the fact that we see some detail in the hair from the light source on the right.  Beautiful sky!  Colros are great.  Excellent silhouette.  And what can I say about the composition!!!  Stunning.  Can I be picky? If I may... I wish there had been a bounce used to slightly reflect light on her left, maybe from below.  I think it would have been delicious to see just a hint of those curves on the body, yet keeping the overall silhouette effect.  Just my two cents.   Good job!  8', '2005-08-24 01:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
