(1637824, 220770, 4564, '<td valign="top">Very well done shot. Love the colors!  Nice pose from the model, although her left foot seems a bit oddly placed (maybe it could have been pointy, or silghtly moved).  Very nice expression of the face. Lovely environment.  Very nice composition and crop.  8</td>', 'Very well done shot. Love the colors!  Nice pose from the model, although her left foot seems a bit oddly placed (maybe it could have been pointy, or silghtly moved).  Very nice expression of the face. Lovely environment.  Very nice composition and crop.  8', '2005-08-24 01:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
