(1637836, 220389, 4564, '<td valign="top">Good choice of model for this type of shot.  Pose seems a bit awkward to me... It feels just not totally right in the composition of the shot.  Maybe it would have helped if the body was put more into a diagale (ie. pointing the left arm toward the top left corner, or something similar).  Very nice lighting.  Feels like there was a lot of burning to get rid of the background, which we still see some of it around the body... Don''t know if it was intentional or not.  Nice color.  7</td>', 'Good choice of model for this type of shot.  Pose seems a bit awkward to me... It feels just not totally right in the composition of the shot.  Maybe it would have helped if the body was put more into a diagale (ie. pointing the left arm toward the top left corner, or something similar).  Very nice lighting.  Feels like there was a lot of burning to get rid of the background, which we still see some of it around the body... Don''t know if it was intentional or not.  Nice color.  7', '2005-08-24 01:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637844, 221148, 37200, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, and an interesting background.  The hair does look a bit unnatural.  Maybe a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice silhouette, and an interesting background.  The hair does look a bit unnatural.  Maybe a little oversharpened.', '2005-08-24 01:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637845, 218759, 28697, '<td valign="top">One word: Masterpiece!  10!</td>', 'One word: Masterpiece!  10!', '2005-08-24 01:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637862, 220298, 4564, '<td valign="top">Simple and classic. Nice choice of model for this type of pose. Good use of B&amp;W.  Nice pose.  What could be improved I think: a) stretching more the model (ie. pointing her foot instead of it lying flat on the floor).  b) Closer crop on the left and the right; the square crop doesn''t help enhancing the feminity of the model.  c) Using Channel Mixer to create your b&amp;w would have given a bit more punch to the shot, I think.    d) Some detail in the hair would have been nice, but this is just nitpicking really... ;-)   Overall good shot, good job!</td>', 'Simple and classic. Nice choice of model for this type of pose. Good use of B&W.  Nice pose.  What could be improved I think: a) stretching more the model (ie. pointing her foot instead of it lying flat on the floor).  b) Closer crop on the left and the right; the square crop doesn''t help enhancing the feminity of the model.  c) Using Channel Mixer to create your b&w would have given a bit more punch to the shot, I think.    d) Some detail in the hair would have been nice, but this is just nitpicking really... ;-)   Overall good shot, good job!', '2005-08-24 01:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1637863, 220974, 37200, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and B/W treatment.  To emphasize the veiled theme, maybe turn just a bit more away from the camera (though you have no reason to hide).</td>', 'Nice lighting and B/W treatment.  To emphasize the veiled theme, maybe turn just a bit more away from the camera (though you have no reason to hide).', '2005-08-24 01:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
