(1638143, 221223, 29269, '<td valign="top">The weakest of my four 8s. While it is ranked top 6 in my opinion, it lacks the wow factor the ribbon winners require.Something is not appealing about the pillar the model sits on. It is not completely ignored, nor it is standing out enough. I understand the idea of light/white, and I like it, but that pillar just swayed me from giving this a highest ranking in the challenge. Best of luck!</td>', 'The weakest of my four 8s. While it is ranked top 6 in my opinion, it lacks the wow factor the ribbon winners require.Something is not appealing about the pillar the model sits on. It is not completely ignored, nor it is standing out enough. I understand the idea of light/white, and I like it, but that pillar just swayed me from giving this a highest ranking in the challenge. Best of luck!', '2005-08-24 02:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638155, 220948, 29269, '<td valign="top">One of the four 8s I gave in this challenge. I hope it wins a ribbon, at least a yellow one. The b/w works well for this composition. The only technical recommendation I would have is to have a less centered composition. SInce your beautiful model is looking away to our left, it might have been more effective use of negative space if there was more of an empty space to the left... good luck.</td>', 'One of the four 8s I gave in this challenge. I hope it wins a ribbon, at least a yellow one. The b/w works well for this composition. The only technical recommendation I would have is to have a less centered composition. SInce your beautiful model is looking away to our left, it might have been more effective use of negative space if there was more of an empty space to the left... good luck.', '2005-08-24 02:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638166, 220977, 29269, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments... Does your model really have red &amp; black hair like this? Interesting, but distracting. The facial expression of the model is intriguing. It is not your everyday smiley face, posed for the max appeal. On the contrary, this model has attempted and managed to convey the real emotion(s). Now please go and take her cuffs off. Good luck! 7.</td>', 'Returning for comments... Does your model really have red & black hair like this? Interesting, but distracting. The facial expression of the model is intriguing. It is not your everyday smiley face, posed for the max appeal. On the contrary, this model has attempted and managed to convey the real emotion(s). Now please go and take her cuffs off. Good luck! 7.', '2005-08-24 02:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638193, 220472, 29168, '<td valign="top">With the eyes so prominent and drawing, I feel they really need to be much sharper. With a wide enoug appeture (low F) and zoom the rest of the image would have remained soft in focus. I do like the angle, pose and expression though. 6.</td>', 'With the eyes so prominent and drawing, I feel they really need to be much sharper. With a wide enoug appeture (low F) and zoom the rest of the image would have remained soft in focus. I do like the angle, pose and expression though. 6.', '2005-08-24 02:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638203, 221040, 33542, '<td valign="top">The woman''s pose and the covering of the woman''s breasts seems a little stilted. I like the idea and the lighting, though.</td>', 'The woman''s pose and the covering of the woman''s breasts seems a little stilted. I like the idea and the lighting, though.', '2005-08-24 02:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638204, 221091, 29168, '<td valign="top">You know, with some more lighting (soft) and some post softing of skin tones this would actually have been a really good photo... I guess the fun of taking it overtook those thoughts eh? :)</td>', 'You know, with some more lighting (soft) and some post softing of skin tones this would actually have been a really good photo... I guess the fun of taking it overtook those thoughts eh? :)', '2005-08-24 02:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638217, 220389, 33542, '<td valign="top">nice muscles</td>', 'nice muscles', '2005-08-24 02:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638219, 220948, 33542, '<td valign="top">The level of the water is perfect. My only complaint is that the water in the middle of the shot looks overexposed.</td>', 'The level of the water is perfect. My only complaint is that the water in the middle of the shot looks overexposed.', '2005-08-24 02:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638227, 220275, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like this picture except the scalp you can see</td>', 'I like this picture except the scalp you can see', '2005-08-24 02:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
