(1638288, 221222, 670, '<td valign="top">Overall good.  For some in a female audience the  pubic hair becomes a bit of a turn off.  Having your model insert one thumb into the waistband  would give a similar mood .<br/> <br/>Nice framing, use of light and shadow</td>', 'Overall good.  For some in a female audience the  pubic hair becomes a bit of a turn off.  Having your model insert one thumb into the waistband  would give a similar mood . Nice framing, use of light and shadow', '2005-08-24 03:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638289, 220974, 28697, '<td valign="top">Interesting... almost has an "Old Masters" feel to it.</td>', 'Interesting... almost has an "Old Masters" feel to it.', '2005-08-24 03:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
