(1638307, 221251, 670, '<td valign="top">the subject is well positioned.  The lighting seems a little off - the skin is glowing from the flash in a way that detracts from the artistic look you were working towards.</td>', 'the subject is well positioned.  The lighting seems a little off - the skin is glowing from the flash in a way that detracts from the artistic look you were working towards.', '2005-08-24 03:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
