(1638402, 219696, 37844, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I feel the lighting is off though, Would like to see the lighting drawing attention to the beautiful curve of her back which is too hidden by shadow. Color and composition were wonderful.</td>', 'Very pretty. I feel the lighting is off though, Would like to see the lighting drawing attention to the beautiful curve of her back which is too hidden by shadow. Color and composition were wonderful.', '2005-08-24 03:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
