(1638453, 221248, 37844, '<td valign="top">Love the soft look and material, but the skin seemed somewhat off texture. Good concept, would like to see it used again.</td>', 'Love the soft look and material, but the skin seemed somewhat off texture. Good concept, would like to see it used again.', '2005-08-24 03:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638458, 219505, 37844, '<td valign="top">Good contrast and composition. Excellent photo.</td>', 'Good contrast and composition. Excellent photo.', '2005-08-24 03:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638471, 221045, 37844, '<td valign="top">Color lighting and title were very good. Felt it could have been more exciting, maybe in composition. Not really to my taste but I didn''t let that cloud my judgement. Good job.</td>', 'Color lighting and title were very good. Felt it could have been more exciting, maybe in composition. Not really to my taste but I didn''t let that cloud my judgement. Good job.', '2005-08-24 03:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638476, 220306, 37844, '<td valign="top">Every man''s dream,. Unique and well done.  I would have like more color, but that''s just me. I gave you 8</td>', 'Every man''s dream,. Unique and well done.  I would have like more color, but that''s just me. I gave you 8', '2005-08-24 03:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638482, 220927, 37844, '<td valign="top">Lighting, title and detail are right on.  Composition is interesting also. Very well done and tasteful.  I  gave you 10.</td>', 'Lighting, title and detail are right on.  Composition is interesting also. Very well done and tasteful.  I  gave you 10.', '2005-08-24 03:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638485, 221104, 37844, '<td valign="top">Color is eerie.  Not sure I liked the composition.  Rather disturbing , which could be a good thing.</td>', 'Color is eerie.  Not sure I liked the composition.  Rather disturbing , which could be a good thing.', '2005-08-24 03:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638493, 220684, 37844, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, vision, would have like it better with her foot all the way in photo and possibly a different flower  would have made it more aluring and dramatic at the same time.  still nice shot.</td>', 'Nice lighting, vision, would have like it better with her foot all the way in photo and possibly a different flower  would have made it more aluring and dramatic at the same time.  still nice shot.', '2005-08-24 03:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638497, 221143, 37844, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Would have like just a little more lighting to the left around the hair. Beautiful ideas and photo. I gave you  9.</td>', 'Very cool. Would have like just a little more lighting to the left around the hair. Beautiful ideas and photo. I gave you  9.', '2005-08-24 03:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638498, 220298, 37844, '<td valign="top">Mysterious. Lighting was very good. I like it .</td>', 'Mysterious. Lighting was very good. I like it .', '2005-08-24 03:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638499, 221083, 37844, '<td valign="top">Would have liked it better if top and bottom were closer to same shade. Nice composition though.</td>', 'Would have liked it better if top and bottom were closer to same shade. Nice composition though.', '2005-08-24 04:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638510, 221187, 37844, '<td valign="top">I felt this was somewhat overexposed and flat.  Needed  some shadow to give her more shape. Center of chest is blown away by the light.  I also think it would have worked better for me if her arms were not cut off. I would suggest bending them and linking her fingers behind her head. Good looking model.</td>', 'I felt this was somewhat overexposed and flat.  Needed  some shadow to give her more shape. Center of chest is blown away by the light.  I also think it would have worked better for me if her arms were not cut off. I would suggest bending them and linking her fingers behind her head. Good looking model.', '2005-08-24 04:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638513, 219022, 37844, '<td valign="top">Subtle. Interesting in black and white.  Maybe a little darker than i would like but good job.</td>', 'Subtle. Interesting in black and white.  Maybe a little darker than i would like but good job.', '2005-08-24 04:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1638514, 219364, 37844, '<td valign="top">not as exciting as it could have been, but interesting.</td>', 'not as exciting as it could have been, but interesting.', '2005-08-24 04:09:48.000000', NULL, 1);
