(1640669, 221040, 23924, '<td valign="top">From the looks of things, it appears that one could be three before the vote finishes on this challenge.  I really like this, the pose is very intimate but modest and conveys the trust and bond between the husband and wife. The lighting is very good, the expressions are good.  I would have liked to have seen the mother''s hand unfolded and resting on the husband''s arm just to give her a physical connection to him but I am nit-picking and giving this a 10 anyway</td>', 'From the looks of things, it appears that one could be three before the vote finishes on this challenge.  I really like this, the pose is very intimate but modest and conveys the trust and bond between the husband and wife. The lighting is very good, the expressions are good.  I would have liked to have seen the mother''s hand unfolded and resting on the husband''s arm just to give her a physical connection to him but I am nit-picking and giving this a 10 anyway', '2005-08-24 14:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
