(1641023, 221143, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a little too staurated to work as well as it ought to, IMO, and it''s showing too little bosy/BG separation also, for me. I don''t ask for a lot of it, but I can hardly make out ANY separation on the right side. Even the left side could use a little more. It''s a well-seen shot, shows imagination and strong composition; I think it just needs better post-processing to be the best it could be.</td>', 'This is a little too staurated to work as well as it ought to, IMO, and it''s showing too little bosy/BG separation also, for me. I don''t ask for a lot of it, but I can hardly make out ANY separation on the right side. Even the left side could use a little more. It''s a well-seen shot, shows imagination and strong composition; I think it just needs better post-processing to be the best it could be.', '2005-08-24 16:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
