(1641635, 221241, 23318, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the odd comment. I love the pose, and the ultra red lips are ALMOST too much, but very lovely. I think the picture looks a bit over sharpened, could also be reduction fragments. The shadow on the background is also distracting. Good luck</td>', 'Sorry about the odd comment. I love the pose, and the ultra red lips are ALMOST too much, but very lovely. I think the picture looks a bit over sharpened, could also be reduction fragments. The shadow on the background is also distracting. Good luck', '2005-08-24 18:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641657, 221186, 23318, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, and I love the choice of black and white. I think the pose is what causes me to not enjoy this so much. I can''t put my finger on what could improve it, but I think it''s something as simple as what angle he pose makes on the image. Something slightly different might have been better. Good luck.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, and I love the choice of black and white. I think the pose is what causes me to not enjoy this so much. I can''t put my finger on what could improve it, but I think it''s something as simple as what angle he pose makes on the image. Something slightly different might have been better. Good luck.', '2005-08-24 18:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641671, 219771, 25571, '<td valign="top">Strong and very focused lighting, which gives a very powerfull feeling over the model. Composition is inviting if perharps a little bit claustrophobic on the sides. The body''s reflection gives a unique look and goes well with the whites of the model''s eyes, which in turn are very bright and... scary? ;)  One thing i don''t like so much is the reflection from the plexiglass on the far left, breaking a bit of the uniformity of the composition. I would''ve liked a frame to go with this shot as well! Overall, very good and unique mastery of the lighting! Thumbs up to photographer and Model! 9</td>', 'Strong and very focused lighting, which gives a very powerfull feeling over the model. Composition is inviting if perharps a little bit claustrophobic on the sides. The body''s reflection gives a unique look and goes well with the whites of the model''s eyes, which in turn are very bright and... scary? ;)  One thing i don''t like so much is the reflection from the plexiglass on the far left, breaking a bit of the uniformity of the composition. I would''ve liked a frame to go with this shot as well! Overall, very good and unique mastery of the lighting! Thumbs up to photographer and Model! 9', '2005-08-24 18:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641680, 221070, 23318, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. THis is one of my favorites. I slightly question the use of black and white. I''d love to see this shot in color as well. I''m certain that the reduction to fit to DPC standards hurt you the most, as her details, as well as those in the leaves and trees are lost. I think those items being restored, may have been a higher score. Hopefully I''m wrong. :)</td>', 'Lovely shot. THis is one of my favorites. I slightly question the use of black and white. I''d love to see this shot in color as well. I''m certain that the reduction to fit to DPC standards hurt you the most, as her details, as well as those in the leaves and trees are lost. I think those items being restored, may have been a higher score. Hopefully I''m wrong. :)', '2005-08-24 18:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1641687, 220770, 23318, '<td valign="top">I think the image is slightly too desaturated. I''d like to see the color better on her hair and her lips. If she''s just paler than averae, sorry to you and the model, but the moss/lichen and flowers behind her look that way as well. Lovely pose, and composition however.</td>', 'I think the image is slightly too desaturated. I''d like to see the color better on her hair and her lips. If she''s just paler than averae, sorry to you and the model, but the moss/lichen and flowers behind her look that way as well. Lovely pose, and composition however.', '2005-08-24 18:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
