(1642613, 221143, 40355, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, but a bit fuzzy.  That aside, I really like the pose and the concept.  8</td>', 'Interesting lighting, but a bit fuzzy.  That aside, I really like the pose and the concept.  8', '2005-08-24 22:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
