(1642636, 219322, 40355, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  Points for being original.  Good composition and focus, well done!</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  Points for being original.  Good composition and focus, well done!', '2005-08-24 22:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1642640, 221256, 40355, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the entire shot is just a little too white.  A touch more contrast, to life the legs away from the background, would have improved this a lot!  Still, a good shot! 7</td>', 'Good idea, but the entire shot is just a little too white.  A touch more contrast, to life the legs away from the background, would have improved this a lot!  Still, a good shot! 7', '2005-08-24 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1642648, 220702, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and different.  Like the old-style look that it has.  Well done.</td>', 'This is interesting and different.  Like the old-style look that it has.  Well done.', '2005-08-24 22:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1642657, 221187, 40355, '<td valign="top">A lot of wash-out at the bottom of the shot.  The bright white draws the eye and is distracting.  Also, either the model is wearing a nose ring, which is also distracting, or it''s just a hot pixel.  Critiques aside, It''s a good shot.  Like the composition and the pose.  8</td>', 'A lot of wash-out at the bottom of the shot.  The bright white draws the eye and is distracting.  Also, either the model is wearing a nose ring, which is also distracting, or it''s just a hot pixel.  Critiques aside, It''s a good shot.  Like the composition and the pose.  8', '2005-08-24 22:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
