(1642715, 221138, 17837, '<td valign="top">I love this image. I love the softness of the body, the lighting is almost perfect, the pose I think she should be gripping the apple, but who am I to complain. 9</td>', 'I love this image. I love the softness of the body, the lighting is almost perfect, the pose I think she should be gripping the apple, but who am I to complain. 9', '2005-08-24 23:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
