(1642721, 221052, 17837, '<td valign="top">the lighting is pretty good though a tad more contrast would help. the crop is a bit tight, and I think the pose is a bit bland.</td>', 'the lighting is pretty good though a tad more contrast would help. the crop is a bit tight, and I think the pose is a bit bland.', '2005-08-24 23:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
