(1643411, 221223, 37844, '<td valign="top">I love this one. Pose is unique and eye catching. Title even fits. I give it 10.</td>', 'I love this one. Pose is unique and eye catching. Title even fits. I give it 10.', '2005-08-25 02:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
