(1643422, 220977, 37844, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems way too harsh. But otherwise not bad at all.</td>', 'Lighting seems way too harsh. But otherwise not bad at all.', '2005-08-25 02:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643433, 219663, 37844, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, makes you wonder about it , which is good. One might think this man could be a prisoner of war. Good job.</td>', 'Interesting photo, makes you wonder about it , which is good. One might think this man could be a prisoner of war. Good job.', '2005-08-25 02:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643434, 221237, 29269, '<td valign="top">The lighting appears too harsh from the right... but I must agree that while it does not come close to the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=28005" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/115/thumb/28005.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/115/thumb/28005.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/115/thumb/28005.jpg"/></a>,<br/>it still ranks in top 20 for the challenge. 7.</td>', 'The lighting appears too harsh from the right... but I must agree that while it does not come close to the ,it still ranks in top 20 for the challenge. 7.', '2005-08-25 02:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643435, 220982, 37844, '<td valign="top">Water was a good choice, but there isn''t alot else to make you want to linger here.</td>', 'Water was a good choice, but there isn''t alot else to make you want to linger here.', '2005-08-25 02:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643437, 220108, 29269, '<td valign="top">For some reason, there are a lot of b/w photos that I scored very high in this challenge. Tastefully done, yet still provoking. If I may suggest slightly different composition, with your model occupying the right side of the photo, leaving more negative space to the left. It may improve this already excellent shot.</td>', 'For some reason, there are a lot of b/w photos that I scored very high in this challenge. Tastefully done, yet still provoking. If I may suggest slightly different composition, with your model occupying the right side of the photo, leaving more negative space to the left. It may improve this already excellent shot.', '2005-08-25 02:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643439, 221241, 37844, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see model looking more relaxed and natural.</td>', 'Would have liked to see model looking more relaxed and natural.', '2005-08-25 02:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643442, 220166, 37844, '<td valign="top">Not really nude, but very nice photo. Lighting is good.</td>', 'Not really nude, but very nice photo. Lighting is good.', '2005-08-25 02:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643444, 221251, 37844, '<td valign="top">Good  job. Lighting looks good, title fits. Makes you want to see more.</td>', 'Good  job. Lighting looks good, title fits. Makes you want to see more.', '2005-08-25 02:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643451, 220028, 37844, '<td valign="top">I felt this could have been better and had more impact if her arms had been outstretched or touching her hair instead of caught in mid air. Otherwise, very lovely.</td>', 'I felt this could have been better and had more impact if her arms had been outstretched or touching her hair instead of caught in mid air. Otherwise, very lovely.', '2005-08-25 02:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643453, 221015, 37844, '<td valign="top">I find the darker shade of her arms distracting. and I''m not sure your backlighting  is as effective as it could be for you.  She''s a lovely model and i think if you keep working with her, you''ll come up this something great.</td>', 'I find the darker shade of her arms distracting. and I''m not sure your backlighting  is as effective as it could be for you.  She''s a lovely model and i think if you keep working with her, you''ll come up this something great.', '2005-08-25 02:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643456, 219344, 37844, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. Good work.</td>', 'Simple and elegant. Good work.', '2005-08-25 02:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643459, 221147, 37844, '<td valign="top">Cute. I think it could be better without the knee taking up so much  space .</td>', 'Cute. I think it could be better without the knee taking up so much  space .', '2005-08-25 02:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643465, 220844, 37844, '<td valign="top">Love the light . Different and interesting. Yes, I beleive I do like it. You might want to experiment with different bandannas, white or black might look even better and keep the attention on the overall photo.</td>', 'Love the light . Different and interesting. Yes, I beleive I do like it. You might want to experiment with different bandannas, white or black might look even better and keep the attention on the overall photo.', '2005-08-25 03:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643468, 221219, 37844, '<td valign="top">Unique.</td>', 'Unique.', '2005-08-25 03:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643484, 220948, 37844, '<td valign="top">Love the use of the water. It''s  tantilizing and makes the effect sexier.  Black and white and natural light are all good choices. Her elbow closer into the tree would have kept it from being distracting. Great photo overall.</td>', 'Love the use of the water. It''s  tantilizing and makes the effect sexier.  Black and white and natural light are all good choices. Her elbow closer into the tree would have kept it from being distracting. Great photo overall.', '2005-08-25 03:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643485, 220656, 37844, '<td valign="top">Spooky.  Creative and well lit.</td>', 'Spooky.  Creative and well lit.', '2005-08-25 03:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643593, 220108, 40820, '<td valign="top">two white patches on top of the nose are a little distracting....otherwise...a superb shot</td>', 'two white patches on top of the nose are a little distracting....otherwise...a superb shot', '2005-08-25 04:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643595, 220298, 40820, '<td valign="top">love the pose and the lighting!...9</td>', 'love the pose and the lighting!...9', '2005-08-25 04:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643598, 221138, 40820, '<td valign="top">great idea...well presented...8</td>', 'great idea...well presented...8', '2005-08-25 04:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643600, 219696, 40820, '<td valign="top">mmm...why does this shot make me think of "As Good As It Gets"...?...nicely done...however i think you could have used the light to better effect on the back of your subject instead of having the whole area in shadow...6</td>', 'mmm...why does this shot make me think of "As Good As It Gets"...?...nicely done...however i think you could have used the light to better effect on the back of your subject instead of having the whole area in shadow...6', '2005-08-25 04:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643616, 220784, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the selective coloring on this, it gives it kind of a "victorian" look, and it has a nice sensual feel  The left side of the image is a bit distracting to me - the texture of the carpet, and the bit of black (that looks like it could be her shirt) spoil the otherwise soft, sensual look of the image.  The composition could be a bit more dynamic, with the jewel and rose being somewhere other than nearly dead center.</td>', 'I like the selective coloring on this, it gives it kind of a "victorian" look, and it has a nice sensual feel  The left side of the image is a bit distracting to me - the texture of the carpet, and the bit of black (that looks like it could be her shirt) spoil the otherwise soft, sensual look of the image.  The composition could be a bit more dynamic, with the jewel and rose being somewhere other than nearly dead center.', '2005-08-25 05:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643627, 218963, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the body, and the way it highlights the shapes.  I''m just not crazy about that red background!  I would love to have seen this with maybe a deep burgundy velvet or deep green velvet background to bring it more into the realm of sensuality.  The bright red, to me, makes it rather "raw".</td>', 'I like the lighting on the body, and the way it highlights the shapes.  I''m just not crazy about that red background!  I would love to have seen this with maybe a deep burgundy velvet or deep green velvet background to bring it more into the realm of sensuality.  The bright red, to me, makes it rather "raw".', '2005-08-25 05:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643628, 221017, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the color treatment, and the high-key look, but overall the image looks a little washed out to me. I like the general concept here, but feel that it would have been much more sensual if she had her arm wrapped around her breast so that it was more hidden.  She appears to be in a "self-protective" position, and, in my mind,  to have her breast hanging out like that just doesn''t fit with her body position.</td>', 'I love the color treatment, and the high-key look, but overall the image looks a little washed out to me. I like the general concept here, but feel that it would have been much more sensual if she had her arm wrapped around her breast so that it was more hidden.  She appears to be in a "self-protective" position, and, in my mind,  to have her breast hanging out like that just doesn''t fit with her body position.', '2005-08-25 06:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643629, 221055, 24983, '<td valign="top">clever 10</td>', 'clever 10', '2005-08-25 06:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643632, 220267, 2553, '<td valign="top">This has a kind of "sprite in the woods" look to it.  Very nice light.  It''s a bit raw for me, I would prefer to have seen the tiniest bit of gaussian blur on it to give it a softer feel.  I don''t like that I can''t see any of her face. I ''m also anxious to see if this is the same model that I have seen in some other photos recently.   If it is, I would have to say that the other photos were far more sensual.</td>', 'This has a kind of "sprite in the woods" look to it.  Very nice light.  It''s a bit raw for me, I would prefer to have seen the tiniest bit of gaussian blur on it to give it a softer feel.  I don''t like that I can''t see any of her face. I ''m also anxious to see if this is the same model that I have seen in some other photos recently.   If it is, I would have to say that the other photos were far more sensual.', '2005-08-25 06:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643633, 220472, 24983, '<td valign="top">not a flattering photo at all4</td>', 'not a flattering photo at all4', '2005-08-25 06:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643637, 220939, 2553, '<td valign="top">The title really throws me off - in my mind, it''s an odd collection of words. The composition on this is pretty good, but something about the image just doesn''t feel right.  It''s almost as though the black background area was erased or cloned or something.  It looks very unnatural, and choppy and hard-edged around her body.   I thought, at first glance, that it was black and white, but on her arms I see a purplish tone, and that looks a bit odd as well.</td>', 'The title really throws me off - in my mind, it''s an odd collection of words. The composition on this is pretty good, but something about the image just doesn''t feel right.  It''s almost as though the black background area was erased or cloned or something.  It looks very unnatural, and choppy and hard-edged around her body.   I thought, at first glance, that it was black and white, but on her arms I see a purplish tone, and that looks a bit odd as well.', '2005-08-25 06:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643639, 221087, 24983, '<td valign="top">clever and different 10</td>', 'clever and different 10', '2005-08-25 06:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643641, 218759, 30173, '<td valign="top">congrats Nick, to this artistic, perfect shot</td>', 'congrats Nick, to this artistic, perfect shot', '2005-08-25 06:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643642, 221237, 24983, '<td valign="top">impressive 10</td>', 'impressive 10', '2005-08-25 06:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643644, 220389, 24983, '<td valign="top">excellen t work real ribbon material here 10</td>', 'excellen t work real ribbon material here 10', '2005-08-25 06:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643646, 220146, 30173, '<td valign="top">Very somber. Must be taken in New Orleans ;)</td>', 'Very somber. Must be taken in New Orleans ;)', '2005-08-25 06:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643647, 220298, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.  Beautiful in black ans white; great lighting and composition; beautifully sensual.  My one "hitpick" - I would love to have seen some light on her hair - just the tiniest bit to catch some stray highlights.  A great entry for the challenge.</td>', 'Very, very nice.  Beautiful in black ans white; great lighting and composition; beautifully sensual.  My one "hitpick" - I would love to have seen some light on her hair - just the tiniest bit to catch some stray highlights.  A great entry for the challenge.', '2005-08-25 06:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643650, 221138, 2553, '<td valign="top">Terrific DOF that separates the subject from the background without making her *feel* separate from it.  Makes me think of a wood nymph.  Lovely softness, and nice color treatment.  The only thing that throws me here is the expression on her face.  I would have expected a softer, more engaged expression.  Overall though, very lovely.</td>', 'Terrific DOF that separates the subject from the background without making her *feel* separate from it.  Makes me think of a wood nymph.  Lovely softness, and nice color treatment.  The only thing that throws me here is the expression on her face.  I would have expected a softer, more engaged expression.  Overall though, very lovely.', '2005-08-25 06:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643651, 220701, 24983, '<td valign="top">JHillarious worth every bit of a 10 well conncieved and executed</td>', 'JHillarious worth every bit of a 10 well conncieved and executed', '2005-08-25 06:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643653, 220306, 2553, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept!  Nice lighting and compositional work.  The overall "grayness" of the image  makes it somewhat bland to me.  It is, nevertheless, an interesting shot.</td>', 'An interesting concept!  Nice lighting and compositional work.  The overall "grayness" of the image  makes it somewhat bland to me.  It is, nevertheless, an interesting shot.', '2005-08-25 06:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643655, 221114, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the concept, but you kind of lose me on the execution.  At first glance, this looks like she''s got one of those head things on,  like  the dancers in Las Vegas wear on their heads.  I find it difficult to try to separate her figure from all the bushes that seem to be growing out of her head and knees.   Bottom line for me is that the cluttered background and the textured floor draw my eyes away from the model.</td>', 'I love the concept, but you kind of lose me on the execution.  At first glance, this looks like she''s got one of those head things on,  like  the dancers in Las Vegas wear on their heads.  I find it difficult to try to separate her figure from all the bushes that seem to be growing out of her head and knees.   Bottom line for me is that the cluttered background and the textured floor draw my eyes away from the model.', '2005-08-25 06:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643656, 220948, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, beautiful pose, beautiful location, beautiful shot.  Just beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful model, beautiful pose, beautiful location, beautiful shot.  Just beautiful.', '2005-08-25 06:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643658, 221013, 12617, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and origional, would love to know how this was done!</td>', 'Very interesting and origional, would love to know how this was done!', '2005-08-25 06:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643659, 220382, 11467, '<td valign="top">Very artistic. <br/>Nice colours &amp; pose.<br/>For this challenge it would do better if there was more evidence that the subjects were in fact Nude.</td>', 'Very artistic. Nice colours & pose.For this challenge it would do better if there was more evidence that the subjects were in fact Nude.', '2005-08-25 06:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643660, 221249, 2553, '<td valign="top">What I like about this is the very high-key light that almost makes her look "metallic".  I love the position that she''s in - it looks natural, and the red panties are adorable.  What I don''t like is the rumpled, dingy- gray- looking  bedsheets.  That just ruins the presentation of the model for me.</td>', 'What I like about this is the very high-key light that almost makes her look "metallic".  I love the position that she''s in - it looks natural, and the red panties are adorable.  What I don''t like is the rumpled, dingy- gray- looking  bedsheets.  That just ruins the presentation of the model for me.', '2005-08-25 06:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643661, 220001, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think this would do better if the background wasn''t so uneven, and the apple was a little brighter &amp; sharper.</td>', 'I think this would do better if the background wasn''t so uneven, and the apple was a little brighter & sharper.', '2005-08-25 06:45:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1643662, 221087, 2553, '<td valign="top">Too cute!  Interesting exercise in exposure here, getting those little black and white guys just right.  An adorable shot.  This gets me on cuteness alone!</td>', 'Too cute!  Interesting exercise in exposure here, getting those little black and white guys just right.  An adorable shot.  This gets me on cuteness alone!', '2005-08-25 06:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643663, 221011, 2553, '<td valign="top">Pretty darn lovely shot.  the one spot of blinding white is a bit distracting, but not intolerably so.  I like the nice warm look of the shot.</td>', 'Pretty darn lovely shot.  the one spot of blinding white is a bit distracting, but not intolerably so.  I like the nice warm look of the shot.', '2005-08-25 06:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643665, 219022, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure etc. The photo is missing a bit of pop. I think if the model was more involved in the picture = more interaction, it would improve.<br/>Classic would be if you had managed to add a fish tail and the model was more sideways or facing the camera.</td>', 'Nice exposure etc. The photo is missing a bit of pop. I think if the model was more involved in the picture = more interaction, it would improve.Classic would be if you had managed to add a fish tail and the model was more sideways or facing the camera.', '2005-08-25 06:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643667, 220770, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better in B&amp;W. The colours look very cold, and uncomfortable for the model. This would also hide the splotchiness on the skin.  Composition is good. The back looks a little over exposed.</td>', 'I think this would be better in B&W. The colours look very cold, and uncomfortable for the model. This would also hide the splotchiness on the skin.  Composition is good. The back looks a little over exposed.', '2005-08-25 06:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643668, 219673, 11467, '<td valign="top">It isn''t a bad photo, just needs more to make it more interesting. There isn''t realy a point of attention to draw your interest.</td>', 'It isn''t a bad photo, just needs more to make it more interesting. There isn''t realy a point of attention to draw your interest.', '2005-08-25 06:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
