(1643673, 220988, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because it looks like you sneaked up on her while she was sunbathing. Nice light.  I like the expression on her face, she just looks natural.</td>', 'I like this shot because it looks like you sneaked up on her while she was sunbathing. Nice light.  I like the expression on her face, she just looks natural.', '2005-08-25 06:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643674, 220166, 11467, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but I think could be better executed.<br/>Lighting could be made waay more interesting. I assume this is done with the on camera flash or a light from the right.<br/>If the light was more from the left and was from a window or soft box, you woud get a light shadow on the right showing more contours of the body.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but I think could be better executed.Lighting could be made waay more interesting. I assume this is done with the on camera flash or a light from the right.If the light was more from the left and was from a window or soft box, you woud get a light shadow on the right showing more contours of the body.', '2005-08-25 06:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643677, 221070, 2553, '<td valign="top">In some ways, very lovely, and in some, very distracting.  There is so much "busyness" in the image that I find my eyes constantly being drawn to the branches/bushes/ground.  The model is lovely, and the lighting on her is beautiful, but I guess I''d like to see more model, less distraction.</td>', 'In some ways, very lovely, and in some, very distracting.  There is so much "busyness" in the image that I find my eyes constantly being drawn to the branches/bushes/ground.  The model is lovely, and the lighting on her is beautiful, but I guess I''d like to see more model, less distraction.', '2005-08-25 06:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
