(1643897, 221253, 37544, '<td valign="top">Her hair seems to dissapear with the background, maybe that was your idea.  I like the contrast even though it is overdone. My personal taste I guess. The only thing that really bothers me is her hand. The way she has her arm almost looks chimp like? It doesn''t look natural.</td>', 'Her hair seems to dissapear with the background, maybe that was your idea.  I like the contrast even though it is overdone. My personal taste I guess. The only thing that really bothers me is her hand. The way she has her arm almost looks chimp like? It doesn''t look natural.', '2005-08-25 09:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
