(1643904, 220146, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an artistic and striking image. I love the way the thin material looks like an image projected on to her body and almost creates an illusion of double explsure. Expression on her face and simple, tilted composition both work well as does the highly orange colour cast.</td>', 'What an artistic and striking image. I love the way the thin material looks like an image projected on to her body and almost creates an illusion of double explsure. Expression on her face and simple, tilted composition both work well as does the highly orange colour cast.', '2005-08-25 09:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643906, 221040, 3087, '<td valign="top">Usually the personal portraits don''t appeal to me - they are often too focused on the emotive and personal meanings with too little attention paid to composition, light and aesthetic appeal. This one is different - the lighting is really excellent, so too is the composition and it''s at the same time a very intimate and personal portrait and a universal image.</td>', 'Usually the personal portraits don''t appeal to me - they are often too focused on the emotive and personal meanings with too little attention paid to composition, light and aesthetic appeal. This one is different - the lighting is really excellent, so too is the composition and it''s at the same time a very intimate and personal portrait and a universal image.', '2005-08-25 09:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643907, 220725, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the humour, composition works well, definitely stands out from the crowd.</td>', 'Love the humour, composition works well, definitely stands out from the crowd.', '2005-08-25 09:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643912, 221015, 37544, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, they are great. I think that you could have done a better shot with this model for the challenge, the pose doesn''t flatter her at all. There are so many lines drawing your eye down to just arms. Looks more like a portait pose instead of an artistic nude</td>', 'I like the colors, they are great. I think that you could have done a better shot with this model for the challenge, the pose doesn''t flatter her at all. There are so many lines drawing your eye down to just arms. Looks more like a portait pose instead of an artistic nude', '2005-08-25 09:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643913, 221045, 3087, '<td valign="top">This one is very strong on the communication side - it talks to me of mental illness or of intense, unbearable pain. The focus is a touch soft - doesn''t hinder too much but I would prefer it to be sharper myself. Like the composition and also the colour cast of the light. Also the anonymity of the model makes it a stronger, more universal image.</td>', 'This one is very strong on the communication side - it talks to me of mental illness or of intense, unbearable pain. The focus is a touch soft - doesn''t hinder too much but I would prefer it to be sharper myself. Like the composition and also the colour cast of the light. Also the anonymity of the model makes it a stronger, more universal image.', '2005-08-25 09:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643914, 221087, 3087, '<td valign="top">Dang buy I have a soft spot for penguins (though not usually my bosoms) and this just totally appeals to me. But then I like surreal art and this is certainly that. I''m sure there could be all kinds of messages about womens'' bodies in comparison to peaks of snow drifts but I won''t ask! Works for me though!</td>', 'Dang buy I have a soft spot for penguins (though not usually my bosoms) and this just totally appeals to me. But then I like surreal art and this is certainly that. I''m sure there could be all kinds of messages about womens'' bodies in comparison to peaks of snow drifts but I won''t ask! Works for me though!', '2005-08-25 09:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1643916, 220974, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of low light levels and darkness to create an abstract from the human body. The curves and zig zags look almost more like random calligraphy swirls than they do a real person. Not sure about composition placing body towards top left corner - it feels to me that it might work better in lower left.</td>', 'Interesting use of low light levels and darkness to create an abstract from the human body. The curves and zig zags look almost more like random calligraphy swirls than they do a real person. Not sure about composition placing body towards top left corner - it feels to me that it might work better in lower left.', '2005-08-25 09:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
