(1644747, 219764, 17507, '<td valign="top">good pose and concept, and nice composition. critical sharpness is lacking. take this picture again and make it crisp and it would be a whole different story. I''d love to see texture in the hair and detail on the ink.</td>', 'good pose and concept, and nice composition. critical sharpness is lacking. take this picture again and make it crisp and it would be a whole different story. I''d love to see texture in the hair and detail on the ink.', '2005-08-25 15:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
