(1645009, 218617, 25655, '<td valign="top">something is strange for me about this picture.<br/>I just can not make up my mind as for what you were trying to show.<br/>The pose shows discomfort. maybe regret. The tones work with that.<br/>But the very harsh light is not, and nor do the smoothness of the pic.<br/>I think I would like to see a lot more grain in here, a lot darker whites and get those cats out of the blanket please.<br/>Also, I have to admit I don''t get a sense of nude in here. Nud is not your subject. It''s just one of the side effects.<br/>On the other hand, comparing to other shots in teh challenge, this is so much better then the most. And as a pic with no relation to the challenge, I think it''s nice.</td>', 'something is strange for me about this picture.I just can not make up my mind as for what you were trying to show.The pose shows discomfort. maybe regret. The tones work with that.But the very harsh light is not, and nor do the smoothness of the pic.I think I would like to see a lot more grain in here, a lot darker whites and get those cats out of the blanket please.Also, I have to admit I don''t get a sense of nude in here. Nud is not your subject. It''s just one of the side effects.On the other hand, comparing to other shots in teh challenge, this is so much better then the most. And as a pic with no relation to the challenge, I think it''s nice.', '2005-08-25 17:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1645024, 218963, 25655, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous crop. The red adds a lot to the erotics, while the light subtles it''s rudeness and make it so beautiful.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Gorgeous crop. The red adds a lot to the erotics, while the light subtles it''s rudeness and make it so beautiful. ', '2005-08-25 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
