(1645091, 220982, 8284, '<td valign="top">Just the tiniest bit too dark (my monitor?), but I like this shot.  Sharp focus, subtle light.</td>', 'Just the tiniest bit too dark (my monitor?), but I like this shot.  Sharp focus, subtle light.', '2005-08-25 17:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1645104, 221223, 8284, '<td valign="top">This image is growing on me, but it doesn''t pop.  My suggestions:<br/>Even out the lighting.  Right side is brighter than the left.<br/>Brush/cut her hair.  I just looks unkempt.<br/>Do something with her hands.  Spread fingers maybe?  They are just hanging there like they aren''t part of the shot.<br/>Use a support item that either truly blends into the background or contrasts with it.</td>', 'This image is growing on me, but it doesn''t pop.  My suggestions:Even out the lighting.  Right side is brighter than the left.Brush/cut her hair.  I just looks unkempt.Do something with her hands.  Spread fingers maybe?  They are just hanging there like they aren''t part of the shot.Use a support item that either truly blends into the background or contrasts with it.', '2005-08-25 17:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
