(1647161, 220988, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of a beautiful model, because it brings a very playful mood to the challenge.  The texture and colors in the hair are very delightful, and the overall colors are very nice.  The only thing that seems a little ''not right'' is her eye, maybe too much make up or something by her iris seems to blend right in to her eyelashes.  Otherwise, beautiful lighting, and a great use of DOF make this an outstanding image.  This image tells a lot about this lovely model, even the tan lines would indicate she is completely in charactor as a fun and playful person to be around.  This would be a great shot to be used as a portrait as well.  Certainly will be added to my favorites.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is a great shot of a beautiful model, because it brings a very playful mood to the challenge.  The texture and colors in the hair are very delightful, and the overall colors are very nice.  The only thing that seems a little ''not right'' is her eye, maybe too much make up or something by her iris seems to blend right in to her eyelashes.  Otherwise, beautiful lighting, and a great use of DOF make this an outstanding image.  This image tells a lot about this lovely model, even the tan lines would indicate she is completely in charactor as a fun and playful person to be around.  This would be a great shot to be used as a portrait as well.  Certainly will be added to my favorites.  <9>', '2005-08-26 10:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
