(1647709, 221143, 22537, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I like the originality of this shot though I wish you would have made the setting a bit more appealing.  Good work none the less.</td>', 'Very creative.  I like the originality of this shot though I wish you would have made the setting a bit more appealing.  Good work none the less.', '2005-08-26 15:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647752, 218831, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is out of the box, but good.  I like it.</td>', 'This is out of the box, but good.  I like it.', '2005-08-26 15:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647780, 221147, 32378, '<td valign="top">Some may not like your play on words.  But I applaud you for taking the risk.  The light on the knee is a little hot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Some may not like your play on words.  But I applaud you for taking the risk.  The light on the knee is a little hot.  Good luck.', '2005-08-26 15:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647781, 220663, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting to capture all the detail and textures.  Not sure ya need so much negative space at the bottom though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice lighting to capture all the detail and textures.  Not sure ya need so much negative space at the bottom though...TC', '2005-08-26 15:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647782, 221088, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot.  Good Luck.  10</td>', 'This is a lovely shot.  Good Luck.  10', '2005-08-26 15:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647786, 221209, 32378, '<td valign="top">I love the softness of this shot, evrything appears so smooth.  Very well done.  Good luck.</td>', 'I love the softness of this shot, evrything appears so smooth.  Very well done.  Good luck.', '2005-08-26 15:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647787, 219237, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO this does not meet the challenge and is (MHO) mildly insulting to some of us that were brave enough to get outside our comfort zone and shoot or pose for a true nude shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO this does not meet the challenge and is (MHO) mildly insulting to some of us that were brave enough to get outside our comfort zone and shoot or pose for a true nude shot.TC', '2005-08-26 15:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647788, 219344, 32378, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.  This shot says it all.  10</td>', 'Outstanding.  This shot says it all.  10', '2005-08-26 15:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647791, 220927, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the play of light and shadows in this shot as well as the color tone.  Only minor distraction is the spot on the door that I would have cloned out.</td>', 'I like the play of light and shadows in this shot as well as the color tone.  Only minor distraction is the spot on the door that I would have cloned out.', '2005-08-26 15:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647795, 221219, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the challenge.  I do think that if you cropped just a tad smaller maybe even going with a square crop this would have a little more punch.  I''m not sure that that much negative space at the bottom is needed.  I love the detail in the rocks and how the light effects different parts of the shot differently due to it''s direction.  Wish I could see this at 8x10 instead of 640 by whatever...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice take on the challenge.  I do think that if you cropped just a tad smaller maybe even going with a square crop this would have a little more punch.  I''m not sure that that much negative space at the bottom is needed.  I love the detail in the rocks and how the light effects different parts of the shot differently due to it''s direction.  Wish I could see this at 8x10 instead of 640 by whatever...TC', '2005-08-26 15:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647796, 221070, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done.  If I were to do anything to this it would be to possibly crop a little off the top.</td>', 'This is very nicely done.  If I were to do anything to this it would be to possibly crop a little off the top.', '2005-08-26 15:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647807, 220108, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I like the softness and the lighting.  Her expression fits the title perfectly. 10</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I like the softness and the lighting.  Her expression fits the title perfectly. 10', '2005-08-26 15:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647810, 220989, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a cool take on the challenge, but IMHO the shot is too cluttered.  There is SO much going on here like all the remotes.  They do not really add to the shot but rather give it a busy feel.  Feet TV maybe one remote and maybe a cold beer :-) and this would work much better.  Oh, you''re a little soft on focus throughout also.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a cool take on the challenge, but IMHO the shot is too cluttered.  There is SO much going on here like all the remotes.  They do not really add to the shot but rather give it a busy feel.  Feet TV maybe one remote and maybe a cold beer :-) and this would work much better.  Oh, you''re a little soft on focus throughout also.TC', '2005-08-26 15:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647813, 221090, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice and soft.  Great colors.  Your lighting though not horribly original is nice and subtle.  Good job!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice and soft.  Great colors.  Your lighting though not horribly original is nice and subtle.  Good job!TC', '2005-08-26 15:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647814, 218235, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the overall lighting on this shot, perhaps I would have softened it on her hand and shoulder.  It a small thing, otherwise a lovely shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the overall lighting on this shot, perhaps I would have softened it on her hand and shoulder.  It a small thing, otherwise a lovely shot.  Good luck.', '2005-08-26 15:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647822, 221040, 32378, '<td valign="top">Each time I look at this shot I like it more.  Lighting is very nice.</td>', 'Each time I look at this shot I like it more.  Lighting is very nice.', '2005-08-26 15:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647826, 220383, 32378, '<td valign="top">Sorry this just doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Sorry this just doesn''t do it for me.', '2005-08-26 15:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647828, 221248, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is too soft for me, would like to have been able to tell what it is as soon as I looked at it instead of having to study it.</td>', 'This is too soft for me, would like to have been able to tell what it is as soon as I looked at it instead of having to study it.', '2005-08-26 16:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647830, 219364, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is too dark for my taste.  It may be my monitor but there appear to be streaks in the head area.</td>', 'This is too dark for my taste.  It may be my monitor but there appear to be streaks in the head area.', '2005-08-26 16:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647833, 219237, 32378, '<td valign="top">Although this isn''t clothed I dont think this fits.</td>', 'Although this isn''t clothed I dont think this fits.', '2005-08-26 16:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647923, 220927, 43158, '<td valign="top">beautiful light</td>', 'beautiful light', '2005-08-26 16:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647930, 220974, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wish this had a larger tonal range - image is a little dark (probably heard that already).  Crop seems a little off - more in the back than the front, I assume you have your reasons but it feels a little unabalanced.  Like the position of the model.  Lighting is okay - relates to tonal range - would like to see slightly stronger light.  Honestly, I really like this image, especially its sculptural qualities but I think the lack of range hurts it a little.  Would like to see it again...  6 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wish this had a larger tonal range - image is a little dark (probably heard that already).  Crop seems a little off - more in the back than the front, I assume you have your reasons but it feels a little unabalanced.  Like the position of the model.  Lighting is okay - relates to tonal range - would like to see slightly stronger light.  Honestly, I really like this image, especially its sculptural qualities but I think the lack of range hurts it a little.  Would like to see it again...  6 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-08-26 16:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647934, 221209, 34192, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose and composition.  Nice tonal range.  Lighting okay, crop okay. 6 - good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting pose and composition.  Nice tonal range.  Lighting okay, crop okay. 6 - good luck in the challenge.', '2005-08-26 16:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647937, 221083, 34192, '<td valign="top">Composition interesting.  I think it would be improved if the empty space was to the left instead of right.  Her rings are a distraction. 6- good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Composition interesting.  I think it would be improved if the empty space was to the left instead of right.  Her rings are a distraction. 6- good luck in the challenge!', '2005-08-26 17:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1647984, 220267, 42885, '<td valign="top">nice shot and fucosing on the hair</td>', 'nice shot and fucosing on the hair', '2005-08-26 17:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
