(1648009, 220988, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, the composition is great. A little more sharpness around the face area and this would have been a winner!</td>', 'Good idea, the composition is great. A little more sharpness around the face area and this would have been a winner!', '2005-08-26 17:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648012, 220496, 5728, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the cropping on this, the lips have been cut off too severely, I woud have prefered to see a touch more face.</td>', 'I don''t really like the cropping on this, the lips have been cut off too severely, I woud have prefered to see a touch more face.', '2005-08-26 17:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648015, 220275, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good, only the background spoils it somewhat.</td>', 'This is good, only the background spoils it somewhat.', '2005-08-26 17:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648093, 220108, 31965, '<td valign="top">Very nice...</td>', 'Very nice...', '2005-08-26 18:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648154, 219663, 30364, '<td valign="top">We wants it, precious!  Lovely image; tortured and tortuous.  9</td>', 'We wants it, precious!  Lovely image; tortured and tortuous.  9', '2005-08-26 19:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648157, 218235, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice image with meticulously good lighting.. And the polished floor against the black background gives is a more powerful impact.  8</td>', 'It''s a nice image with meticulously good lighting.. And the polished floor against the black background gives is a more powerful impact.  8', '2005-08-26 19:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648170, 220298, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s well done.  Unusual decision to light from the left, thus leaving the closer side of the model in silhouette; I think that makes the legs appear a little awkward rather than graceful.  Obviously your intent was to emphasise the torso, so maybe that explains it?   Nevertheless, a fine image.  7</td>', 'It''s well done.  Unusual decision to light from the left, thus leaving the closer side of the model in silhouette; I think that makes the legs appear a little awkward rather than graceful.  Obviously your intent was to emphasise the torso, so maybe that explains it?   Nevertheless, a fine image.  7', '2005-08-26 19:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648179, 218865, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition and cropping!  Makes an interesting and original image, if a little disjointed or fractured (which was clearly part of your intention).  Right hand is wonderful, spread on the chest.  The left wrist &amp; hand are not clearly defined, and I think are therefore slightly confusing.  But a good, original idea.  7</td>', 'Terrific composition and cropping!  Makes an interesting and original image, if a little disjointed or fractured (which was clearly part of your intention).  Right hand is wonderful, spread on the chest.  The left wrist & hand are not clearly defined, and I think are therefore slightly confusing.  But a good, original idea.  7', '2005-08-26 19:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648181, 220472, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think the the area of focus would have been better on her lovely soulful face. I like the point of view. The blanket is a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'I think the the area of focus would have been better on her lovely soulful face. I like the point of view. The blanket is a bit of a distraction.', '2005-08-26 19:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648186, 220927, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very fine image.  I admire how you were able to achieve such an elegant yet casual pose; it hints at classical statuary, but the door provides a nice contrasting feeling of informality.  Awesome lighting;  I think it''s all natural light, but if so there''s some cleverly reflected light creating a subtle fill effect that''s exactly right.   The model''s shadow on the door also works especially well.  It''s my top choice ... 10</td>', 'A very fine image.  I admire how you were able to achieve such an elegant yet casual pose; it hints at classical statuary, but the door provides a nice contrasting feeling of informality.  Awesome lighting;  I think it''s all natural light, but if so there''s some cleverly reflected light creating a subtle fill effect that''s exactly right.   The model''s shadow on the door also works especially well.  It''s my top choice ... 10', '2005-08-26 19:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648188, 221015, 11800, '<td valign="top">The use of the backlight really helps to separate the model from the background.  The pose has a classic portrait look. I don''t think it fits well with this challenge but would fit well with another type. There seems to be a color problem in the picture. Her face has a greenish tint and the color on her forearms is uneven. This might have been caused by a slight underexposure.</td>', 'The use of the backlight really helps to separate the model from the background.  The pose has a classic portrait look. I don''t think it fits well with this challenge but would fit well with another type. There seems to be a color problem in the picture. Her face has a greenish tint and the color on her forearms is uneven. This might have been caused by a slight underexposure.', '2005-08-26 19:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648197, 219696, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very classic look. The blinds, bottles and soothing blues make this easy to look at. The pose matches the surroundings. The only thing that, to me, causes this to have a sub 10 score is the post processing. The outline seems to harsh. This would have been great with a soft focus feel to it.</td>', 'Very classic look. The blinds, bottles and soothing blues make this easy to look at. The pose matches the surroundings. The only thing that, to me, causes this to have a sub 10 score is the post processing. The outline seems to harsh. This would have been great with a soft focus feel to it.', '2005-08-26 19:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648199, 221052, 11800, '<td valign="top">To me, this calls for a more sharp focus and more contrast.</td>', 'To me, this calls for a more sharp focus and more contrast.', '2005-08-26 19:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648212, 220001, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like these out of the box pictures. This picture seems to be to balanced ( I think that''s the first time I''ve ever had to say that).  Both objects carry the same visual weight. The viewer''s eyes bounce back and forth between the two. What would help is for the photographer to decide which object is to be the subject and then use the other object to reinforce that idea. To me, this is a nice idea that was poorly executed.</td>', 'I like these out of the box pictures. This picture seems to be to balanced ( I think that''s the first time I''ve ever had to say that).  Both objects carry the same visual weight. The viewer''s eyes bounce back and forth between the two. What would help is for the photographer to decide which object is to be the subject and then use the other object to reinforce that idea. To me, this is a nice idea that was poorly executed.', '2005-08-26 20:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648250, 220306, 11800, '<td valign="top">Funny that this idea was just used in the last challenge and someone still questioned if it was real. Almost flawless execution. I like how the model''s arms are within the frame, it adds to the unreality of the picture. The only nit is the skirt. The waistband showing against the frame sorta ruins the effect.  Bumping up because of the work it took to create this.</td>', 'Funny that this idea was just used in the last challenge and someone still questioned if it was real. Almost flawless execution. I like how the model''s arms are within the frame, it adds to the unreality of the picture. The only nit is the skirt. The waistband showing against the frame sorta ruins the effect.  Bumping up because of the work it took to create this.', '2005-08-26 20:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648265, 220985, 11800, '<td valign="top">Ouch. That must have been painful. At first I was thinking this was to contrasty, but now I think it''s a good choice. It adds the the mood of the picture and makes the scar the main subject. I like the repeated line in the cememt wall. Good job. I think I''ll bump this up. gl</td>', 'Ouch. That must have been painful. At first I was thinking this was to contrasty, but now I think it''s a good choice. It adds the the mood of the picture and makes the scar the main subject. I like the repeated line in the cememt wall. Good job. I think I''ll bump this up. gl', '2005-08-26 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
