(1648540, 221223, 11800, '<td valign="top">The only thing keeping me from giving a higher score is the overexposure on the pedestal.  I like the pose very much and the lighting on the model is perfect.  Since the pedestal blends in so well, the photographer might have used one without the scrollwork and it wouldn''t have been noticed as much. Those are my humble thoughts. I could never take a picture this good, so forgive me if this upsets you.</td>', 'The only thing keeping me from giving a higher score is the overexposure on the pedestal.  I like the pose very much and the lighting on the model is perfect.  Since the pedestal blends in so well, the photographer might have used one without the scrollwork and it wouldn''t have been noticed as much. Those are my humble thoughts. I could never take a picture this good, so forgive me if this upsets you.', '2005-08-26 22:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
