(1648720, 220919, 33552, '<td valign="top">A bit flat, and very cold. You could add contrast with curves or levels, and a hue / saturation layer set to colorize with an orange tone and reduced opacity could warm this up a bit. I feel it would improve this image, but this is a very personal judgement and depending on the mood you were going for, you may not agree.</td>', 'A bit flat, and very cold. You could add contrast with curves or levels, and a hue / saturation layer set to colorize with an orange tone and reduced opacity could warm this up a bit. I feel it would improve this image, but this is a very personal judgement and depending on the mood you were going for, you may not agree.', '2005-08-26 23:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648734, 220689, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice tone, but soft. This image might benefit from a very deep DOF, with as much detail as possible brought out by the conversion to b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice tone, but soft. This image might benefit from a very deep DOF, with as much detail as possible brought out by the conversion to b&w.', '2005-08-27 00:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648739, 221087, 25678, '<td valign="top">So how many times did you have to reset the penguins?<br/> <br/>J/K All kidding aside, a very nice photo.  Very clever and well executed photo</td>', 'So how many times did you have to reset the penguins? J/K All kidding aside, a very nice photo.  Very clever and well executed photo', '2005-08-27 00:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648744, 220275, 25678, '<td valign="top">I really like the implications of this photo.  Very well done and the facelessness (is that a word?) is a nice touch.  The only thing is maybe a slightly longer crop so you see more of her body might have made the photo a bit better compositionally.</td>', 'I really like the implications of this photo.  Very well done and the facelessness (is that a word?) is a nice touch.  The only thing is maybe a slightly longer crop so you see more of her body might have made the photo a bit better compositionally.', '2005-08-27 00:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648745, 220374, 33552, '<td valign="top">A bit flat. The left arm and right ... red thing(?) distract from the interesting curves and shadows on the models back.</td>', 'A bit flat. The left arm and right ... red thing(?) distract from the interesting curves and shadows on the models back.', '2005-08-27 00:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648748, 221143, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Would have liked to see more detail (lighter background) around the hair/face.</td>', 'Very nice. Would have liked to see more detail (lighter background) around the hair/face.', '2005-08-27 00:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648751, 220948, 25678, '<td valign="top">I like they way the water contrasts against her face and how the highlights in the water start at the post.  Excellent use of reflection, elements and light!  My only comment is her pose.  Maybe it''s just me, but it seems a slightly akward pose having her elbows bent that much and her hands behind her back like that.  Beautiful photo</td>', 'I like they way the water contrasts against her face and how the highlights in the water start at the post.  Excellent use of reflection, elements and light!  My only comment is her pose.  Maybe it''s just me, but it seems a slightly akward pose having her elbows bent that much and her hands behind her back like that.  Beautiful photo', '2005-08-27 00:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648753, 219364, 33552, '<td valign="top">You might want to try moving the subject off of center. I would still consider breaking the rule of thirds here. An unexpected subject position would add interest to this image. Otherwise you might crop off some of the black space.</td>', 'You might want to try moving the subject off of center. I would still consider breaking the rule of thirds here. An unexpected subject position would add interest to this image. Otherwise you might crop off some of the black space.', '2005-08-27 00:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648764, 220839, 33552, '<td valign="top">Very nice, classy shot. A slight lighting adjustment (softer light or hair light) might have been more flattering to your model.</td>', 'Very nice, classy shot. A slight lighting adjustment (softer light or hair light) might have been more flattering to your model.', '2005-08-27 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648771, 220939, 33552, '<td valign="top">A fun shot. I would recommend a slightly tighter crop with a slight rotation to exaggerate the lines on your subject.</td>', 'A fun shot. I would recommend a slightly tighter crop with a slight rotation to exaggerate the lines on your subject.', '2005-08-27 00:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648788, 218963, 33552, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot. Excellent tone and a complementary background. The red on the models back is a bit disturbing though.</td>', 'A very nice shot. Excellent tone and a complementary background. The red on the models back is a bit disturbing though.', '2005-08-27 00:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648791, 220028, 33552, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, but a less busy background and a lower POV would have improved this image IMO.</td>', 'Well exposed, but a less busy background and a lower POV would have improved this image IMO.', '2005-08-27 00:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648808, 220496, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but to improve composition without showing your models face, try focusing on a specific characteristic (body part, etc.). The half-face and towel distract from what seems to be your intended subject.</td>', 'Nice shot, but to improve composition without showing your models face, try focusing on a specific characteristic (body part, etc.). The half-face and towel distract from what seems to be your intended subject.', '2005-08-27 00:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
