(1648925, 221070, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but I think it may have bee taken during not the best time of day for the shot.  The model is almost lost in the clutter of the tree branches and leaves.  The lighting adds to the effect.  If there wasn''t so much light coming through the trees it would subue them a little and help the eye linger on the model a little more.  Nice composition that was well thought out.  I would love to see this reshot at a different time of day!<br/>TC</td>', 'Great concept, but I think it may have bee taken during not the best time of day for the shot.  The model is almost lost in the clutter of the tree branches and leaves.  The lighting adds to the effect.  If there wasn''t so much light coming through the trees it would subue them a little and help the eye linger on the model a little more.  Nice composition that was well thought out.  I would love to see this reshot at a different time of day!TC', '2005-08-27 01:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648927, 220075, 20662, '<td valign="top">made me laugh! a man doing laundry - get real ;-)</td>', 'made me laugh! a man doing laundry - get real ;-)', '2005-08-27 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648929, 220948, 33400, '<td valign="top">beautiful continuity with the reflection in the water.</td>', 'beautiful continuity with the reflection in the water.', '2005-08-27 01:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648933, 221147, 9906, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Your red background is almost obnoxious in it''s tone and saturation.  If you coulda dropped the red levels a little I think it would be more appealing to me.  Your focus seems to be on the models knee and not the kittens eyes where it would look more natural.  Nice work overall.<br/>TC</td>', 'Cute!  Your red background is almost obnoxious in it''s tone and saturation.  If you coulda dropped the red levels a little I think it would be more appealing to me.  Your focus seems to be on the models knee and not the kittens eyes where it would look more natural.  Nice work overall.TC', '2005-08-27 01:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648938, 220656, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I can''t wait to see the set up for this one.  Your lighting on the model looks odd though.  His colors look a little washed out.  Is this from the desat that you did perhaps?  One to see in color after the challenge.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great shot.  I can''t wait to see the set up for this one.  Your lighting on the model looks odd though.  His colors look a little washed out.  Is this from the desat that you did perhaps?  One to see in color after the challenge.TC', '2005-08-27 01:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648940, 220389, 33400, '<td valign="top">If we all looked like this there would be more pictures of us..  Very nice shot - excellent lighting and texture.</td>', 'If we all looked like this there would be more pictures of us..  Very nice shot - excellent lighting and texture.', '2005-08-27 01:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648952, 220927, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and real.  I like it.</td>', 'Very sharp and real.  I like it.', '2005-08-27 01:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648961, 221209, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I hate to be picky, but the eyelashes are distracting.  Everything else is soft and pretty, but they look phony, especially for bedtime.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I hate to be picky, but the eyelashes are distracting.  Everything else is soft and pretty, but they look phony, especially for bedtime.', '2005-08-27 01:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648967, 220663, 33400, '<td valign="top">THis is almost a surreal type of shot.  I find the details on the ends of the bed distracting.  Perhaps a tigher crop would have been better, or maybe a crisper look to the sheets.</td>', 'THis is almost a surreal type of shot.  I find the details on the ends of the bed distracting.  Perhaps a tigher crop would have been better, or maybe a crisper look to the sheets.', '2005-08-27 01:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648982, 221087, 33400, '<td valign="top">funny and clever - a wonderful idea.  (lucky penguins..)</td>', 'funny and clever - a wonderful idea.  (lucky penguins..)', '2005-08-27 01:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648984, 221150, 9906, '<td valign="top">At first I wasn''t sure about this shot but the more I look at it the more I like it''s subtle elegance!  You have just enough detail to make it work.  Kudos from me.  I have a feeling though that you aren''t getting the score that I feel it deserves!<br/>TC</td>', 'At first I wasn''t sure about this shot but the more I look at it the more I like it''s subtle elegance!  You have just enough detail to make it work.  Kudos from me.  I have a feeling though that you aren''t getting the score that I feel it deserves!TC', '2005-08-27 01:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648987, 220670, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great lighting to bring out the detail and the depth of the shot.  I''m not sure if I like how it''s turned 90 degrees though.  Good job.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great lighting to bring out the detail and the depth of the shot.  I''m not sure if I like how it''s turned 90 degrees though.  Good job.TC', '2005-08-27 01:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1648996, 221114, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL  The first thing that I thought when I saw this shot was ''Ow, isn''t that hot in the crotch!''  :-P  I like how the lighting being in the center of the compostion effects each part of the shot because if the lights direction!<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL  The first thing that I thought when I saw this shot was ''Ow, isn''t that hot in the crotch!''  :-P  I like how the lighting being in the center of the compostion effects each part of the shot because if the lights direction!TC', '2005-08-27 01:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649003, 220028, 9906, '<td valign="top">The models pose doesn''t look very natural and the lighting is a little harsh making this look quite flat.  I think the same shot at a much later or earlier time of day would be much more effective!  Thanks for entering.<br/>TC</td>', 'The models pose doesn''t look very natural and the lighting is a little harsh making this look quite flat.  I think the same shot at a much later or earlier time of day would be much more effective!  Thanks for entering.TC', '2005-08-27 01:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649014, 220028, 1796, '<td valign="top">I guess you get all these silly comments saying that a nude without at least a visible butt crack is no nude  -  right or wrong?<br/> <br/>Anyway, I think this is a very cool shot. I love the contrast between the different shades of blue and the fabulous skin tone. The hair and the tatoos add to the overall quality of the shot. I might have tried a less thight crop and possibly a more interesting composition, too. Then again, I don''t know what your setup was and whether the background and/or subject would have allowed you to change these things.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps<br/> <br/>Bruno</td>', 'I guess you get all these silly comments saying that a nude without at least a visible butt crack is no nude  -  right or wrong? Anyway, I think this is a very cool shot. I love the contrast between the different shades of blue and the fabulous skin tone. The hair and the tatoos add to the overall quality of the shot. I might have tried a less thight crop and possibly a more interesting composition, too. Then again, I don''t know what your setup was and whether the background and/or subject would have allowed you to change these things. Hope this helps Bruno', '2005-08-27 01:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649020, 218617, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but the first thing I thought when I saw this was that it should be a blueish tone to match the title instead of a yellow-greenish tone as you have here.  Maybe try it and see if it changes the mood of the shot...  Great compostion and the soft focus on the model works perfectly.<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t know why, but the first thing I thought when I saw this was that it should be a blueish tone to match the title instead of a yellow-greenish tone as you have here.  Maybe try it and see if it changes the mood of the shot...  Great compostion and the soft focus on the model works perfectly.TC', '2005-08-27 01:30:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1649030, 220684, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great pose, but your lighting being so direct and in line with the camera makes the shot appear flat.  Not sure the flower adds to the composition.  Nice work<br/>TC</td>', 'Great pose, but your lighting being so direct and in line with the camera makes the shot appear flat.  Not sure the flower adds to the composition.  Nice workTC', '2005-08-27 01:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649038, 221243, 37961, '<td valign="top">Oh dear God. This is hilarious!</td>', 'Oh dear God. This is hilarious!', '2005-08-27 01:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649039, 221243, 9906, '<td valign="top">If this is you shooting the april fools challenge, you''re missing grapes!  :-P  Great lighting and soft focus effects on the ducks.<br/>TC</td>', 'If this is you shooting the april fools challenge, you''re missing grapes!  :-P  Great lighting and soft focus effects on the ducks.TC', '2005-08-27 01:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649043, 220473, 1796, '<td valign="top">If I was Beavis or Butthead, I''d say: "wow, big a$$, hu, huhu, chicks are so hot..."  ;-)<br/> <br/>As I''m not, I''d say: great shot! Very surreal, almost spooky with the distortion and the high contrast the body and the dark water on the right. I''m interested to read how you did this, in terms of body of water, lighting, time of day, perspective, lens etc.<br/> <br/>Good luck with the challenge. I guess the shot may not be "nude enough" for some of the folks on here...<br/> <br/>Bruno</td>', 'If I was Beavis or Butthead, I''d say: "wow, big a$$, hu, huhu, chicks are so hot..."  ;-) As I''m not, I''d say: great shot! Very surreal, almost spooky with the distortion and the high contrast the body and the dark water on the right. I''m interested to read how you did this, in terms of body of water, lighting, time of day, perspective, lens etc. Good luck with the challenge. I guess the shot may not be "nude enough" for some of the folks on here... Bruno', '2005-08-27 01:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649044, 221066, 37961, '<td valign="top">She needs to relax a little doesnt she? Probably all you could get out of your model Im guessing. Funny.</td>', 'She needs to relax a little doesnt she? Probably all you could get out of your model Im guessing. Funny.', '2005-08-27 01:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
