(1649051, 221055, 37961, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny. But isnt that Red light district?</td>', 'Pretty funny. But isnt that Red light district?', '2005-08-27 01:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649060, 220844, 1796, '<td valign="top">Oh please, not ANOTHER uncreative use of selective desat. Sorry, but I''ve definitely seen too many of these on this site. Yours is about the 7th picture I rate and the third I comment on in this challenge. Sorry, I really don''t care for this too much. Composition is a bit lame, title even more so. The shot is technically weak, in my perception, either soft or pixelated or overcompressed.<br/> <br/>No offense, please, I''m just giving you my honest feedback. I don''t care for the "nice" comments that don''t tell me why people do or don''t like my shots, so I treat others'' work the same way.<br/> <br/>Bruno</td>', 'Oh please, not ANOTHER uncreative use of selective desat. Sorry, but I''ve definitely seen too many of these on this site. Yours is about the 7th picture I rate and the third I comment on in this challenge. Sorry, I really don''t care for this too much. Composition is a bit lame, title even more so. The shot is technically weak, in my perception, either soft or pixelated or overcompressed. No offense, please, I''m just giving you my honest feedback. I don''t care for the "nice" comments that don''t tell me why people do or don''t like my shots, so I treat others'' work the same way. Bruno', '2005-08-27 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649063, 220473, 9906, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the opening scene of Jaws.  As a photograph it''s a little too abstract for my taste though.  Thanks for your originality!<br/>TC</td>', 'This reminds me of the opening scene of Jaws.  As a photograph it''s a little too abstract for my taste though.  Thanks for your originality!TC', '2005-08-27 01:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649065, 219771, 1796, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t for the relatively un-prominent breasts, this could be a Dr. Jones... This way, I''d say it''s a pretty good fine arts type of shot. However, the composition could be better, a little more balanced in the subject-background ratio, maybe. If I''d had more foreground in the setup, I would have tried to play with the reflection a little more and maybe added a tad more light to her face, so at least her right eye was lit well.<br/> <br/>I give you an 8.<br/> <br/>Bruno</td>', 'If it wasn''t for the relatively un-prominent breasts, this could be a Dr. Jones... This way, I''d say it''s a pretty good fine arts type of shot. However, the composition could be better, a little more balanced in the subject-background ratio, maybe. If I''d had more foreground in the setup, I would have tried to play with the reflection a little more and maybe added a tad more light to her face, so at least her right eye was lit well. I give you an 8. Bruno', '2005-08-27 01:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649067, 220948, 9906, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of natural lighting.  Great pose to accentuate the curves of her body!  Wish there was a bit more reflection.  Nice b/w with a high key flavor because of the bright background.  Great work.  Hope this does well but afraid it will only be top 15 or 20 the way DPC scores tend to run.<br/>TC</td>', 'Beautiful use of natural lighting.  Great pose to accentuate the curves of her body!  Wish there was a bit more reflection.  Nice b/w with a high key flavor because of the bright background.  Great work.  Hope this does well but afraid it will only be top 15 or 20 the way DPC scores tend to run.TC', '2005-08-27 01:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649069, 219663, 1796, '<td valign="top">Technically not very convincing, rather dull-looking sepia shot. Good idea though and, to me, very much a "Birdy"-inspired shot. If it wasn''t for the western look and the solid wall background, this could be from Guantanamo...<br/> <br/>While he is nude, it doesn''t look like a nude shot to me. "Desperation" would be more like it as a challenge topic.<br/> <br/>Just a dude''s opinion who''s never even tried nude before, so don''t take it too hard  ;-)<br/> <br/>Bruno</td>', 'Technically not very convincing, rather dull-looking sepia shot. Good idea though and, to me, very much a "Birdy"-inspired shot. If it wasn''t for the western look and the solid wall background, this could be from Guantanamo... While he is nude, it doesn''t look like a nude shot to me. "Desperation" would be more like it as a challenge topic. Just a dude''s opinion who''s never even tried nude before, so don''t take it too hard  ;-) Bruno', '2005-08-27 01:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
