(1649072, 221246, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very unusual POV!  Love the tonality.  Not sure how I feel about where you put the focal point though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very unusual POV!  Love the tonality.  Not sure how I feel about where you put the focal point though...TC', '2005-08-27 01:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1649075, 219720, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL  From the thumbnail I thought this was supposed to be a guy peein'' into a drain! :-P  Your lighting is extremely harsh.  You used the onboard flash didn''t you.  If I were gonna try a shot like this I would try to position a tripod in the tub with the model, use the bathrooms natural lighting and hope for the best...  You wouldn''t catch the water in still life but you would have more depth.<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL  From the thumbnail I thought this was supposed to be a guy peein'' into a drain! :-P  Your lighting is extremely harsh.  You used the onboard flash didn''t you.  If I were gonna try a shot like this I would try to position a tripod in the tub with the model, use the bathrooms natural lighting and hope for the best...  You wouldn''t catch the water in still life but you would have more depth.TC', '2005-08-27 01:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
