(1650077, 220699, 10634, '<td valign="top">Might want to play with the brightness, contrast and saturation a bit... Maybe even B&amp;W or selective Desat. Got a bright spot on the left of the photo... looks like motion blur. Nice position and ex[ression, but for the title, I would have liked a warmer tone to imply the sun.</td>', 'Might want to play with the brightness, contrast and saturation a bit... Maybe even B&W or selective Desat. Got a bright spot on the left of the photo... looks like motion blur. Nice position and ex[ression, but for the title, I would have liked a warmer tone to imply the sun.', '2005-08-27 16:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
