(1650143, 220770, 10818, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a fairly or a nymph...its just such a cool photo.<br/> <br/>Excellent shot.</td>', 'Reminds me of a fairly or a nymph...its just such a cool photo. Excellent shot.', '2005-08-27 17:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
