(1650155, 221209, 15810, '<td valign="top">Great lighting has resulted in great skin tones ans a beautiful B&amp;W image. Well done.</td>', 'Great lighting has resulted in great skin tones ans a beautiful B&W image. Well done.', '2005-08-27 17:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650159, 221223, 15810, '<td valign="top">This is superb, the composition, exposure and the lighting have made this one of my top picks for the challenge. A very professional entry probably a ribbon. 10</td>', 'This is superb, the composition, exposure and the lighting have made this one of my top picks for the challenge. A very professional entry probably a ribbon. 10', '2005-08-27 17:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650165, 218235, 15810, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely done, the only thing that niggles is that if the model had pointe dher right foot i.e. toe to the floor it would have made a better line with her leg. Sligtly over exposed on the RHS (her left) great composition.</td>', 'This is very nicely done, the only thing that niggles is that if the model had pointe dher right foot i.e. toe to the floor it would have made a better line with her leg. Sligtly over exposed on the RHS (her left) great composition.', '2005-08-27 17:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650182, 221013, 40355, '<td valign="top">Clever and original.  Well done! 8</td>', 'Clever and original.  Well done! 8', '2005-08-27 17:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650196, 220725, 40355, '<td valign="top">LOL  This is great!  Wonderful idea and end product.  Totally unlike the other entries, this is original and witty.  Congratulations on a great job!  9</td>', 'LOL  This is great!  Wonderful idea and end product.  Totally unlike the other entries, this is original and witty.  Congratulations on a great job!  9', '2005-08-27 17:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650198, 221150, 40355, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too dark.  The model''s form is almost lost in the background, especially along the left side.  A touch more contrast might have helped.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too dark.  The model''s form is almost lost in the background, especially along the left side.  A touch more contrast might have helped.', '2005-08-27 17:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650204, 220902, 17507, '<td valign="top">while feet may technically be nude insofar as they are unclothed, I do not believe that this meets the challenge.</td>', 'while feet may technically be nude insofar as they are unclothed, I do not believe that this meets the challenge.', '2005-08-27 18:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650209, 221143, 17507, '<td valign="top">great placement of the light! way to show off flexibility in an artful manner. the barely lit silhouette is elegant. I would have liked a bit more room at the top, and possibly another fill light to get detail on the front of the body similar to what is shown on the back. still, this is very good - 7</td>', 'great placement of the light! way to show off flexibility in an artful manner. the barely lit silhouette is elegant. I would have liked a bit more room at the top, and possibly another fill light to get detail on the front of the body similar to what is shown on the back. still, this is very good - 7', '2005-08-27 18:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650212, 220306, 17507, '<td valign="top">mesmeraj? :)<br/>this is executed better than the Illusions entry, both in the manipulation of cloth and the lighting. the greys are pleasing. (7)</td>', 'mesmeraj? :)this is executed better than the Illusions entry, both in the manipulation of cloth and the lighting. the greys are pleasing. (7)', '2005-08-27 18:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650214, 220582, 17507, '<td valign="top">ah, an unenviable part of the female maintenance routine :)<br/>looks like an on-camera flash was used for this... not the best way to capture the human form (or just about anything else). I suggest that next time you try either natural light or at least something that''s not the camera''s built-in flash.</td>', 'ah, an unenviable part of the female maintenance routine :)looks like an on-camera flash was used for this... not the best way to capture the human form (or just about anything else). I suggest that next time you try either natural light or at least something that''s not the camera''s built-in flash.', '2005-08-27 18:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650216, 219322, 17507, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the theme. I have to say I like the scissors better than the cutout...</td>', 'interesting take on the theme. I have to say I like the scissors better than the cutout...', '2005-08-27 18:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650221, 221187, 17507, '<td valign="top">brave pose. crop is a bit too tight on the bottom, I think - show a bit more of the abdomen and get the background pure white and this would be a really great picture. the idea is solid and the model is attractive.</td>', 'brave pose. crop is a bit too tight on the bottom, I think - show a bit more of the abdomen and get the background pure white and this would be a really great picture. the idea is solid and the model is attractive.', '2005-08-27 18:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650225, 220382, 17507, '<td valign="top">very weird. I like it for its strangeness, and it definitely stands out. I''d have liked a bit more sharpness, and maybe a crop or slight compositional change that didn''t result in a pure black spot in the UL. and while the models are presumably nude (at least from the waist up), I don''t feel like this really fits the spirit of the nude challenge. If a reshoot is possible, I''d love to see how it comes out--your models look great and they complement each other well.</td>', 'very weird. I like it for its strangeness, and it definitely stands out. I''d have liked a bit more sharpness, and maybe a crop or slight compositional change that didn''t result in a pure black spot in the UL. and while the models are presumably nude (at least from the waist up), I don''t feel like this really fits the spirit of the nude challenge. If a reshoot is possible, I''d love to see how it comes out--your models look great and they complement each other well.', '2005-08-27 18:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650228, 221114, 17507, '<td valign="top">great idea. I wish I could see *some* detail on the figure--maybe a small fill light to at least lighten the grey and make the outline stand out more against the dark background.</td>', 'great idea. I wish I could see *some* detail on the figure--maybe a small fill light to at least lighten the grey and make the outline stand out more against the dark background.', '2005-08-27 18:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650230, 220298, 17507, '<td valign="top">good lighting, nice pose, attractive model.</td>', 'good lighting, nice pose, attractive model.', '2005-08-27 18:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650231, 221147, 17507, '<td valign="top">very cute :)</td>', 'very cute :)', '2005-08-27 18:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
