(1650334, 221249, 43254, '<td valign="top">Looks like an object straight out of Sims 2 or something, so plastic-y :) I like the achieved effect.</td>', 'Looks like an object straight out of Sims 2 or something, so plastic-y :) I like the achieved effect.', '2005-08-27 19:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
