(1650607, 219663, 30625, '<td valign="top">Very well executed good use of light source and the tonal range is just wonderful. The crop might just be too tight. (9)</td>', 'Very well executed good use of light source and the tonal range is just wonderful. The crop might just be too tight. (9)', '2005-08-27 21:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
