(1650610, 221091, 30625, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh man you have some rubber duckies. The little blue one is just too cute.</td>', 'This made me laugh man you have some rubber duckies. The little blue one is just too cute.', '2005-08-27 21:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650611, 219764, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Background is a bit distracting and focus should, IMO, be on the eyes, even in reflection. You also might try cropping a bit off the bottom. Nice job though.</td>', 'Great concept. Background is a bit distracting and focus should, IMO, be on the eyes, even in reflection. You also might try cropping a bit off the bottom. Nice job though.', '2005-08-27 21:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650612, 221249, 30625, '<td valign="top">Wow this feels so surreal. Like she is a computer animated figure. I hope you do well with this one the concept is definetly unique. (10)</td>', 'Wow this feels so surreal. Like she is a computer animated figure. I hope you do well with this one the concept is definetly unique. (10)', '2005-08-27 21:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650614, 220974, 30625, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and use of lighting. The pose is just makes you turn your head side to side. Looks like a knee at one point but as you look back you can see the figure. Good excution. (10)</td>', 'Excellent composition and use of lighting. The pose is just makes you turn your head side to side. Looks like a knee at one point but as you look back you can see the figure. Good excution. (10)', '2005-08-27 21:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650616, 218963, 30625, '<td valign="top">Bam and it just hit me in the face. This is exactly what happened from voting one pic to the next. I just dont like the back ground I think a black background would have given you something more with contours and curves of the rare end. I like the use of the light also. Well done. (8)</td>', 'Bam and it just hit me in the face. This is exactly what happened from voting one pic to the next. I just dont like the back ground I think a black background would have given you something more with contours and curves of the rare end. I like the use of the light also. Well done. (8)', '2005-08-27 21:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650620, 220389, 30625, '<td valign="top">wow you can really see the muscular features which is contributed by the excellent use of light and positioning of the subject. The pose reminds me of the something from Greek Methology. Well done. (10)</td>', 'wow you can really see the muscular features which is contributed by the excellent use of light and positioning of the subject. The pose reminds me of the something from Greek Methology. Well done. (10)', '2005-08-27 21:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
