(1650624, 218235, 30625, '<td valign="top">I would have left out the negative space. I think the composition of the pose would have made a good compositional shot. I like the tonal range and it would have been enhanced better if it was zoomed in closer. (8)</td>', 'I would have left out the negative space. I think the composition of the pose would have made a good compositional shot. I like the tonal range and it would have been enhanced better if it was zoomed in closer. (8)', '2005-08-27 21:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
