(1650754, 218617, 35444, '<td valign="top">I love how this picture tells a story.  The tones are very nice.  I could see this used for an advertisement.  Bumping up!</td>', 'I love how this picture tells a story.  The tones are very nice.  I could see this used for an advertisement.  Bumping up!', '2005-08-27 23:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
