(1650871, 221186, 7485, '<td valign="top">Your homage to the old masters is admirable. I bet that took a lot of very careful posing and light adjusting! It may be my monitor, but the highlight on her thigh seems to have a warmer tone than any other part of the image (which would mean this isn''t a duotone). Also, the transition into shadow seems a little too rapid, maybe the result of over-adjustment of curves? But I realize just how hard this is, you should be proud of what you have accomplished. 8</td>', 'Your homage to the old masters is admirable. I bet that took a lot of very careful posing and light adjusting! It may be my monitor, but the highlight on her thigh seems to have a warmer tone than any other part of the image (which would mean this isn''t a duotone). Also, the transition into shadow seems a little too rapid, maybe the result of over-adjustment of curves? But I realize just how hard this is, you should be proud of what you have accomplished. 8', '2005-08-28 00:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1650874, 218235, 17507, '<td valign="top">this is really great, lovely model, pose, and staging. two nitpicks-<br/>1. hot spots on right hand and left shoulder.<br/>2. the right arm is placed where it is for obvious reasons, but the placement nonetheless looks awkward.</td>', 'this is really great, lovely model, pose, and staging. two nitpicks-1. hot spots on right hand and left shoulder.2. the right arm is placed where it is for obvious reasons, but the placement nonetheless looks awkward.', '2005-08-28 00:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
