(1650881, 219771, 17507, '<td valign="top">looks like the work of DrJOnes, though I wouldn''t say that I claim it is. The radial gradient in the background is well done and aids the eye flow through the picture nicely. Good dodging work on the eyes too.</td>', 'looks like the work of DrJOnes, though I wouldn''t say that I claim it is. The radial gradient in the background is well done and aids the eye flow through the picture nicely. Good dodging work on the eyes too.', '2005-08-28 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
