(1651097, 220473, 15810, '<td valign="top">Really like this unusual entry.</td>', 'Really like this unusual entry.', '2005-08-28 01:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651103, 218617, 15810, '<td valign="top">Love the feel of this shot and the high contrast duotone, this just looks great and I can see this as an advertisement poster for something. One of my top picks.  10</td>', 'Love the feel of this shot and the high contrast duotone, this just looks great and I can see this as an advertisement poster for something. One of my top picks.  10', '2005-08-28 01:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651105, 220945, 43280, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2005-08-28 01:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651106, 220146, 25571, '<td valign="top">Terrific effect. The mouvement of the model, under the fabric used is simply stunning. Control of the lighting is also very appealing, giving this picture lots warmth, making this picture into a romantic sexual fantasy. The composition is very inviting and at the same time, lets the mind wander. two things that i''d wish would be different: The small spot of the model''s right arm seems completly out of place and the sort of smothered black spot on the model''s stomach (probably due to a fabric malfunction) takes away from the whole body. Aside from that, this is my Blue Ribon pic. I hope this wins, it is absolutly stunning. Amazing work!  (i''d really love a little tutorial as to how it was done!!)</td>', 'Terrific effect. The mouvement of the model, under the fabric used is simply stunning. Control of the lighting is also very appealing, giving this picture lots warmth, making this picture into a romantic sexual fantasy. The composition is very inviting and at the same time, lets the mind wander. two things that i''d wish would be different: The small spot of the model''s right arm seems completly out of place and the sort of smothered black spot on the model''s stomach (probably due to a fabric malfunction) takes away from the whole body. Aside from that, this is my Blue Ribon pic. I hope this wins, it is absolutly stunning. Amazing work!  (i''d really love a little tutorial as to how it was done!!)', '2005-08-28 01:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651115, 220948, 38911, '<td valign="top">A beautiful capture!  A natural 10!</td>', 'A beautiful capture!  A natural 10!', '2005-08-28 02:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651155, 220267, 10261, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a less aggressive crop. This picture presents a fraction of what looks like it is probably a rather dynamic pose; however, the frame restricts my field of vision so much that the image is almost reminiscent of the Venus de Milo. Rendering this using a silhouette or fig leaf may have done a better job of preserving the fluidity of the pose.</td>', 'I would have preferred a less aggressive crop. This picture presents a fraction of what looks like it is probably a rather dynamic pose; however, the frame restricts my field of vision so much that the image is almost reminiscent of the Venus de Milo. Rendering this using a silhouette or fig leaf may have done a better job of preserving the fluidity of the pose.', '2005-08-28 03:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651166, 221083, 10261, '<td valign="top">The strong light in the bottom right and the shiny rings on the model''s fingers are a bit distracting (to the extent that an image featuring a topless woman can have anything distracting). Something about the soft focus looks off - almost as though it was done by dodging, burning and cloning in Photoshop.</td>', 'The strong light in the bottom right and the shiny rings on the model''s fingers are a bit distracting (to the extent that an image featuring a topless woman can have anything distracting). Something about the soft focus looks off - almost as though it was done by dodging, burning and cloning in Photoshop.', '2005-08-28 03:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651167, 220974, 39880, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.  It looks just a bit too dark.</td>', 'Not a bad shot.  It looks just a bit too dark.', '2005-08-28 03:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651169, 221151, 39880, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Lighting makes it work.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Lighting makes it work.', '2005-08-28 03:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651171, 220146, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice colors, nice lighting.', '2005-08-28 03:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651173, 220699, 39880, '<td valign="top">An all around good shot.</td>', 'An all around good shot.', '2005-08-28 03:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651174, 220988, 10261, '<td valign="top">The model''s face looks slightly fake, as though it''s been retouched slightly too much in Photoshop. I would have preferred a slightly deeper DoF.</td>', 'The model''s face looks slightly fake, as though it''s been retouched slightly too much in Photoshop. I would have preferred a slightly deeper DoF.', '2005-08-28 03:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651182, 220689, 10261, '<td valign="top">Without the context afforded by the challenge I''d dismiss this as a bad photo; I maintain that the composition could stand some improvement, but aside from the hot spots on the hand I can''t identify anything in particular at the moment. Nice job of letting the viewer fill in the missing details.</td>', 'Without the context afforded by the challenge I''d dismiss this as a bad photo; I maintain that the composition could stand some improvement, but aside from the hot spots on the hand I can''t identify anything in particular at the moment. Nice job of letting the viewer fill in the missing details.', '2005-08-28 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651183, 219696, 21816, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the skin! Would of liked to have seen a little more on her back. The blinds could have been a little straighter. Nice model though and good effort but had to mark it down a tad for this.</td>', 'I like the lighting on the skin! Would of liked to have seen a little more on her back. The blinds could have been a little straighter. Nice model though and good effort but had to mark it down a tad for this.', '2005-08-28 03:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651184, 221223, 21816, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the pedestal she is sitting on is a bit blown out. Nice model and pose though. Well done!</td>', 'It''s a shame the pedestal she is sitting on is a bit blown out. Nice model and pose though. Well done!', '2005-08-28 03:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651186, 218406, 21816, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this photo. Very soft feel to it. Well done.</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this photo. Very soft feel to it. Well done.', '2005-08-28 03:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651188, 220275, 21816, '<td valign="top">Something about the lighting let''s this down a tad. The idea is fantastic. Nice model. Well done!</td>', 'Something about the lighting let''s this down a tad. The idea is fantastic. Nice model. Well done!', '2005-08-28 03:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651191, 221147, 21816, '<td valign="top">The kitty cat looks very curious about something there?? hehehe....well done!</td>', 'The kitty cat looks very curious about something there?? hehehe....well done!', '2005-08-28 03:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651194, 220974, 10261, '<td valign="top">I love the pose: the crouched position and the framing both add interesting visual tension which contrasts nicely with the vulnerability of the nudity. The B&amp;W do a nice job of bringing out the tonal range of the image, but I''d be interested in seeing a warm duo tone version. The fact that the model''s hands are balled into fists seems a touch odd (based on her position, I''d expect to see her face resting in her palms with her fingers curled slightly around her forehead); since the scene appears to be so well orchestrated I''m inclined to believe that I''m missing the significance of this aspect of the pose. This is easily my favorite entry in the challenge so far.</td>', 'I love the pose: the crouched position and the framing both add interesting visual tension which contrasts nicely with the vulnerability of the nudity. The B&W do a nice job of bringing out the tonal range of the image, but I''d be interested in seeing a warm duo tone version. The fact that the model''s hands are balled into fists seems a touch odd (based on her position, I''d expect to see her face resting in her palms with her fingers curled slightly around her forehead); since the scene appears to be so well orchestrated I''m inclined to believe that I''m missing the significance of this aspect of the pose. This is easily my favorite entry in the challenge so far.', '2005-08-28 03:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651195, 220001, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image seems a touch too minimalistic. A more effective shot for your title might have been to see the apple with a bite taken out of it being clutched to her chest.</td>', 'This image seems a touch too minimalistic. A more effective shot for your title might have been to see the apple with a bite taken out of it being clutched to her chest.', '2005-08-28 03:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651197, 220702, 10261, '<td valign="top">There''s obviously a story being portrayed here, but I feel like I''m missing a large part of it. I can''t identify the two bright white spots on the wall above the nude figure, and as such I''m unsure whether they''re distractors or clues about the scene.</td>', 'There''s obviously a story being portrayed here, but I feel like I''m missing a large part of it. I can''t identify the two bright white spots on the wall above the nude figure, and as such I''m unsure whether they''re distractors or clues about the scene.', '2005-08-28 03:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651205, 220679, 10261, '<td valign="top">The fact that the woman''s making eye contact with the camera gives the photo an intimate feeling which contrasts with the self-conscious placement of the hands. Looking dreamily away from the camera or finding a more natural-looking way of holding your hands would have improved the image. Shining a light at the back of the model''s head would help to add balance to the scene''s light.</td>', 'The fact that the woman''s making eye contact with the camera gives the photo an intimate feeling which contrasts with the self-conscious placement of the hands. Looking dreamily away from the camera or finding a more natural-looking way of holding your hands would have improved the image. Shining a light at the back of the model''s head would help to add balance to the scene''s light.', '2005-08-28 03:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651209, 220383, 10261, '<td valign="top">Your model has rather scaly looking skin; you might suggest that they apply lotion a few hours before they arrive for the shoot. Removing the stick that''s close to your model''s foot would have improved the shot. The head-down, diagonal placement within the frame adds an element of visual tension which, while effective, seems in need of a subtle complement (e.g. a diagonal element crossing underneath the head) to underscore the tension.</td>', 'Your model has rather scaly looking skin; you might suggest that they apply lotion a few hours before they arrive for the shoot. Removing the stick that''s close to your model''s foot would have improved the shot. The head-down, diagonal placement within the frame adds an element of visual tension which, while effective, seems in need of a subtle complement (e.g. a diagonal element crossing underneath the head) to underscore the tension.', '2005-08-28 03:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651213, 221114, 10261, '<td valign="top">The composition is well balanced, but the lighting doesn''t create adequate separation between your model''s head and the tree in the background. Omitting the ferns (or moving them to the foreground, behind the model) and moving the camera so that the model occupies the bottom 2/3rds of right corner and the tree fills the top 2/3rds of the left corner would preserve the balance and eliminate the appearance of having a tree growing from her head. Nice use of B&amp;W to highlight the textures.</td>', 'The composition is well balanced, but the lighting doesn''t create adequate separation between your model''s head and the tree in the background. Omitting the ferns (or moving them to the foreground, behind the model) and moving the camera so that the model occupies the bottom 2/3rds of right corner and the tree fills the top 2/3rds of the left corner would preserve the balance and eliminate the appearance of having a tree growing from her head. Nice use of B&W to highlight the textures.', '2005-08-28 04:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651220, 221052, 10261, '<td valign="top">I''m not interested in looking at male torsos as such; this would be a stronger image if the composition itself were a bit more interesting. Even tilting the camera 10 degrees when taking this photo may have added an interesting dynamic. Your model should remove his underwear at least 10 minutes prior to the shoot to allow the impressions that they leave on the skin time to disappear.</td>', 'I''m not interested in looking at male torsos as such; this would be a stronger image if the composition itself were a bit more interesting. Even tilting the camera 10 degrees when taking this photo may have added an interesting dynamic. Your model should remove his underwear at least 10 minutes prior to the shoot to allow the impressions that they leave on the skin time to disappear.', '2005-08-28 04:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651227, 221241, 10261, '<td valign="top">The bright red lipstick steals attention from the image as a whole. The crop is a bit more aggressive than I would like. Moving your model a bit further from the wall will help to reduce the appearance of shadows behind her.</td>', 'The bright red lipstick steals attention from the image as a whole. The crop is a bit more aggressive than I would like. Moving your model a bit further from the wall will help to reduce the appearance of shadows behind her.', '2005-08-28 04:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651233, 220725, 10261, '<td valign="top">I love the lawyer''s name. The scene is a little busy, but I suppose that it may have been necessary to convey the desired waiting room atmosphere. The sticks in the bouquet which occlude the diploma are distracting.</td>', 'I love the lawyer''s name. The scene is a little busy, but I suppose that it may have been necessary to convey the desired waiting room atmosphere. The sticks in the bouquet which occlude the diploma are distracting.', '2005-08-28 04:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651242, 220472, 10261, '<td valign="top">The item with the sharpest focus is the blanket. I assume that your title is not referring to the cloth, so replacing it with less distracting fabric &amp;/or altering the focus would improve the image. I don''t care for the border.</td>', 'The item with the sharpest focus is the blanket. I assume that your title is not referring to the cloth, so replacing it with less distracting fabric &/or altering the focus would improve the image. I don''t care for the border.', '2005-08-28 04:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651256, 221145, 10261, '<td valign="top">The light on the model''s node and fingertips seems a bit too hot. The missing fingertips on her left hand are distracting. I like the pose, but the visual impact would be stronger if her position was more symmetrical; the angle of her right foot is the only major thing throwing off the balance. Nicely shot; this is one of my highest rated images of the challenge so far.</td>', 'The light on the model''s node and fingertips seems a bit too hot. The missing fingertips on her left hand are distracting. I like the pose, but the visual impact would be stronger if her position was more symmetrical; the angle of her right foot is the only major thing throwing off the balance. Nicely shot; this is one of my highest rated images of the challenge so far.', '2005-08-28 04:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651260, 220075, 42303, '<td valign="top">Cool and unusual theme, appropriately normal!</td>', 'Cool and unusual theme, appropriately normal!', '2005-08-28 04:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651261, 219673, 10261, '<td valign="top">I think that the composition would be better if the model exhibited better posture.</td>', 'I think that the composition would be better if the model exhibited better posture.', '2005-08-28 04:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651268, 220725, 42303, '<td valign="top">Wow! Wherever did you find this book?</td>', 'Wow! Wherever did you find this book?', '2005-08-28 04:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651275, 220166, 42303, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shape and colors. Want to hang this on my wall.</td>', 'Very beautiful shape and colors. Want to hang this on my wall.', '2005-08-28 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651279, 220702, 42303, '<td valign="top">The spotlights and the lady''s dress look out of place but that is nitpicking. Looks like a scene from a couple of centuries ago. Great work!</td>', 'The spotlights and the lady''s dress look out of place but that is nitpicking. Looks like a scene from a couple of centuries ago. Great work!', '2005-08-28 04:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651283, 220982, 42303, '<td valign="top">Wow! Is this glycerine too?</td>', 'Wow! Is this glycerine too?', '2005-08-28 04:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651284, 220473, 10261, '<td valign="top">The water seems to be distorting the model''s figure in odd ways. I like the refraction patterns of the water, but I''d prefer a shot with less of a funhouse-mirror effect on the model.<br/> <br/>This shot reminds me of jmoore''s <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=192205" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Venus</a> from the Fantasy World challenge, but that may just be because I haven''t seen many pictures of nude women underwater with their faces obscured.</td>', 'The water seems to be distorting the model''s figure in odd ways. I like the refraction patterns of the water, but I''d prefer a shot with less of a funhouse-mirror effect on the model. This shot reminds me of jmoore''s Venus from the Fantasy World challenge, but that may just be because I haven''t seen many pictures of nude women underwater with their faces obscured.', '2005-08-28 04:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651286, 218831, 42303, '<td valign="top">hmm... How widely can one define "nude"? But I guess this fruit can always be let in (no pun)!</td>', 'hmm... How widely can one define "nude"? But I guess this fruit can always be let in (no pun)!', '2005-08-28 04:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651287, 221242, 10261, '<td valign="top">Of all the sports to participate in while naked, this seems like one of the less pleasant options. The monochrome does a nice job of highlighting the texture differences, but it would benefit from adjusting the curves / contrast.</td>', 'Of all the sports to participate in while naked, this seems like one of the less pleasant options. The monochrome does a nice job of highlighting the texture differences, but it would benefit from adjusting the curves / contrast.', '2005-08-28 04:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651289, 219696, 42303, '<td valign="top">Looks so natural. Was this was made with natural  light?</td>', 'Looks so natural. Was this was made with natural  light?', '2005-08-28 04:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651291, 220108, 42303, '<td valign="top">Picture looks a little too soft.</td>', 'Picture looks a little too soft.', '2005-08-28 04:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651292, 220336, 10261, '<td valign="top">Something about this pose looks contrived. I''d like the image better if the pose seemed more natural. Since the tones in this picture are all so close to a smooth grey you might have been better off submitting the color version of this shot. In any case, adjusting the curves / contrast could give this image an added kick. Since this is a nudes challenge, entering a model dressed in a rather conservative two-piece will generally be less-well received than more overt nudity.</td>', 'Something about this pose looks contrived. I''d like the image better if the pose seemed more natural. Since the tones in this picture are all so close to a smooth grey you might have been better off submitting the color version of this shot. In any case, adjusting the curves / contrast could give this image an added kick. Since this is a nudes challenge, entering a model dressed in a rather conservative two-piece will generally be less-well received than more overt nudity.', '2005-08-28 04:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651294, 221087, 42303, '<td valign="top">So would this be the south pole? Doesn''t look so cold to me!</td>', 'So would this be the south pole? Doesn''t look so cold to me!', '2005-08-28 05:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651297, 218617, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, moody shot, but it doesn''t seem like an especially strong entry in a nude challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice, moody shot, but it doesn''t seem like an especially strong entry in a nude challenge.', '2005-08-28 05:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651311, 220784, 10261, '<td valign="top">There are several minor things which you could do to move this good photo up a few notches.<br/>- Watch the edges of the frame; the model''s fingertips are cut off and the edge of her pants/shirt are visible.<br/>- Use only backgrounds which complement the subject. The lace background is busy enough to draw my attention but doesn''t contrast strongly enough to complement the smooth texture of the skin.<br/>I''m not sure how well I like the jewelry in the picture, but I think that the navel would be easier to identify if it weren''t so covered up.</td>', 'There are several minor things which you could do to move this good photo up a few notches.- Watch the edges of the frame; the model''s fingertips are cut off and the edge of her pants/shirt are visible.- Use only backgrounds which complement the subject. The lace background is busy enough to draw my attention but doesn''t contrast strongly enough to complement the smooth texture of the skin.I''m not sure how well I like the jewelry in the picture, but I think that the navel would be easier to identify if it weren''t so covered up.', '2005-08-28 05:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651314, 220663, 10261, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the warm, soft skin and sheets contrasts nicely with the cold, hard chain. Although this contrast is interesting, the picture suggests no clear reason for the chain''s presence, which I think reduces the impact somewhat. I think that the image would be stronger if the end of the chain weren''t visible.</td>', 'The contrast between the warm, soft skin and sheets contrasts nicely with the cold, hard chain. Although this contrast is interesting, the picture suggests no clear reason for the chain''s presence, which I think reduces the impact somewhat. I think that the image would be stronger if the end of the chain weren''t visible.', '2005-08-28 05:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651316, 219237, 10261, '<td valign="top">Your model looks a little stiff; you should try to get her to relax a bit more. The crop is a little bit too close for my liking, and the white stripe along the left side looks like a gap created by rotating the picture slightly after you cropped it.</td>', 'Your model looks a little stiff; you should try to get her to relax a bit more. The crop is a little bit too close for my liking, and the white stripe along the left side looks like a gap created by rotating the picture slightly after you cropped it.', '2005-08-28 05:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651317, 220679, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very brave, not just on the model''s part, but also on the photographer''s, because it does not even attempt to be a typical ''artistic'' nude pose (you know the kind; with the dramatically extended limbs and the artfully twisted torso - I believe painters call it a ''figure study'').  Anyway, to return to YOUR work, I''d call it a success.  Unpretentious but nonetheless very effective.  The shirt gives it purpose and interest, while the model''s slightly reticent and barely visible facial expression gives it charm.   9</td>', 'This is very brave, not just on the model''s part, but also on the photographer''s, because it does not even attempt to be a typical ''artistic'' nude pose (you know the kind; with the dramatically extended limbs and the artfully twisted torso - I believe painters call it a ''figure study'').  Anyway, to return to YOUR work, I''d call it a success.  Unpretentious but nonetheless very effective.  The shirt gives it purpose and interest, while the model''s slightly reticent and barely visible facial expression gives it charm.   9', '2005-08-28 05:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651319, 220969, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image looks a little flat. Stronger directional light or adding items to the composition (e.g. beads of water clinging to the skin) would have added interest.</td>', 'This image looks a little flat. Stronger directional light or adding items to the composition (e.g. beads of water clinging to the skin) would have added interest.', '2005-08-28 05:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651322, 219771, 30364, '<td valign="top">A technically masterful but alas conceptually cheesy nude study.  Fabulous lighting and really superb photography in every respect but one; I just can''t get past that bad taste factor.  7</td>', 'A technically masterful but alas conceptually cheesy nude study.  Fabulous lighting and really superb photography in every respect but one; I just can''t get past that bad taste factor.  7', '2005-08-28 05:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651323, 219696, 10261, '<td valign="top">The crop seems a little too aggressive at the bottom and right edges. The strong horizontal lines in the blinds reveal that the camera wasn''t level. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=21" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">This</a> tutorial explains how to fix uneven horizons. Good job on the lighting.</td>', 'The crop seems a little too aggressive at the bottom and right edges. The strong horizontal lines in the blinds reveal that the camera wasn''t level. This tutorial explains how to fix uneven horizons. Good job on the lighting.', '2005-08-28 05:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651325, 220496, 10261, '<td valign="top">This photograph would be stronger if the top edge of the model''s lips weren''t cut off by the edge of the frame.</td>', 'This photograph would be stronger if the top edge of the model''s lips weren''t cut off by the edge of the frame.', '2005-08-28 05:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651326, 219663, 10261, '<td valign="top">This would be a more emotive photograph if the look on the man''s face were a bit more intense &amp;/or distinct. Based only on his facial expression I can''t rule out the possibility that he''s been photographed while beginning to yawn. A visible source of his emotion (e.g. a stack of bills, a fallen telephone receiver, etc.) would also increase the impact. Higher contrast and perhaps a bit of burning / darkening would also help to improve this image.</td>', 'This would be a more emotive photograph if the look on the man''s face were a bit more intense &/or distinct. Based only on his facial expression I can''t rule out the possibility that he''s been photographed while beginning to yawn. A visible source of his emotion (e.g. a stack of bills, a fallen telephone receiver, etc.) would also increase the impact. Higher contrast and perhaps a bit of burning / darkening would also help to improve this image.', '2005-08-28 05:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1651385, 221138, 30896, '<td valign="top">i love the color and softness...</td>', 'i love the color and softness...', '2005-08-28 07:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
