(1651585, 221145, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  The fact that she ha her albows locked in hyperextension takes away from the shot in my opinion.   I think it would look better if her elbows were slightly bent instead.  I like the grainy fel to the image.  Focus does seem a tad off though.</td>', 'Interesting image.  The fact that she ha her albows locked in hyperextension takes away from the shot in my opinion.   I think it would look better if her elbows were slightly bent instead.  I like the grainy fel to the image.  Focus does seem a tad off though.', '2005-08-28 12:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
