(1652041, 220988, 19311, '<td valign="top">Very sexy and playfull image.  The focus could stand to be a little sharper on her eyes.  It looks like it focused on the top of her hair.  Still a great image and one of the better in this challenge. 9</td>', 'Very sexy and playfull image.  The focus could stand to be a little sharper on her eyes.  It looks like it focused on the top of her hair.  Still a great image and one of the better in this challenge. 9', '2005-08-28 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652043, 220974, 4008, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones in this image, good use of shadow. I also like the simple pose which creates an almost abstract form, emphasis is on the body shape, not on the nudeness. Somehow it works. Very good. In my top 3.</td>', 'I really like the tones in this image, good use of shadow. I also like the simple pose which creates an almost abstract form, emphasis is on the body shape, not on the nudeness. Somehow it works. Very good. In my top 3.', '2005-08-28 16:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
