(1652055, 219771, 4008, '<td valign="top">Welcome back, Bianca. Always a great subject. Unfortunately the image does not create any emotion with me, I find it rather sterile, a plastic look. Also the fingers on the left hand look extremely long in this position., angled towards the camera. ( Still compared to many other images in this challenge of course an outstanding image.)</td>', 'Welcome back, Bianca. Always a great subject. Unfortunately the image does not create any emotion with me, I find it rather sterile, a plastic look. Also the fingers on the left hand look extremely long in this position., angled towards the camera. ( Still compared to many other images in this challenge of course an outstanding image.)', '2005-08-28 16:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
