(1652215, 220382, 11800, '<td valign="top">Since you can''t answer any questions I have, I might make the wrong assumptions. Sorry if I do. It looks, to me, like this was taken in a wax musuem which is just acceptable to me as if they were real, but they just don''t look real. The netting caused some unfortunate consequenses on the image quality. Looks like front lighting was used. the ribbon in the upper right displays some motion blur. This would have been great if the lighting issues were resolved.<br/>Edit: Ah. bucket? The other one is far superior to this one, imo.</td>', 'Since you can''t answer any questions I have, I might make the wrong assumptions. Sorry if I do. It looks, to me, like this was taken in a wax musuem which is just acceptable to me as if they were real, but they just don''t look real. The netting caused some unfortunate consequenses on the image quality. Looks like front lighting was used. the ribbon in the upper right displays some motion blur. This would have been great if the lighting issues were resolved.Edit: Ah. bucket? The other one is far superior to this one, imo.', '2005-08-28 18:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
