(1652224, 219764, 37200, '<td valign="top">Using the mirror adds interest.  I think this would be better if you had some better lighting (kind of flat as is).  Also, not so tight a crop on the top.</td>', 'Using the mirror adds interest.  I think this would be better if you had some better lighting (kind of flat as is).  Also, not so tight a crop on the top.', '2005-08-28 18:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652230, 220784, 37200, '<td valign="top">Usually, I don''t like a greenish cast with skin-tones, but I like it with the rose and bit of stem.  A different color background would add a bit more separation between it and the model.  The dark patch in the upper-left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Usually, I don''t like a greenish cast with skin-tones, but I like it with the rose and bit of stem.  A different color background would add a bit more separation between it and the model.  The dark patch in the upper-left is a bit distracting.', '2005-08-28 18:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
