(1652547, 221150, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the model''s pose and the background. I also like the softness and close tone qualities, although I wonder what this would look like with a bit more contrast?</td>', 'I like the model''s pose and the background. I also like the softness and close tone qualities, although I wonder what this would look like with a bit more contrast?', '2005-08-28 20:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652549, 220374, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice tie (tee hee). Seriously though, I like it, but on my monitor the skin tone seems a bit too red (but it could be my screen).</td>', 'Nice tie (tee hee). Seriously though, I like it, but on my monitor the skin tone seems a bit too red (but it could be my screen).', '2005-08-28 20:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652552, 221150, 27562, '<td valign="top">With her thoughtful expression and vulnerable pose, your excellent image had potential to be one of the best of the challenge, but I just couldn''t get over the flatness of the image.  I would like to see this image post challenge with more contrast.  Good work.</td>', 'With her thoughtful expression and vulnerable pose, your excellent image had potential to be one of the best of the challenge, but I just couldn''t get over the flatness of the image.  I would like to see this image post challenge with more contrast.  Good work.', '2005-08-28 20:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652553, 220982, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the closeup and water droplets. I wonder what this would look like as a high contrast black &amp; white?</td>', 'I like the closeup and water droplets. I wonder what this would look like as a high contrast black & white?', '2005-08-28 20:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652556, 221186, 41675, '<td valign="top">You''ve created some interesting visual curves and shadows. Bumping  a point up after a second look.</td>', 'You''ve created some interesting visual curves and shadows. Bumping  a point up after a second look.', '2005-08-28 20:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652573, 220948, 30625, '<td valign="top">Technically this is the best of the challenge. Very well excuted. The pose is just terrific. The reflection in the water just adds to the effect. I would liked to see the color version. (10)</td>', 'Technically this is the best of the challenge. Very well excuted. The pose is just terrific. The reflection in the water just adds to the effect. I would liked to see the color version. (10)', '2005-08-28 21:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652574, 220298, 30625, '<td valign="top">Excellent pose and use of light. I love the lenghty shadow. (10)</td>', 'Excellent pose and use of light. I love the lenghty shadow. (10)', '2005-08-28 21:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652575, 220770, 27562, '<td valign="top">My favorite image of the challenge.  Technically excellent image with beautiful tonality.  Subject is a beautiful woman with an expression &amp; posture that relays both vulnerability and silent strength.  IMO the best portrait I''ve seen in my 11 months on the DPC.  Great work.</td>', 'My favorite image of the challenge.  Technically excellent image with beautiful tonality.  Subject is a beautiful woman with an expression & posture that relays both vulnerability and silent strength.  IMO the best portrait I''ve seen in my 11 months on the DPC.  Great work.', '2005-08-28 21:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652615, 218865, 10261, '<td valign="top">Is that you, nico_blue? I find the necklace distracting, primarily because it''s several stops brighter than anything else. The eye at the corner of the frame draws my attention and makes me wonder what''s going on offscrean; in most cases this is a bad thing, but I think that it works to your advantage here. I think that the eye would have been a greater asset to this picture if the surrounding socket was visible, which would help to convey more emotional information; a stronger catchlight would have helped to.</td>', 'Is that you, nico_blue? I find the necklace distracting, primarily because it''s several stops brighter than anything else. The eye at the corner of the frame draws my attention and makes me wonder what''s going on offscrean; in most cases this is a bad thing, but I think that it works to your advantage here. I think that the eye would have been a greater asset to this picture if the surrounding socket was visible, which would help to convey more emotional information; a stronger catchlight would have helped to.', '2005-08-28 21:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652619, 220670, 22734, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and the hand position. I know, many folks complaint about the darkness but I appreciated it. How else can one one convey this mood? Bumping up.</td>', 'Love the angle and the hand position. I know, many folks complaint about the darkness but I appreciated it. How else can one one convey this mood? Bumping up.', '2005-08-28 21:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652621, 221151, 37961, '<td valign="top">Werewolf in London?</td>', 'Werewolf in London?', '2005-08-28 21:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652623, 221090, 37961, '<td valign="top">Caputured nicely. Nice to see some real breasts out there for a change! She is lovely.</td>', 'Caputured nicely. Nice to see some real breasts out there for a change! She is lovely.', '2005-08-28 21:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1652624, 221145, 37961, '<td valign="top">Great pose. Very Geometric. Nice.</td>', 'Great pose. Very Geometric. Nice.', '2005-08-28 21:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
