(1652630, 220389, 40819, '<td valign="top">This is just so good it leaves me speachless, but I had to say how much I appreciated the work in getting this before I lost the chance. Excet job. Love the color and light.</td>', 'This is just so good it leaves me speachless, but I had to say how much I appreciated the work in getting this before I lost the chance. Excet job. Love the color and light.', '2005-08-28 21:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
