(1653368, 221013, 34192, '<td valign="top">Shannon, I have to be honest with you.  I thought it was a man zipping a fat suit over a dress shirt.  So, your illusion worked too well!  The skin did not look like skin was my problem.  Maybe if you had left the imperfections in, the freckles and veins, I would have seen it for the wonderful illusion that it was.  Sorry!!!</td>', 'Shannon, I have to be honest with you.  I thought it was a man zipping a fat suit over a dress shirt.  So, your illusion worked too well!  The skin did not look like skin was my problem.  Maybe if you had left the imperfections in, the freckles and veins, I would have seen it for the wonderful illusion that it was.  Sorry!!!', '2005-08-29 01:28:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1653375, 218759, 17203, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, Nico! Let''s see here... you beat your personal best like you wanted to, so mission accomplished. In the process you knocked me out of first for that lens and second for the camera. So congratulations, ya'' bum! ;-P</td>', 'Fantastic shot, Nico! Let''s see here... you beat your personal best like you wanted to, so mission accomplished. In the process you knocked me out of first for that lens and second for the camera. So congratulations, ya'' bum! ;-P', '2005-08-29 01:29:04.000000', NULL, 0),
