(1654820, 220075, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m still laughing at not only the humor but your total nerve for doing it.  Hurray for you.  Now let''s all put on our clothes and leave out our shoes and photograph THEM!!!</td>', 'I''m still laughing at not only the humor but your total nerve for doing it.  Hurray for you.  Now let''s all put on our clothes and leave out our shoes and photograph THEM!!!', '2005-08-29 14:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1654827, 220267, 34217, '<td valign="top">This photo was my favorite of the bunch and I LOVE fine art nudes.  I think you should be more confident in your work.  This is unlike any I have seen and it is all about the moment.  Forget what eveyone says about crops and titles, this picture is simply amazing.  I gave it a ten and put it in my favorites.  I am shocked at what ranked higher and thought this should have been in the top three.  Some people just don''t appreciate a great capture.  Good job, and again it definatly does not suck!!!</td>', 'This photo was my favorite of the bunch and I LOVE fine art nudes.  I think you should be more confident in your work.  This is unlike any I have seen and it is all about the moment.  Forget what eveyone says about crops and titles, this picture is simply amazing.  I gave it a ten and put it in my favorites.  I am shocked at what ranked higher and thought this should have been in the top three.  Some people just don''t appreciate a great capture.  Good job, and again it definatly does not suck!!!', '2005-08-29 14:08:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1654841, 220382, 32754, '<td valign="top">I still feel this was one of the most interesting, creative images in the challenge..it was one of my top picks.</td>', 'I still feel this was one of the most interesting, creative images in the challenge..it was one of my top picks.', '2005-08-29 14:10:51.000000', NULL, 0),
