(1671882, 221256, 37544, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>I enjoy high key photos. I think that your photo needs more contrast on the legs though. They almost blend in with the background. The pose is ok IMO, but you need more practice with dodge and burn or cloning. It would have been helpful if you mentioned your process in the photographers comments. See how the legs look like areas are missing? And how there are dark splotches where there shouldn''t be? Overall the picture is too washed out. Good luck in future challenges.<br/> <br/>Mandy</td>', '*Critique Club* I enjoy high key photos. I think that your photo needs more contrast on the legs though. They almost blend in with the background. The pose is ok IMO, but you need more practice with dodge and burn or cloning. It would have been helpful if you mentioned your process in the photographers comments. See how the legs look like areas are missing? And how there are dark splotches where there shouldn''t be? Overall the picture is too washed out. Good luck in future challenges. Mandy', '2005-09-03 22:46:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1671906, 221083, 37544, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>I like the softness of the photo. She looks like she is taking a VERY HOT shower. I think that it would look better if she wasn''t clutching the breast that tight, and if she wasn''t wearing the rings. Overall, nice picture and good luck in future challenges.<br/> <br/>Mandy</td>', '*Critique Club* I like the softness of the photo. She looks like she is taking a VERY HOT shower. I think that it would look better if she wasn''t clutching the breast that tight, and if she wasn''t wearing the rings. Overall, nice picture and good luck in future challenges. Mandy', '2005-09-03 22:52:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1671930, 221241, 37544, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>This woman does have natural beauty, but your photo doesn''t portray it very well.  The pose looks unnatural. She looks very uncomfortable. I think that her hair shouldn''t have been tucked behind her ears. I am not sure why you cropped off the other breast either? Overall, the photo quality and the model are great IMO, but the pose and composition were your downfall. Good luck in future challenges, this one was very hard!<br/> <br/>Mandy</td>', '*Critique Club* This woman does have natural beauty, but your photo doesn''t portray it very well.  The pose looks unnatural. She looks very uncomfortable. I think that her hair shouldn''t have been tucked behind her ears. I am not sure why you cropped off the other breast either? Overall, the photo quality and the model are great IMO, but the pose and composition were your downfall. Good luck in future challenges, this one was very hard! Mandy', '2005-09-03 22:57:53.000000', NULL, 0),
