(1672738, 220945, 41531, '<td valign="top">i was pretty happy with my scores on my first challenge pic so thank you everyone and thank you for the helpful comments, i''m learning so much! Something that confused me a little is that when i posted this pic from my computer it was very dark with only the right breast visible through a shaft of light and when i read some of the comments i wondered why ppl were saying that her eyes appeared to be open if they couldn''t see them? So i looked at the pic on a friends computer and too my suprise it appeared completely different-the whole pic was light and my light shaft was non existant! Dunno if anyone can help me and tell me what happened, i''m not that computer literate to be able to understand how this happened?!</td>', 'i was pretty happy with my scores on my first challenge pic so thank you everyone and thank you for the helpful comments, i''m learning so much! Something that confused me a little is that when i posted this pic from my computer it was very dark with only the right breast visible through a shaft of light and when i read some of the comments i wondered why ppl were saying that her eyes appeared to be open if they couldn''t see them? So i looked at the pic on a friends computer and too my suprise it appeared completely different-the whole pic was light and my light shaft was non existant! Dunno if anyone can help me and tell me what happened, i''m not that computer literate to be able to understand how this happened?!', '2005-09-04 10:56:04.000000', NULL, 0),
