(1674987, 221209, 29168, '<td valign="top">One of only two tens in the Nude III challenge for me (or was it three?) I''m revisiting and surprised to see you down at 24th. <br/> <br/>What I most like about this shot is how it captures the real person. The freckles, skin tones, etc. are very well lit and exposed to my eye. It all seems much more natural/realistic than DPC voters at large seem to go for. Too much googling at fashion/glamour magazines maybe. <br/> <br/>The pose is excellent too. As for "watch the tan lines -- nah -- it ads to this shot IMO. <br/> <br/>Well done!<br/></td>', 'One of only two tens in the Nude III challenge for me (or was it three?) I''m revisiting and surprised to see you down at 24th.  What I most like about this shot is how it captures the real person. The freckles, skin tones, etc. are very well lit and exposed to my eye. It all seems much more natural/realistic than DPC voters at large seem to go for. Too much googling at fashion/glamour magazines maybe.  The pose is excellent too. As for "watch the tan lines -- nah -- it ads to this shot IMO.  Well done!', '2005-09-05 03:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
