(1891818, 221070, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a fantstic shot; wonderful cropping and texture to create a "medieval" or "at least "pre-christian" look. The pose is perfect; its reverent yet suggestive, This would be the way to "genuflect" for lack of a better term, to the pagan god: earth herself.<br/> <br/>What really is best here, besides the perfectly orchestrated nudity, is the way the top of the photo looks like a Pollock painting, with the white from behind the trees above the figures head seems to compete with the shadow in front, always leaving the viewer with the struggle to decide which is primary and in front. <br/>This is your best shot, its really great.</td>', 'This is a fantstic shot; wonderful cropping and texture to create a "medieval" or "at least "pre-christian" look. The pose is perfect; its reverent yet suggestive, This would be the way to "genuflect" for lack of a better term, to the pagan god: earth herself. What really is best here, besides the perfectly orchestrated nudity, is the way the top of the photo looks like a Pollock painting, with the white from behind the trees above the figures head seems to compete with the shadow in front, always leaving the viewer with the struggle to decide which is primary and in front. This is your best shot, its really great.', '2005-11-23 07:42:47.000000', NULL, 0),
